isten to and act upon your ideas about how we can help you if you need it.\n3\nListen to and work with the people who know you best and who you trust.\n4 Make sure we are always progressing towards your goals and aspirations.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 11, "split_idx_start": 5256, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "cd2207f1067d211f5a1bdd715bce9a8a47f45a9c60c32e6ca4d79a9284b95226", "range": [517, 707]}, {"doc_id": "1f44b47a4310452802a9261c29834541364d4af97cf55c1de03da458da9267a9", "range": [0, 74]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04085302725434303, -0.061114005744457245, -0.018493931740522385, 0.009977126494050026, 0.016520410776138306, 0.02262573502957821, -0.00950663723051548, -0.057591717690229416, -0.03716200590133667, 0.023976502940058708, 0.030666083097457886, -0.05731358751654625, 0.008401908911764622, -0.013989136554300785, -0.007999124936759472, -0.06030071899294853, 0.03349463269114494, 0.019672712311148643, -0.03332505002617836, 0.006894542835652828, -0.008947925642132759, 0.013792885467410088, -0.017768116667866707, 0.02676713466644287, 0.013834558427333832, -0.02185513637959957, 0.02652907185256481, 0.007601130288094282, 0.050128184258937836, -0.017478296533226967, 0.017397770658135414, -0.014025326818227768, -0.013376189395785332, 0.011578353121876717, 2.3198572307592258e-06, 0.02905389852821827, 0.029087776318192482, -0.03122492879629135, -0.0055030458606779575, -0.03551962599158287, -0.0789046362042427, 0.003255504881963134, 0.0423203743994236, 0.07918069511651993, -0.0037992626894265413, -0.0035481913946568966, -0.0009484532638452947, 0.03617075830698013, 0.043169379234313965, 0.0027351181488484144, -0.0033895429223775864, 0.039901234209537506, 0.027227340266108513, -0.034969449043273926, 0.02464043