 importance of goal-setting, staff support, inclusion in activities, and fostering a safe and empowering learning environment. It reflects the principles of good autism practice aimed at enhancing the educational experiences of autistic students.4 Make sure we are always progressing towards your goals and aspirations.\n5\nMake sure all staff know the best way to support you, both in and out of lessons.\n6\nHelp you to get involved and be included in the activities you wish to participate in.\n7\nWork together to set achievable goals that are important to you, and that help you see how well you are doing.\n8 Help you to feel safe, secure, empowered, and able to learn.\f", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 12, "split_idx_start": 5699, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "af1e764298136bc90efc9645f34d6209a7f0fac41b99de4c67b6ef5ea0cdcb1e", "range": [443, 517]}, {"doc_id": "035acc8f9784488bfbfeb4f2117e32210935f509d139d6d19d75a7fbc8196f29", "range": [0, 63]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.022401055321097374, -0.06205776333808899, -0.025276480242609978, 0.023297550156712532, 0.005662853829562664, 0.020867103710770607, -0.020401081070303917, -0.06295831501483917, -0.044059015810489655, 0.010417086072266102, 0.02814246527850628, -0.06793516129255295, 0.00844244472682476, 0.01699901558458805, -0.012883356772363186, -0.03462963551282883, 0.04426422342658043, 0.013085979968309402, -0.031007815152406693, -0.002273653168231249, -0.010486788116395473, 0.016818316653370857, -0.03827644884586334, 0.03855423629283905, 0.02637704834342003, -0.0012062814785167575, 0.011186636984348297, 0.010900303721427917, 0.05780349299311638, -0.0038620915729552507, 0.02843654714524746, -0.011065850965678692, -0.0191115140914917, -0.005348312668502331, 2.3500119