es.The following tables outline how the four themes, the Eight Principles of Good Autism Practice, the AET Schools Standards, and the AET Schools Competencies are interlinked.\fSchools Standards Framework8 Understanding the Individual\nPrinciple One: Understanding the strengths, interests, and needs of each autistic pupil.\nSTANDARDS COMPETENCIES\nS1. We are committed to developing knowledge about autism, and we gather information from a range of sources to fully understand the individual autistic pupil. S2. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 7, "split_id": 16, "split_idx_start": 8406, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "1eb6ede103efe81c775daae0c289e7f4cbf2089ee4aa91e650b012abe2669eee", "range": [738, 911]}, {"doc_id": "6da3c129636a7bd8890cd62fe080d6bf2a22e9bb5fe6086694425fbafbabba58", "range": [0, 4]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.023566214367747307, -0.09451019018888474, -0.015734704211354256, 0.010038814507424831, 0.003544233040884137, 0.03408091142773628, 0.006239523179829121, -0.053165920078754425, -0.08595407754182816, 0.02262153849005699, 0.014951813966035843, -0.07126486301422119, 0.04225347936153412, -0.008257010951638222, -2.021788532147184e-05, -0.06793566048145294, 0.0004390394897200167, 0.038027215749025345, -0.04162599518895149, 0.018497003242373466, 0.017617424950003624, 0.009608831256628036, -0.0060320389457046986, 0.02496412768959999, 0.0245033111423254, -0.005289558321237564, 0.02086360566318035, -0.000975427741650492, 0.04519882798194885, -0.05335530638694763, 0.03659450635313988, -0.0035696940030902624, 0.020323755219578743, -0.024532200768589973, 2.418780923107988e-06, 0.010365024209022522, -0.013005254790186882, -0.01720968633890152, 0.022854667156934738, -0.0077634211629629135, -0.06486795097589493, 0.0078594265505