edge about autism, as well as the commitment to ongoing professional development to improve practices for supporting autistic pupils.S8. We audit staff confidence levels, understanding and knowledge of autism, and the changes staff make to their practice as a result of undertaking professional development. C7. I engage in professional development that enables me to address the needs of autistic pupils and to enhance and embed inclusive practice.\nC8. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 9, "split_id": 25, "split_idx_start": 11552, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "7a7a0cbb5551f07ea4917c41afc42cd1b7cad4c6d1e1dabceb75d68f3d9cf41a", "range": [394, 398]}, {"doc_id": "f1e449375c75399db65c730d5790dabeea3452499dce3f5c4aa9c877052f41fc", "range": [0, 4]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.030370458960533142, -0.06651683896780014, -0.021390726789832115, 0.019030824303627014, -0.007049998734146357, 0.03479402884840965, 0.023042097687721252, -0.03568509966135025, -0.07206783443689346, 0.0038219201378524303, 0.026590514928102493, -0.050109751522541046, 0.0192618016153574, -0.010318652726709843, 0.028386514633893967, -0.04457668960094452, 0.046720076352357864, 0.03193666413426399, -0.025485588237643242, 0.027034927159547806, 0.004470260813832283, 0.008104520849883556, -0.025238296017050743, 0.035071782767772675, 0.014940442517399788, -0.03646153211593628, 0.0267985537648201, -0.003800872014835477, 0.012330476194620132, -0.047247856855392456, 0.03356559947133064, -0.016307668760418892, 0.02075083740055561, -0.01725383661687374, 2.009236595768016e-06, 0.018060872331261635, 0.004736941773444414, -0.004577150102704763, 0.001624664873816073, 0.01001038122922182, -0.04425852745771408, -0.002454302739351988, 0.03569350391626358, 0.059917666018009186, -0.010502871