s, and between staff and parents/carers. I work hard to address barriers to learning. This includes reducing the risk of social exclusion.\nPrinciple Six: An ethos and environment that fosters social inclusion for autistic pupils.\nSTANDARDS COMPETENCIES\nS11. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 10, "split_id": 29, "split_idx_start": 12801, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ccfe7222aa36a8338080085e507231ede129f75d42d36f6ada87915d6246aa6a", "range": [201, 372]}, {"doc_id": "0a92a45b85e60215d71a1c2815daf75fdd3d95e93466dbcfdd9479e9b9f22a57", "range": [0, 28]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04022762551903725, -0.11457674205303192, -0.010103575885295868, 0.031624358147382736, 0.03293965384364128, 0.018260322511196136, 0.03315837308764458, -0.04083000496029854, -0.042198240756988525, -0.008531901985406876, 0.019098149612545967, -0.08768735080957413, 0.012574036605656147, -0.020738057792186737, 0.009603512473404408, -0.04766008257865906, 0.04612812027335167, 0.05047469213604927, -0.027111852541565895, 0.00046245436533354223, -0.012129670940339565, 0.025241248309612274, -0.01038797665387392, 0.018570315092802048, 0.03595536947250366, -0.002331146039068699, 0.04010311886668205, 0.016983741894364357, 0.019939500838518143, -0.019231341779232025, 0.04352779686450958, -0.008088246919214725, 0.010526562109589577, 0.01287117414176464, 2.0351913008198608e-06, 0.005901572294533253, 0.025727035477757454, -0.031561244279146194, 0.015450267121195793, -0.028010806068778038, -0.07885134965181351, 0.013787783682346344, 0.040504664182662964, 0.07585705071687698, -0.0234928410500288, -0.011130202561616898, 0.005781160667538643, 0.024207981303334236, 0.028344279155135155, -0.014229261316359043, -0.01347353495657444, 0.033189646899700165, 0.007106810342520475, -0.