ngths and interests, whilst addressing skills and understanding that autistic pupils may find difficult as a result of their autism.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 11, "split_id": 33, "split_idx_start": 14222, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "bee799f38dd5f325509930b4a3a5f30c5ea1dff1af7bebaf7c1ce9c3fc5e53a8", "range": [441, 446]}, {"doc_id": "0c46d97c5222df324a47f2050af5d727657da3442b4c0ea7c863fbd673750ce1", "range": [0, 227]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03445739671587944, -0.07723594456911087, -0.011555302888154984, 0.00826482567936182, -0.015759574249386787, 0.04000048339366913, 0.004485741723328829, -0.07345026731491089, -0.08152888715267181, 0.024483609944581985, 0.00991501472890377, -0.05380113050341606, 0.019748738035559654, -0.025728726759552956, -0.009017791599035263, -0.05591956153512001, 0.03331863880157471, 0.011397873982787132, -0.04505693167448044, 0.015297375619411469, -0.01969582587480545, 0.007286692503839731, -0.03533003851771355, 0.03797454014420509, 0.02228994108736515, -0.02604258991777897, 0.009124735370278358, 0.0033881112467497587, 0.018994979560375214, -0.04912320151925087, 0.03520306199789047, 0.011364989914000034, -0.010844584554433823, 0.002398392651230097, 2.185722223657649e-06, -0.008487727493047714, -0.004461472854018211, -0.03311172500252724, -0.007139723747968674, 0.023935699835419655, -0.049999840557575226, 0.03497540205717087, 0.04350636899471283, 0.06613518297672272, -0.014441080391407013, -0.02723364718258381, -0.012079632841050625, 0.03138136491179466, 0.005796500016003847, -0.0007614229107275605, 0.0006217904156073928, 0.013307664543390274, 0.02706516906619072, -0.058444976806640625, -0.006385113578289747, -0.04645092785358429, 0.01957530900835991, -0.0908900573849678, 0.030483299866318703, 