o work on.\nSchools are encouraged to develop an action plan using the AET Schools Standards to review provision for autistic pupils and to prioritise areas of development, in line with the schools improvement focus plan.\nFor each standard, you should aim to collect: \u2022 Documentary evidence (e.g. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 11, "split_id": 37, "split_idx_start": 15422, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "e413c3702e269bd4a88b572f77818e5d060629e7db21d8733e4779c874faf261", "range": [245, 348]}, {"doc_id": "64df33514d4e3c7cacfa5c062628a3ad4a786f3f49a7ba649aad88171bcf0940", "range": [0, 75]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04351986199617386, -0.08372392505407333, -0.011447030119597912, 0.015548277646303177, 0.01895861327648163, 0.019502082839608192, -0.015513185411691666, -0.05081494525074959, -0.038091305643320084, 0.006455816328525543, 0.03158854693174362, -0.07063065469264984, 0.010281000286340714, 0.01998521201312542, -0.00048801759839989245, -0.0694253221154213, 0.03191167488694191, 0.044204503297805786, -0.02159808948636055, 0.008319237269461155, 0.016142968088388443, 0.024184420704841614, -0.0056710620410740376, 0.014086917042732239, 0.007772510871291161, -0.006057722959667444, 0.021619101986289024, 0.02885473519563675, 0.039926137775182724, -0.05252112075686455, 0.041193701326847076, -0.004616481717675924, -0.006358184386044741, -0.02734573557972908, 2.1717974050261546e-06, 0.017825793474912643, -0.00337686063721776, -0.032430149614810944, 0.018658043816685677, -0.01503002643585205, -0.07329398393630981, -0.013100598938763142, 0.01699766516685486, 0.057227831333875656, -0.012158514000475407, -0.016137784346938133, 0.0024782023392617702, 0.03749731928110123, 0.037487536668777466, 0.011775726452469826, -0.014619854278862476, 0