egies to enhance wellbeing and provides guidelines for documenting progress in this area.ROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nStaff implement individual strategies to reduce anxiety and enhance the wellbeing of children. ROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nLinks to statutory frameworks\nA detailed assessment of need should ensure that the full range of an individual\u2019s needs is identified, not simply the primary need. The support provided to an individual should always be based on a full understanding of their particular strengths and needs and seek to address them all (SEND Code of Practice, 2014:96).\fSchools Standards Framework17 Understanding the Individual\nHow do we document evidence of working on this standard? We document evidence of working on this standard through case studies, one page profiles, and the goals we co-produce with parents/carers and pupils (where possible), and by documenting our reasonable adjustments and the impact of those.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 16, "split_id": 46, "split_idx_start": 20400, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "64dc792296ffe36b1148f0c76de96bb6cf01917e9a0cb98eece1873e8a20d6e5", "range": [763, 913]}, {"doc_id": "b1d8529706cb8a845c2f570b86095261999eb2562bd8e61f64c5f820b7fe3dd1", "range": [0, 238]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.041853029280900955, -0.10156304389238358, -0.011666500940918922, 0.015993362292647362, 0.00861087441444397, 0.054056573659181595, 0.012760481797158718, -0.03078976646065712, -0.04496297985315323, 0.005980886053293943, 0.039406634867191315, -0.07300545275211334, 0.008066524751484394, -0.03925372287631035, 0.004771091043949127, -0.06046101823449135, 0.012489969842135906, 0.035925623029470444, -0.01120362151414156, 0.027