398337006568909, 0.028640788048505783, -0.007865539751946926, -0.012720858678221703, 0.020059997215867043, -0.041118547320365906, 0.025795213878154755, -0.0598490871489048, 0.1093311682343483, -0.015621348284184933, -0.0231177881360054, 0.011842414736747742, -0.07138023525476456, 0.019406985491514206, -0.015488265082240105, 0.056816600263118744, 0.036575522273778915, -0.016777420416474342, -0.010809104889631271, 0.021386131644248962, 0.02397192269563675, 0.0406445674598217, -0.012558283284306526, -0.002296647522598505, -0.028733566403388977, 0.01836501993238926, -0.05986901372671127, 0.07211904972791672, -0.0063133081421256065, -0.023715244606137276, -0.008044644258916378, 0.03262922912836075, -0.013129009865224361, -0.03338194638490677, -0.030152738094329834, 0.019576843827962875, 1.958212646762914e-34, -0.0001060647118720226, -0.013669250532984734, 0.033206548541784286, -0.05178041756153107, 0.021540185436606407, -0.016768431290984154, -0.028638437390327454, 0.010017507709562778, 0.004024721682071686, -0.029222380369901657, -0.022975614294409752], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "f0143183a66d0bc9cfc42be19b26def3150fbb8b7a501edc5c95a69d97880b9d", "content": "This chunk is located in the section discussing Standard Six of Principle Three: Collaboration with parents/carers and other professionals and services. It emphasizes the importance of employing a graduated approach in compliance with the SEND Code of Practice, highlighting the need for effective collaboration among professionals to support autistic pupils.ROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nWe follow the graduated approach in the SEND Code of Practice and are confident in collecting assess, plan, do, review evidence for submitting to external professionals.\nROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nWe bring together professionals within and beyond the setting in a multi-disciplinary approach and all staff are aware of the Team Around the Pupil. ROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nLinks to statutory frameworks\nTeacher Standards (2015), Standard 8: Teachers develop effective professional relationships with colleagues, knowing how and when to draw on advice and specialist support.\nNo single practitioner can have a full picture of a child\u2019s needs and circumstances. If children and families are to receive the right help at the right time, everyone who comes into contact with them has a role to play in identifying concerns, sharing information and taking prompt action (Keeping children safe in education, 2020:5).\f", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 25, "split_id": 57, "split_idx_start": 28402, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "1109e279a565019618fdc0ceaee9a24400d776db9730b2f237d6821445e9cad8", "range": [656, 881]}, {"doc_id": "2beadd34f78fc495306f5bcde2a53e20dc8b531d024894a0a58130b2e6a32b73", "range": [0, 251]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04509101063013077, -0.10675103962421417, -0.0017310862895101309, 0.010072393342852592, -0.01404581032693386, 0.03954062610864639, 0.046296849846839905, -0.02021561563014984, -0.05778036266565323, 0.010333300568163395, 0.04376102238893509, -0.07426398992538452, 0.04377960041165352, -0.002233127597719431, 0.011261224746704102, -0.05088034272193909, 0.03099997341632843, 0.03642040491104126, -0.0491793267428875, 0.02091311290860176, -0.017894793301820755, -0.007714905776083469, -0.026369811967015266, 0.011390144005417824, 0.001680473331362009, -0.018010523170232773, -0.0024329565931111574, 0.011791089549660683, 0.006202790420502424, -0.015276244841516018, 0.04396265000104904, 0.02063983492553234, -0.015993954613804817, -0.031001262366771698, 2.24058453568432e-06, 0.038137286901474, 0.016892727464437485, -0.02223258465528488, 0.006731524597853422, -0