.\nROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nExamples of how we can do this:\nWe recognise the importance of high-quality professional development in the education of autistic pupils. As knowledge is continuously being developed, there is a need to regularly update the knowledge, skills, and practice of the educational workforce. ROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nOur setting empowers and supports staff to share, learn, and develop knowledge and skills in order to develop greater understanding of autism and common co-occurring conditions. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 26, "split_id": 59, "split_idx_start": 29875, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "2beadd34f78fc495306f5bcde2a53e20dc8b531d024894a0a58130b2e6a32b73", "range": [702, 875]}, {"doc_id": "ae3cb3e39b30dfa94af1f40d19bdd543077bc9df7f64178899386f7de94018d1", "range": [0, 233]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05146509036421776, -0.10893336683511734, -0.013481241650879383, 0.007029406260699034, 0.010364550165832043, 0.04032573103904724, 0.030044646933674812, -0.01949470303952694, -0.0638522058725357, -0.0056264824233949184, 0.03036360815167427, -0.04046304523944855, 0.019137360155582428, -0.009762607514858246, 0.023245632648468018, -0.07173570245504379, 0.04065456986427307, 0.04774639382958412, -0.058222074061632156, 0.026645489037036896, 0.0020054832566529512, 0.012314609251916409, -0.015862900763750076, 0.03576888144016266, 0.006265911739319563, -0.027194170281291008, 0.033949606120586395, -0.002256859792396426, 0.02429371327161789, -0.02386533096432686, 0.03738480061292648, -0.02518046461045742, 0.007277735974639654, -0.03789421543478966, 2.1571813704213127e-06, 0.03217388689517975, 0.008093281649053097, -0.014519604854285717, -0.005783356726