onable adjustments and the impact of those.\nEvidence to show how we meet this standard:\nWhat has been the impact of implementing this standard?\nOn staff:\nOn parents/carers:\nOn autistic pupils:\fSchools Standards Framework29 Positive Relationships\nPrinciple Four: Workforce development related to good autism practice.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 27, "split_id": 61, "split_idx_start": 31406, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ae3cb3e39b30dfa94af1f40d19bdd543077bc9df7f64178899386f7de94018d1", "range": [838, 957]}, {"doc_id": "45bb25675b89931549a1e4b1f94e5526abaaec69709213e5754c49a1dc56ba51", "range": [0, 173]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03723287954926491, -0.0907248929142952, -0.0008117434335872531, -0.005424604285508394, -0.033861201256513596, 0.0407797247171402, 0.036670565605163574, -0.01538441888988018, -0.07273556292057037, -0.002534592291340232, 0.08124369382858276, -0.05169646814465523, 0.04023028537631035, 0.029738781973719597, 0.03312287479639053, -0.04972458630800247, 0.023040220141410828, 0.047226887196302414, -0.037172261625528336, 0.03977903723716736, -0.0008061491535045207, 0.008164915256202221, -0.017348434776067734, 0.05459339916706085, -0.010844486765563488, -0.03314631059765816, 0.023467781022191048, 0.013033467344939709, 0.006006263662129641, -0.04991646856069565, 0.04255726933479309, -0.010877838358283043, 0.0037555494345724583, -0.05610867217183113, 2.0853458408964798e-06, 0.02345222607254982, 0.007639619521796703, 0.013280440121889114, -0.007040093187242746, -0.012642434798181057, -0.04836232215166092, 0.0015408624894917011, 0.01735437661409378, 0.06794633716344833, -0.012551268562674522, -0.011786272749304771, 0.023442596197128296, 0.023084020242094994, -0.00479508051648736, 0.014078935608267784, -0.0