agues.\nHeadteachers standard 6: Ensure staff have access to high-quality, sustained professional development opportunities, aligned to balance the priorities of whole-school improvement, team and individual needs.\fSchools Standards Framework30 Positive Relationships\nHow do we document evidence of working on this standard? ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 29, "split_id": 63, "split_idx_start": 32667, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "45bb25675b89931549a1e4b1f94e5526abaaec69709213e5754c49a1dc56ba51", "range": [692, 907]}, {"doc_id": "ca06c8b4bf045367437c1d4f7107347a853b509f6f2ade1b6384a9a8d849af43", "range": [0, 110]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.026534920558333397, -0.07692345231771469, -0.009478563442826271, 0.0026767095550894737, -0.0121286790817976, -0.0017624361207708716, -0.003594376612454653, -0.02066255919635296, -0.06853780150413513, 0.010659938678145409, 0.043988920748233795, -0.030764499679207802, 0.028770508244633675, 0.0032215111423283815, 0.03779405355453491, -0.06680851429700851, 0.02536921575665474, 0.045430392026901245, -0.06911612302064896, 0.04227758198976517, 0.016625728458166122, -0.011541903018951416, 0.005986463278532028, 0.031122900545597076, -0.04045102000236511, -0.010536585003137589, -0.013862493447959423, -0.0038730839733034372, 0.04069139435887337, -0.026687011122703552, 0.004409936722368002, 0.019190531224012375, -0.00030863488791510463, -0.04562827944755554, 2.010790012718644e-06, 0.04764436185359955, -0.0019954571034759283, -0.0017033566255122423, 0.00014737981837242842, 0.023552564904093742, -0.044211991131305695, -0.014625072479248047, -0.00021369679598137736, 0.047129981219768524, -0.029149631038308144, -0.019924359396100044, -0.00267715472728014, -0.013747802935540676, 0.029318101704120636, -0.01