nced in our development plan, in policies (particularly the SEND policy and the behaviour policy) and in our Equality Duty objectives.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 32, "split_id": 65, "split_idx_start": 34189, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ca06c8b4bf045367437c1d4f7107347a853b509f6f2ade1b6384a9a8d849af43", "range": [705, 854]}, {"doc_id": "045b0fa6b15a3d2d8576045f8116031de8828140f35842980a477f848838b079", "range": [0, 248]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0627618059515953, -0.062402140349149704, -0.031903788447380066, 0.04093988984823227, 0.03472885489463806, 0.03588946908712387, 0.015859300270676613, -0.03926067054271698, -0.04639560729265213, 0.007291116751730442, 0.026456208899617195, -0.051113560795784, 0.011539035476744175, 0.008629300631582737, 0.012539989314973354, -0.06395213305950165, 0.036671750247478485, 0.03945351764559746, -0.011994075030088425, 0.010663903318345547, 0.016428884118795395, 0.029255185276269913, -0.006343967281281948, 0.014629741199314594, 0.02986891008913517, -0.0174406785517931, 0.022202875465154648, 0.02573278732597828, 0.022564278915524483, -0.03975039720535278, 0.03982625529170036, -0.040033888071775436, -0.0010603959672152996, -0.021094880998134613, 2.0534798750304617e-06, 0.03475942462682724, 0.03261988237500191, -0.012882167473435402, 0.02304880879819393, -0.02897617220878601, -0.07412687689065933, -0.012176483869552612, 0.008418841287493706, 0.06289080530405045, -0.0046209897845983505, -0.005401750095188618, -0.011631599627435207, 0.0674874484539032, 0.024400822818279266, -0.0012110257521271706, -0.008947229944169521, 0.041129451245069504, 0.03203464299440384, -0.03648984432220459, 0.002405615523457527, -0.023065490648150444, 0.005318941082805395, -0.06513898819684982, 0.019886841997504234, 