standard? We document evidence of working on this standard through case studies, one page profiles, and the goals we co-produce with parents/carers and children (where possible), and by documenting our reasonable adjustments and the impact of those.\nEvidence to show how we meet this standard:\nWhat has been the impact of implementing this standard?\nOn staff:\nOn parents/carers:\nOn autistic pupils:\fSchools Standards Framework34 Enabling Environments\nPrinciple Five: Leadership and management that promotes and embeds good autism practice.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "aet-schools-standards-framework.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/166LzAs4UUYY2nmfvEFE7NUcJyEIfBoc3", "source_id": "fd3b04f3804d8efbea64fc291fd78f2aefe37cddffb9972efcc9615a49cfdf8c", "page_number": 32, "split_id": 67, "split_idx_start": 35714, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "045b0fa6b15a3d2d8576045f8116031de8828140f35842980a477f848838b079", "range": [1060, 1334]}, {"doc_id": "a171e6f3c5a6a576870e80cd6277abb8eae0eed6a6bc1d19602a58f37b59ae2b", "range": [0, 190]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06578662246465683, -0.10405262559652328, -0.016880163922905922, 0.020739635452628136, 0.004234579391777515, 0.044262539595365524, 0.027955345809459686, -0.021172363311052322, -0.04034287855029106, 0.0127787496894598, 0.07218614965677261, -0.054418131709098816, 0.04889703541994095, 0.016618816182017326, 0.01974172331392765, -0.06771542876958847, 0.03844333067536354, 0.04028579965233803, -0.051367707550525665, 0.03289331495761871, -0.0016919333720579743, 0.028023501858115196, -0.003300582990050316, 0.019380152225494385, 0.019057931378483772, -0.01944958232343197, 0.01588900201022625, 0.03338116779923439, 0.008723299950361252, -0.039403025060892105, 0.041133981198072433, -0.022136492654681206, -0.005354912485927343, -0.06832891702651978, 2.19317644223338e-06, 0.03999706357717514, 0.007337171118706465, -0.008959682658314705, -0.01759578101336956, -0.01161209400743246, -0.074