\n\u201cThere\u2019s a clear need for school to have consistent and clear behaviour policies that promote positive behaviour in lessons.\u201d\f3\nINTRODUCTIONImproving behaviour in schools\nActing on this guidance\nMajor decisions about your school\u2019s approach to behaviour are likely to be most effective if made in conjunction with a range of stakeholders including teaching and non-teaching staff, pupils, and parents. To maximise its impact, this report should be read in conjunction with other EEF guidance including Putting Evidence to Work: A School\u2019s Guide to Implementation . Schools may also want to seek support from our national network of Research Schools\u2014a collaboration between the EEF, the Institute for Effective Education, and the Department for Education. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 4, "split_id": 5, "split_idx_start": 4292, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "77fb8d6793bb4ad36889df419d80d675404bca61ed8e9a204e3a86d60b0e36d2", "range": [745, 882]}, {"doc_id": "7f86b216c63e21b906022719a68fdc949fdd04d7255a54d021470ca41a9a7eec", "range": [0, 190]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04460292309522629, -0.04473142325878143, 0.010856774635612965, -0.01676759496331215, -0.011396143585443497, 0.039132554084062576, -0.012714791111648083, 0.00977794174104929, -0.02529446966946125, 0.008678511716425419, 0.04879958555102348, 0.04606526717543602, -0.028592931106686592, 0.005924081429839134, 0.02829422615468502, -0.03503250330686569, 0.006544372532516718, 0.0024544617626816034, -0.055398374795913696, 0.030829664319753647, 0.009252375923097134, -0.007536775898188353, 0.016680270433425903, -0.008879940025508404, -0.03955855965614319, 0.00797345396131277, -0.004400565754622221, 0.00958272721618414, 0.04152042046189308, 