aged 4-18.\nWhat does this guidance cover?\nThe strategies outlined should be helpful in schools and classrooms where behaviour is generally good as well as where there are problems. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 7, "split_idx_start": 5774, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "7f86b216c63e21b906022719a68fdc949fdd04d7255a54d021470ca41a9a7eec", "range": [475, 657]}, {"doc_id": "68c5362fbaaadfac7982e77c911d612a9b65004b12c90f3e32af6d0c96f84d71", "range": [0, 139]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06836545467376709, -0.07498496770858765, 0.009769344702363014, -0.0030754476319998503, -0.005783823784440756, 0.019787415862083435, 0.03985816240310669, 0.022153325378894806, -0.02695509046316147, -0.016750764101743698, 0.0336795449256897, -0.036420661956071854, 0.004659757018089294, -0.011922069825232029, 0.033735230565071106, -0.04825544357299805, 0.01390807144343853, 0.01650194078683853, -0.02792178839445114, 0.02685772068798542, -0.022655636072158813, 0.002933492884039879, 0.00020465158740989864, 0.02571016550064087, -0.006762878969311714, -0.0065129948779940605, 0.010311143472790718, 0.00451388955116272, -0.026401929557323456, -0.04457200691103935, 0.11440734565258026, 0.013995294459164143, 0.03963903337717056, -0.05032123997807503, 2.152548177036806e-06, 0.00879272073507309, 0.0067636859603226185, 0.009254754520952702, 0.08010821789503098, -0.03030179999768734, 0.01436205580830574, -0.03887675330042839, 0.04165993258357048, 0.04318143427371979, 0.004845004063099623, 0.026051504537463188, 0.025340523570775986, 0.06581009924411774, 0.02314862050116062, -0.014865775592625141, 0.008401691913604736, -0.03074636124074459, -0.014922678470611572, -0.005294211208820343, 0.03995561599731445, -0.006315725389868021, 0.00941835902