lth. These could play a major role in behaviour presenting in the classroom. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 13, "split_id": 22, "split_idx_start": 19846, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "1567e9ae4f8a96fa9382a5c5b892ad383f81762445eff315779a609b1ac13602", "range": [1342, 1535]}, {"doc_id": "bc44a37cfa6e87bfae3623816f73e1668e8824d63ce51256b4236e1d1f6a9557", "range": [0, 72]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.029800523072481155, -0.10396286845207214, 0.008418469689786434, -0.015306604094803333, 0.0018528098007664084, 0.0653608962893486, 0.0528067946434021, -0.019260670989751816, 0.022330140694975853, 0.014610296115279198, 0.01791730709373951, -6.894854595884681e-05, 0.014729578979313374, -0.029851822182536125, 0.021124182268977165, -0.06575799733400345, 0.014704490080475807, -0.006312115583568811, -0.04880595579743385, 0.03304528445005417, -0.034034598618745804, -0.017932824790477753, -0.004688191693276167, 0.005023670382797718, 0.029312774538993835, -0.03614924103021622, 0.02388809621334076, 0.01326023880392313, 0.03515606373548508, -0.03127898648381233, 0.05143911764025688, 0.02033703587949276, -0.01558929868042469, -0.0519140250980854, 1.901516952784732e-06, 0.026128467172384262, -0.011208985932171345, -0.000783892348408699, -0.015879403799772263, -0.008325262926518917, -0.03460486978292465, 0.006327627692371607, 0.031100966036319733, 0.03696206212043762, 0.009133618324995041, -0.0323101244866848, -0.017421377822756767, 0.040281690657138824, 0.028542479500174522, -0.03588514402508736, -0.0034551089629530907, 0.004096641205251217, -0.09090417623519897, -0.0431966558098793, 0.07573024928569794, -0.0017027525464072824, 0.023274997249245644, -0.016819888725876808, 0.008825782686471939, -0.026967380195856094, 0.0071839820593595505