e launch of his Building Learning Power approach 15 years ago, outlining how learning behaviours can enhance learning outcomes.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 21, "split_id": 42, "split_idx_start": 37530, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "892efc934efb55ae7095cf9aa253f6347688d4b15f84396b57ab5a44be568d41", "range": [798, 911]}, {"doc_id": "cd8d14d4bcecf6dcb52fedfeab6817cdea5a0c2478d2f3acae632f4f2068b86b", "range": [0, 212]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06837651878595352, -0.053657807409763336, -0.013951549306511879, 0.007069110870361328, -0.006631602067500353, 0.018155844882130623, 0.007501391228288412, 0.002311908407136798, -0.006591243203729391, 0.024776604026556015, 0.029895203188061714, 0.03460415080189705, -0.02091800794005394, 0.00042012022458948195, 0.04767340049147606, -0.10990803688764572, 0.017085812985897064, 0.008073895238339901, -0.04792565852403641, 0.044720932841300964, 0.006867056712508202, -0.026682430878281593, 0.010859224945306778, -0.03786792978644371, -0.07556476444005966, -0.0038926948327571154, 0.01009353343397379, -0.005566075909882784, 0.03064652346074581, -0.019771426916122437, 0.09982231259346008, 0.02177152968943119, 0.014382226392626762, -0.003490881761536002, 2.2346514469973044e-06, 0.012186300940811634, -0.010277220979332924, -0.026365499943494797, 0.020834967494010925, 0.0067038279958069324, -0.02607027068734169, 0.01618104800581932, 0.03441255912184715, 0.05094956234097481, -0.013872450217604637, 0.010225437581539154, -0.016392428427934647, 0.008542518131434917, 0.03345499187707901, -0.023964373394846916, 0.0032749122474342585, -0.016099419444799423, -0.027187788859009743, -0.0013577841455116868, 0.06822379678487778, -0.00733951898291707, -0.008534296415746212, 0.033896949142217636, 0.0025