78f437d31ddb465425ae78c638", "content": "This chunk is part of the section discussing tailored interventions for individual students within the broader context of behavior management strategies in schools. It outlines the process for assessing and implementing targeted support interventions based on students' needs, emphasizing the importance of clarity and structure in these interventions.This roadmap will look to strategically develop what intervention is required to target the main need. It will also consider \u2018the next step\u2019 if the intervention works or fails. This support will then occur weekly (or more frequently if the need is greater). Support follows a structured path so that the student has clarity about expectations such as designated collection times, designated room. The intervention will typically run for 3-6 weeks depending on need.\f", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 32, "split_id": 77, "split_idx_start": 64684, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ac4a4f27b583de6a22a6de8205672467de106327530225821a6ef14cc5eea2ca", "range": [854, 957]}, {"doc_id": "9965e869b75871431a9ef78f94994bd261dbe9ddef0975adda382907f5b383ec", "range": [0, 69]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.08085829019546509, -0.08477456867694855, -0.00022331048967316747, -0.012937705963850021, -0.025142032653093338, 0.03080541267991066, 0.016112882643938065, -0.0206555537879467, -0.03345832973718643, 0.014424449764192104, 0.07065370678901672, -0.025064928457140923, -0.06066710129380226, 0.040871113538742065, -0.02566087245941162, -0.06494379788637161, -0.01282511930912733, 0.04021741822361946, -0.01652703993022442, 0.04038172960281372, 0.036116451025009155, -0.008385726250708103, -0.028349310159683228, -0.010221022181212902, -0.011281697079539299, -0