ss of their behaviour strategies.\u2022 What impact will you see in school if this strategy is successful? How do you plan to measure this? \u2022 When would you expect to see an impact? Is it feasible for this approach be left in place until then, or will changes be made that will blur the outcome? If so, is now the right time to implement the strategy?\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 34, "split_id": 80, "split_idx_start": 67695, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "98b02ac390e4c28b63f7dbeb3427dcb2ad0799155ca9a62015ce7159da6990ce", "range": [726, 795]}, {"doc_id": "e79adacfe3e28c4cd1810f233d09849cfb544ee3ba158dd818c851c5e719cac9", "range": [0, 56]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.058034490793943405, 0.0092998081818223, 0.0030019416008144617, -0.008426427841186523, -0.03946252912282944, 0.0033488874323666096, -0.01947743631899357, 0.010540114715695381, -0.05809047445654869, 0.005682988557964563, 0.10426639765501022, 0.00837443396449089, -0.01412415411323309, 0.016763480380177498, 0.003988171461969614, -0.046069905161857605, 0.010433313436806202, 0.035470783710479736, -0.07655757665634155, 0.054537732154130936, -0.0028077997267246246, -0.012886131182312965, -0.017498213797807693, -0.004040304571390152, -0.008043739013373852, -0.03386211767792702, -0.04486296325922012, 0.019297663122415543, -0.009811695665121078, -0.056026261299848557, 0.06834624707698822, 0.0379183292388916, -0.027638312429189682, -0.040514908730983734, 2.1782034309580922e-06, 0.0035955850034952164, -0.015123294666409492, -0.0028591558802872896, 0.03941036015748978, 0.030727993696928024, 0.0016396534629166126, -0.03080814704298973, 0.006915590260177851, 0.031016919761896133, -0.009794600307941437, 0.04472607746720314, -0.032778043299913406, -0.02426094748079776