ils.Ensure that behaviour policy is clearly understood by all staff, parents, and pupils.Display school rules clearly in classes and around the building; staff and pupils should know what they are.\nDisplay the tariff of sanctions and rewards in each class.Have a system in place for ensuring that children never miss out on sanctions or rewards.\nLeadership:Model the behaviour you want to see from your staff.\nBuilding:Visit the lunch hall and playground, and be around at the beginning and the end of the school day\nEnsure that other Senior Leadership Team members are a visible presence around the school\nCheck that pupils come in from the playground and move around the school in an orderly manner.\nCheck up on behaviour outside the school.Check the building is clean and well-maintained.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 47, "split_id": 135, "split_idx_start": 99607, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "02c995e58e70e2f0fdd12eb66075a7774762611ac5c33aa019ef36b6b151ae7e", "range": [1148, 1342]}, {"doc_id": "14a1b8f403822cd17bff5cd87635c863a520835ded680844b70fa8ec8c17d72e", "range": [0, 90]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.055870138108730316, -0.06685598939657211, -0.0006279876688495278, 0.025691719725728035, -0.0028006278444081545, 0.049085233360528946, -0.038799259811639786, -0.0004376141296233982, 0.018800346180796623, 0.01448062900453806, 0.05837979540228844, -0.02717025950551033, 0.015407842583954334, -0.028012771159410477, 0.022706598043441772, -0.0692124292254448, 0.024298157542943954, 0.005750918295234442, -0.009430876933038235, 0.002416346687823534, -0.03360072150826454, 0.02871732786297798, -0.019564909860491753, -0.0253010056912899, -0.024218209087848663, -0.017200641334056854, 0.009876718744635582, 0.046770770102739334, 0