 for implementing behaviour policies consistently and successfully across the school.Active ingredient two\nEffective leadership:\n\u2022 Leaders set clear expectations and enable staff to consistently follow the behaviour policy.\n\u2022 Leaders support staff to respond appropriately where behaviour does not meet expectations.\nActive ingredient three\nEmpowered staff:\n\u2022 Staff are clear on the behaviour policy and confident their colleagues, including senior leaders, will respond to incidents consistently.\n\u2022 Staff know pupils individually and understand their influences and motivations. \u2022 Subject and pastoral leads effectively support behaviour across departments.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 49, "split_id": 144, "split_idx_start": 102541, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "179a7b2d52f141f83bc46ce07631c02d655d1d6b0c1f144d900c7036deae048b", "range": [464, 603]}, {"doc_id": "da32ea49ddc243f57900468fab4228a00a8b79541c2cfbe7fb7ba436fc0e081e", "range": [0, 79]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.08347713202238083, -0.064385786652565, 0.009300191886723042, -0.006993319373577833, -0.011883153580129147, 0.045098695904016495, -0.02515355311334133, -0.023633109405636787, -0.021201910451054573, 0.036563098430633545, 0.06906021386384964, 0.008106027729809284, -0.018751757219433784, 0.015208680182695389, 0.036983080208301544, -0.07230067253112793, 0.01493734773248434, 0.023347288370132446, -0.051552508026361465, 0.028552500531077385, 0.003147727344185114, 0.0031596284825354815, 0.006244806572794914, -0.00643922109156847, -0.029008038341999054, -1.85793742275564e-05, -0.020421644672751427, 0.018731702119112015, 0.008579113520681858, -0.021758336573839188, 0.09292936325073242, 0.006512866821140051, -0.006175485905259848, 