ring sessions to support staff in dealing with behaviour.\nPupils\n\u2022 Lack of clarity over expectations, rewards and sanctions.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 49, "split_id": 147, "split_idx_start": 103630, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "9e7620e64e568fa853dcf0ae9a38be962ba7c6eb4ce9fc8fcaebd9d7b382dc07", "range": [173, 251]}, {"doc_id": "711d0d9b30a51dbcb7d53d81a8120a2009f8dcab1c2837c62598292f72471aa7", "range": [0, 67]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.09557068347930908, -0.052987806499004364, -0.00035015877801924944, 0.008660745806992054, 0.0026485396083444357, 0.03211962804198265, 0.029039820656180382, 0.004013865254819393, 0.0020506686996668577, 0.02699628286063671, 0.03551815077662468, 0.006064203102141619, -0.030404377728700638, 0.0043539078906178474, 0.03984174132347107, -0.07924199849367142, -0.0020776703022420406, 0.000588271941523999, -0.0326647125184536, 0.03221191465854645, 0.032782960683107376, 0.0054083592258393764, 0.0009117466979660094, -0.02250359207391739, -0.06173750013113022, -0.0013248935574665666, -0.0012986899819225073, 0.0010612120386213064, 0.03600383177399635, -0.012077038176357746, 0.08234422653913498, 0.008437646552920341, -0.0041884672828018665, -0.025099419057369232, 2.095094259857433e-06, 0.022936437278985977, 0.005919181741774082, -0.03207225725054741, 0.02321498841047287, 0.0017778115579858422, -0.025612713769078255, -0.02916819415986538, 0.0403975173830986, 0.04659762233495712, 0.00033154318225570023, 0.07229302078485489, 0.007861163467168808, 0.04758778214454651, 0.03811831772327423, -0.042502690106630325, 0.007257354445755482, -0.014997867867350578, -0.03539366275072098, -0.030628960579633713, 0.021560559049248695, -0.02215077541768551, -0.00881230179220438, 0.007725447416305542, 0.