 of expectations and support for high-needs pupils, emphasizing the need for collaborative input from both students and staff to enhance engagement and effectiveness of the behavior policy.Pupils\n\u2022 Lack of clarity over expectations, rewards and sanctions.\n\u2022 \u2018High needs\u2019 provision for those with behavioural issues works for some pupils but not others.\n\u2022 Pupil survey shows many pupils feel disconnected from or unsupported by school.\nProblem (Why?)\nCollaborative expectation setting\n\u2022 Refresh behaviour policy in collaboration with pupils and staff. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 49, "split_id": 148, "split_idx_start": 104108, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "4348fb345bacadb147246c56ee0d44290475b52883b50c3c3b10aa5c90d3498c", "range": [478, 545]}, {"doc_id": "568ee2fbe74be6df79a713a6147fb6213ae7713b9615177bf6a5a43b5942af62", "range": [0, 101]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.08709916472434998, -0.09152977913618088, 0.01084116566926241, 0.002710038097575307, -0.0313667468726635, 0.05571456998586655, 0.02087567001581192, -0.019150638952851295, -0.028781268745660782, 0.02652427740395069, 0.09552265703678131, -0.02123839035630226, 0.01655258797109127, -0.0012563209747895598, 0.0030847182497382164, -0.09650473296642303, 0.011049812659621239, 0.021110672503709793, -0.008303091861307621, 0.014215297065675259, 0.00550798000767827, 0.004373825155198574, -0.014760080724954605, 0.011140979826450348, -0.0013103660894557834, -0.03115958347916603, -0.015077509917318821, 0.009565829299390316, 0.037516120821237564, -0.036158882081508636, 0.0895688608288765, 0.009148363023996353, -0.005034398753196001, -0.04697088897228241, 1.9709120806510327e-06, 0.018995234742760658, -0.01255092304199934, 0.00314500206150114