 work around behaviour included in induction process (all staff for intro year). Provide clarity on expectations as classroom teacher, form tutor and on duty as well as support and non-teaching staff. Half-termly half-days for one year.\n\u2022 Package of support to help staff who are experiencing difficult classes, focused on classroom management strategies: two training days per half term for 3 half terms.\n\u2022 Instructional coaching for staff who require additional support. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 49, "split_id": 151, "split_idx_start": 105219, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "1f7d3326c4b557d0e3f4d963460022e5e9d7c885a3e3bb15c8af1fb28e8e7eb8", "range": [514, 616]}, {"doc_id": "bbfc06a9b581e3deb654a9b219aadf18c0ba580d6147887981dd4cc7d0312c53", "range": [0, 67]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.08450962603092194, -0.07537911087274551, 0.005191411357372999, 0.006558080203831196, -0.00443647988140583, 0.015000191517174244, 0.03245701640844345, 0.013058299198746681, -0.03000880777835846, -0.004172050394117832, 0.053999729454517365, 0.0027534128166735172, -0.041180722415447235, -0.01911253295838833, 0.040367186069488525, -0.1001344621181488, -0.0024576280266046524, 0.009146817028522491, -0.06108574569225311, 0.03003874607384205, 0.01882285438477993, 0.013259601779282093, -0.005718994420021772, -0.026312319561839104, -0.052577100694179535, 0.0017161732539534569, -0.01250837929546833, 0.0067143989726901054, 0.034218817949295044, -0.013874889351427555, 0.0860571563243866, 0.0230067428201437, -0.007481416687369347, -0.04623528942465782, 2.056129005723051e-06, 0.018488533794879913, -0.014473266899585724, -0.03268234059214592, 0.033317942172288895, -0.004389539361000061, -0.010228538885712624, -0.03664679080247879, 0.054854