 pupils to enhance behaviour management and reduce exclusions.\u2022 All most challenging students are supported through high needs provision, usually tailored.\nAcceptability:\n\u2022 Staff generally agree with the direction of travel regarding behaviour.\n\u2022 Reduction in the amount of exclusions for high needs students.\nMedium term (6 months):\nFidelity: \u2022 Sanctions and support are consistent\n\u2022 The language of \u2018Expectations\u2019 is used spontaneously by staff and pupils in conversations about behaviour and learning.\n\u2022 Middle/TLR/Senior leaders actively taking part in coaching/training sessions.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Improving_behaviour_in_schools_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18VgDE6jXP5eN_4w_IPbsUVu8tW-V4ep2", "source_id": "7a1d3f44ce494b71f1d9e0fe5b7517c578d4c867369077d76a9ccd359cf1603d", "page_number": 49, "split_id": 155, "split_idx_start": 106617, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "bc200bb92358ab1a1fa386469831d91023efee9776001b50433ee6fdd0dad63f", "range": [252, 346]}, {"doc_id": "0f610294bc2dcbbeb24a35ff1b56030bd73d2d798371df82dc1ebbf693e5e6cc", "range": [0, 80]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.09223777800798416, -0.11974781006574631, 0.005807956680655479, 0.02160457894206047, -0.0065462831407785416, 0.04882201552391052, -0.01086531113833189, -0.024958867579698563, 0.013177148997783661, 0.022736582905054092, 0.07772646099328995, -0.027190307155251503, -0.013619895093142986, 0.042577970772981644, 0.007204512134194374, -0.07666876167058945, 0.004586541559547186, 0.016441864892840385, -0.023713916540145874, 0.014795461669564247, 0.018739299848675728, 0.005369167774915695, -0.01201484352350235, 0.01074833981692791, -0.009292933158576488, -0.010390175506472588, -0.03997598960995674, 0.022456463426351547, -0.0024027086328715086, -0.024594666436314583, 0.07591282576322556, 0.018184319138526917, -0.007515808567404747, -0.07071994990110397, 2.098330242006341e-06, 0.000115545801