3848150372505188, 0.0029981553088873625, 0.016130756586790085, -0.008829515427350998, -0.0014493669150397182, -0.0030950645450502634, -0.02122822217643261, 0.047444459050893784, 0.033798832446336746, 0.060138072818517685, -0.010272204875946045, 0.03500533476471901, -0.04544082283973694, -0.03500297665596008, 0.016976553946733475, -0.034646354615688324, 0.010562999173998833, 0.04456888884305954, -0.04215865582227707, 0.021701693534851074, 0.0005996677791699767, 0.04494398087263107, -0.032846853137016296, 0.016480330377817154, -0.011143515817821026, -0.08588961511850357, 0.057450070977211, 0.014970566146075726, 0.05884002149105072, -0.009128851816058159, 0.021096259355545044, 0.007352674845606089, 0.0018160243052989244, 0.023534582927823067, -0.051690034568309784, -0.032082825899124146, -0.00505654513835907, 2.2107517664139953e-34, 0.007414502091705799, -0.03375789150595665, -0.017933102324604988, -0.08098368346691132, 0.014701955020427704, -0.01224364060908556, -0.03712237626314163, 0.01816345565021038, 0.01740408129990101, 0.017094966024160385, -0.0144531624391675], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "b01c94227366280565aafdbfb5c20c946d96c378ca0edc9641afac041dcd5a1c", "content": "This chunk appears in the introduction of the guidance report, highlighting the findings from the evidence review on social and emotional learning (SEL). It emphasizes the identification of core skills and strategies, the need for effective implementation in English schools, and the commitment of the Education Endowment Foundation to enhance SEL practices through ongoing support and resources.We identified a group of core skills and strategies that occur frequently in social and emotional learning programmes that have good evidence of impact, and suggest ways of embedding these in the classroom and beyond.\nThe international evidence in this area is extensive but knowledge of how best to implement it in English schools is not yet as strong as we would like, so an over-arching recommendation focuses on the importance of implementing and monitoring progress carefully, and the requirement for school leaders to prioritise this work if it is to have an impact. Although some schools may feel social and emotional learning is \u2018what we do already\u2019, the evidence suggests that how SEL is adopted and embedded really matters for children\u2019s outcomes.\nAs with all our guidance reports, this publication is just the start. We will now be working with the sector, including through our colleagues in the Research Schools Network, to build on the recommendations with further training, resources, and guidance. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 4, "split_id": 5, "split_idx_start": 4265, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "08412ec6619f0808b98cb9e1ae508c3e961b5bba1d35886fa54299fd243dcb66", "range": [674, 892]}, {"doc_id": "2e377e21302aabab0e24d17cb2ddc3866f66c13f2315723dc9b7b4e7026bc0b6", "range": [0, 186]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04953959211707115, -0.07724162191152573, 0.002032522577792406, 0.017741339281201363, 0.008332996629178524, 0.0683198794722557, -0.014054817147552967, -0.06228800117969513, 0.03381902724504471, 0.00015489858924411237, 0.00926221814006567, 0.017417553812265396, 0.014553657732903957, -0.005838295910507441, 0.04733903333544731, -0.08846206218004227, 0.008015229366719723, 0.05127891153097153, -0.00450217304751277, 0.010563232935965061, 0.012817079201340675, 0.011695855297148228, 0.016843747347593307, -0.028102237731218338, -0.026048675179481506, -0.0030352629255503416, -0.04042506217956543, 0.012972438707947731, 0.023493850603699684, -0.04183075949549675, 0.044396787881851196, 0.02574256621301174, -0.01830027624964714, -0.031126786023378372, 2.804558107527555e-06, -0.015068944543600082, -0.01036672387272