ional network of Research Schools . Research Schools aim to lead the way in the use of evidence-\nbased teaching, building affiliations with large numbers of schools in their region, and supporting the use of evidence at scale.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 11, "split_idx_start": 8493, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "e9e4a8e07fd3080e20012f95bf616b3d2d2e6e93fa495ce533501e3207a2ff59", "range": [915, 1028]}, {"doc_id": "e8394b0da5eb83234ae677a76c6b10eeeb4854708276f05a6cd6fdc3ca7b3b34", "range": [0, 191]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.07890859246253967, -0.11844155937433243, 0.016555795446038246, -0.012816491536796093, -0.016731703653931618, 0.06646411120891571, 0.03604731336236, -0.01226444449275732, 0.004046487156301737, -0.0060818614438176155, 0.050314005464315414, 0.03632581606507301, 0.024924395605921745, -0.02576320804655552, 0.059493888169527054, -0.06664351373910904, 0.025129105895757675, 0.0451817624270916, -0.014471497386693954, 0.014227647334337234, -0.0012438487028703094, 0.011388881132006645, -0.007914775982499123, 0.0017840180080384016, -0.00910521112382412, -0.004228267353028059, -0.039198800921440125, 0.010264325886964798, -0.009184319525957108, -0.04333891719579697, 0.06174163520336151, 0.03423262760043144, -0.02370304986834526, -0.08196397125720978, 2.1985108560329536e-06, -0.012149805203080177, 0.000560474640224129, 0.011338338255882263, 0.00860216561704874, -0.010426105931401253, 0.007004537153989077, 0.003055125940591097, 0.02550041675567627, 0.030573422089219093, 0.022042490541934967, 0.023296520113945007, 0.04036600515246391, 0.054532602429389954, -0.019338877871632576, -0.01751350611448288, 0.016200412064790726, -0.023463673889636993, -0.006684219930320978, -0.03827562555670738, 0.0668896734