6, -0.06121008098125458, 0.0037981066852808, 0.04534472897648811, -0.01731882058084011, 0.018927384167909622, -0.03165830671787262, 0.048674408346414566, -0.039233364164829254, 0.020207291468977928, 0.029326830059289932, -0.08822853118181229, 0.027172734960913658, 0.022858256474137306, 0.04429006204009056, -0.048243384808301926, 0.047959212213754654, -0.027586311101913452, 0.0160716213285923, 0.006975689437240362, -0.0375424362719059, -0.008195561356842518, 0.007866663858294487, 1.7811993835352755e-34, -0.0053031109273433685, -0.017618756741285324, -0.01886213757097721, -0.0972985327243805, 0.03216729685664177, -0.02774115651845932, -0.05416372790932655, 0.041769299656152725, 0.00997859239578247, 0.04727722331881523, 0.009949377737939358], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "54dee5d513303364c422545a7eb3ab30dc7706ca26c956baac82ba9d66cf973c", "content": "This chunk appears in the \"What is Social and Emotional Learning (SEL)?\" section of the document. It outlines the core competencies and associated skills integral to SEL, specifically focusing on self-management, responsible decision-making, and the ability to identify and understand emotions, which are essential for children's social and emotional development.The ability to accurately assess one\u2019s strengths and limitations with a well-grounded sense of confidence and optimism.\n\u2022 Identifying emotions\n\u2022 Accurate self-perception\n\u2022 Recognising strengths\n\u2022 Self-confidence\n\u2022 Self-efficacy\n\u2022 Impulse control \u2022 Stress management\n\u2022 Self-discipline\n\u2022 Self-motivation\n\u2022 Goal setting\n\u2022 Organisational skills\n\u2022 Identifying problems\n\u2022 Analysing solutions\n\u2022 Solving problems\n\u2022 Evaluating\n\u2022 Reflecting\n\u2022 Ethical responsibility\n\u2022 Understanding emotions\n\u2022 Empathy/sympathy\n\u2022 Appreciating diversity\n\u2022 Respect for others\n\u2022 Communication \u2022 Social engagement\n\u2022 Relationship building\n\u2022 Teamwork\nSelf Management\nThe ability to successfully regulate one\u2019s emotions, thoughts and behaviours in different situations \u2013 effectively managing stress, controlling impulses, and motivating oneself. The ability to set and work towards personal and academic goals.\nResonsible Decision Making\nThe ability to make constructive choices about personal behaviour and social interactions. The realistic evaluation of consequences of various actions and a consideration of the wellbeing of oneself and others.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 6, "split_id": 14, "split_idx_start": 11084, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "647a4c3d47417f441119b9400020833b586745729a25fd3d74f337eab441c31e", "range": [1399, 1519]}, {"doc_id": "22adbd2fe63271350ee51843467b70bf5ef809469dbddf70e19bddc3d24484db", "range": [0, 120]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.034390002489089966, -0.09184776991605759, -0.001912902225740254, 0.011784480884671211, 0.0035751841496676207, 0.07667774707078934, 0.01621616631746292, -0.04817266762256622, 0.036970172077417374, 0.011161030270159245, 0.01224970817565918, 0.0025964598171412945, -0.002210306702181697, -0.0382467620074749, 0.018744254484772682, -0.06633889675140381, 0.010893263854086399, 0.02687046304345131, 0.011785414069890976, 0.01838025636970997, -0.04824274033308029, 0.020668787881731987, -0.000857561593875289, -0.004152171313762665, -0.015877479687333107, -0.035692788660526276, 0.00858636200428009, -0.025433726608753204, 0.019895074889063835, -0.008070411160588264, 0.03677497059106827, -0.00518654752522707, 0.005297772586345673, -0.09624148905277252, 1.9887204416590976e-06, -0.043897174298763275, -0.011545066721737385, -0.0323583148419857, 0.004602102562785149, -0.044462475925683975, 0.04039843752980232, -0.01843490451