84135428071022, -0.0044194855727255344, 0.03602413088083267, -0.018927328288555145], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "22adbd2fe63271350ee51843467b70bf5ef809469dbddf70e19bddc3d24484db", "content": "This chunk is part of the section defining key competencies of Social and Emotional Learning (SEL) as outlined in the guidance report. It specifically addresses Social Awareness, which involves empathy and understanding social norms, and Relationship Skills, which focus on building healthy relationships and effective communication.The realistic evaluation of consequences of various actions and a consideration of the wellbeing of oneself and others.\nSocial Awareness\nThe ability to take the perspective of and empathise with others. The ability to understand social and ethical norms for behaviour and to recognise family, school and community resources and supports.\nRelationship Skills\nThe ability to establish and maintain healthy relationships with diverse individuals and groups. The ability to communicate clearly, listen well, cooperate with others, resist inappropriate social pressure, negotiate conflict constructively and seek and offer help when needed.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 6, "split_id": 15, "split_idx_start": 12078, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "54dee5d513303364c422545a7eb3ab30dc7706ca26c956baac82ba9d66cf973c", "range": [994, 1114]}, {"doc_id": "0504c0dead16d96322f0f45605e4bf563673b8ca3ea0a4332731c5544c55c1d5", "range": [0, 181]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04945504292845726, -0.08691045641899109, 0.009271230548620224, 0.0005535531090572476, 0.00541422376409173, 0.08211995661258698, 0.031562209129333496, -0.04300824925303459, 0.05857819691300392, 0.00017461231618653983, 0.011982162483036518, -0.0246037635952234