929541, 0.024852262809872627, -0.026400692760944366, 0.016745585948228836, -0.038412295281887054, 0.044898249208927155, -0.03913523629307747, 2.529907760617789e-05, 0.02894018031656742, -0.08516012877225876, -0.005801210179924965, 0.036102812737226486, 0.07831238210201263, -0.015708990395069122, 0.043478433042764664, -0.07655107229948044, 0.03533881530165672, -0.0016566363628953695, -0.013430435210466385, 0.0014647087082266808, -0.015620720572769642, 1.7012928591507265e-34, -0.00014943470887374133, 0.002022610977292061, -0.004320615902543068, -0.06687206029891968, 0.025560928508639336, -0.03600279241800308, -0.06740347295999527, 0.02654879353940487, -0.009589435532689095, 0.03422146663069725, -0.013352056965231895], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "0504c0dead16d96322f0f45605e4bf563673b8ca3ea0a4332731c5544c55c1d5", "content": "This chunk is located in the section that defines the core competencies of Social and Emotional Learning (SEL) as outlined by the Collaborative for Academic, Social, and Emotional Learning (CASEL). It details specific skills associated with \"Relationship Skills,\" which emphasize the importance of effective communication, cooperation, and conflict negotiation in the context of social and emotional development for children.The ability to communicate clearly, listen well, cooperate with others, resist inappropriate social pressure, negotiate conflict constructively and seek and offer help when needed.\nAdapted From - http://secondaryguide.casel.org/#De/f_inition\nDiagram adapted from CASEL 2017 Core competency\nDefinition Associated skills Self-\nawareness\nThe ability to accurately recognise one\u2019s own emotions, thoughts and values and how they influence behaviour. The ability to accurately assess one\u2019s strengths and limitations with a well-grounded sense of confidence and optimism.\n\u2022 Identifying emotions\n\u2022 Accurate self-perception\n\u2022 Recognising strengths\n\u2022 Self-confidence\n\u2022 Self-efficacy\nSelf-\nmanagement\nThe ability to successfully regulate one\u2019s emotions, thoughts and behaviours in different situations \u2013 effectively managing stress, controlling impulses, and motivating oneself. The ability to set and work towards personal and academic goals.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 6, "split_id": 16, "split_idx_start": 12533, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "22adbd2fe63271350ee51843467b70bf5ef809469dbddf70e19bddc3d24484db", "range": [455, 636]}, {"doc_id": "d3e89492d6a8d7d8debcf7c79b975b784a4086df43b3e650b668cef1873b7ce9", "range": [0, 65]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.041320741176605225, -0.08476315438747406, 0.0015748367877677083, 0.02034846507012844, -0.011625813320279121, 0.08490064740180969, 0.0383419394493103, -0.060749951750040054, 0.03277991712093353, 0.015369621105492115, -0.0032441995572298765, -0.022800475358963013, 0.0039304280653595924, -0.039757825434207916, 0.011638651601970196, -0.04354693740606308, 0.006943487096577883, 0.050188854336738586, 0.042024608701467514, 0.02398799918591976, -0.030168117955327034, 0.020599421113729477, -0.00047821461339481175, 0.005928163416683674, -0.04853856563568115, -0.05132138356566429, 0.01950199529528618, -0.029494278132915497, 0.01036953367292881, 0.0027737997006624937, 0.04990946874022484, 0.025327617302536964, -0.014490894041955471, -0.09565038979053497, 2.1160938104003435e-06, -0.054657962173223495, -0.02887899987399578, -0.02491045743227005, 0.004176626913249493, -0.050496961921453476, 0.020233310759067535, -0.02157525159418583, 0.04638790339231491, 0.02933933399617672, -0.022773005068302155, 0.026992077007889748, 0.025586731731891632, 0.05373040959239006, 0.013579717837274075, 0.008272101171314716, 0.008655204437673092, 0.053521838039159775, -0.020862456411123276, -