e emotions.\n\u2022 Social awareness: use stories to discuss others\u2019 emotions and perspectives.\n\u2022 Relationship skills: role play good communication and listening skills.\n\u2022 Responsible decision-making: teach and practise problem-\nsolving strategies. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 10, "split_id": 28, "split_idx_start": 22796, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "df586f86c88ec8f7697841bdebbd15f7f21bee59cbe59b57f5b668cbcf2f7fe1", "range": [880, 975]}, {"doc_id": "379be27e3f41b8059c5f2b8e4be369c963206b4152a1c7137d4a1c68afb769b3", "range": [0, 79]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04238276183605194, -0.0652824118733406, -0.006192230153828859, 0.004932859912514687, 0.015132986009120941, 0.045163266360759735, 0.0023020682856440544, -0.08648528903722763, 0.042186714708805084, 0.025118667632341385, -0.01913549192249775, 0.012089123949408531, -0.009573465213179588, 0.002185861114412546, -0.00887464452534914, -0.10503525286912918, 0.0011319576296955347, 0.016373492777347565, 0.04721299558877945, 0.009004977531731129, -0.01762300729751587, 0.0059957741759717464, 0.004668522626161575, -0.03599782660603523, -0.031573742628097534, -0.011951390653848648, 0.0008111981442198157, 0.016562027856707573, 0.031230658292770386, -0.04608963429927826, 0.055569712072610855, 0.026141749694943428, 0.006085430737584829, -0.06796218454837799, 2.346595465496648e-06, -0.03660116717219353, -0.02651180513203144, -0.06307197362184525, 0.0058777425438165665, -0.00724429776892066, 0.028366904705762863, -0.01734103076159954, 0.03766326233744621, 0.01825863867998123, 0.00016234723443631083, 0.011265363544225693, 0.025150727480649948, 0.05124262720346451, 0.06374188512563705, 0.0038484465330839157, 0.0064139775931835175, 0.01950131729245186, -0.04256118461489