each SEL skills explicitly.\" It outlines practical strategies for educators to teach social and emotional learning (SEL) skills, emphasizing the importance of explicit instruction, modeling desired behaviors, providing praise, and integrating SEL across various subject areas.\u2022 Responsible decision-making: teach and practise problem-\nsolving strategies. Page 10\nTeach SEL skills explicitly\n1\n\u2022 Model the social and emotional behaviours you want children to adopt.\n\u2022 Give specific and focused praise when children display SEL skills.\n\u2022 Do not rely on \u2018crisis moments\u2019 for teaching skills.\n\u2022 Embed SEL teaching across a range of subject areas: literacy, history, drama and PE all provide good opportunities to link to SEL.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 10, "split_id": 29, "split_idx_start": 23167, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "a0b92103780e82302fad88f83ce3001b4c15d5a0e82656031ca8ce3376719ddf", "range": [371, 450]}, {"doc_id": "333ef56522982e5cb7e1340da91e667726e0f70579b6e873a41dd325450d065a", "range": [0, 133]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.052628710865974426, -0.0770043209195137, -0.0073705194517970085, 0.0003597344912122935, 0.0011782232904806733, 0.06322307884693146, 0.025006001815199852, -0.0549386627972126, 0.018142536282539368, -0.0008655744604766369, 0.017744198441505432, 0.0027301006484776735, 0.0013768982607871294, 0.009355658665299416, 0.02739878185093403, -0.09634294360876083, 0.019621973857283592, 0.05755520239472389, 0.004126785323023796, 0.008199719712138176, -0.007870025932788849, 0.009750914759933949, -0.004019022919237614, -0.022248292341828346, -0.009773342870175838, -0.012367905117571354, -0.01204490102827549, 0.003671475686132908, 0.0013642736012116075, -0.04399405047297478