ssons and year groups. Start early and think long term.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 10, "split_id": 31, "split_idx_start": 23945, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "333ef56522982e5cb7e1340da91e667726e0f70579b6e873a41dd325450d065a", "range": [465, 620]}, {"doc_id": "eb97c42666b15a98e408ff45ee0f1490d88f64c760c59519cbd2f4187b2219bc", "range": [0, 33]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0357416495680809, -0.06978903710842133, 0.004947939421981573, 0.008254832588136196, 0.0019756548572331667, 0.05076301097869873, 0.00761240441352129, -0.07411211729049683, 0.02778605744242668, 0.01460097637027502, 0.018339844420552254, -0.0015133682172745466, 0.012116419151425362, 0.029613777995109558, 0.008655852638185024, -0.10451322793960571, 0.010425562970340252, 0.03781325742602348, -0.0053528971038758755, 0.01316605694591999, 0.02305777370929718, 0.014894683845341206, 0.0175984688103199, -0.03685417398810387, -0.017283644527196884, -0.004544361960142851, -0.04396750405430794, 0.024947652593255043, 0.018696019425988197, -0.05725005641579628, 0.04271645471453667, 0.02593313157558441, 0.010851635597646236, -0.03316367790102959, 2.6123605039174436e-06, -0.027208659797906876, -0.022074168547987938, -0.03348980098962784, 0.018505191430449486, -0.0006338268867693841, 0.04000505805015564, -0.041802290827035904, 0.035401105880737305, 0.020439395681023598, 0.008394697681069374, 0.005769049283117056, 0.04701250419020653, 0.01696680299937725, 0.04799364507198334, -0.01698335073888302, 0.013470964506268501, -0.014389201067388058, -0.044004105031490326, -0.03017430566251278, 0.028513099998235703, 0.021522119641304016, -0.017796671018004417, -0.00914765801280737, 0.028341537341475487, -0.01163523644208908, -0.02794204093515873, 0.018251720815896988, -0.0240448936