, 0.024807358160614967, 0.033137477934360504, -0.018539054319262505, 0.01870536431670189, 0.04081180691719055, 0.017091404646635056, 0.000678158481605351, 0.04382767900824547, -0.0186440609395504, -0.03697917237877846, -0.0015239878557622433, -0.016378283500671387, -0.01727605052292347, 0.0077614509500563145, 0.007727290038019419, -0.005912839435040951, -0.03869011998176575, -0.023139508441090584, -0.04267854988574982, 0.05309596657752991, 0.0016226965235546231, 0.05346778780221939, 0.008798767812550068, 0.051283273845911026, -0.07421727478504181, -0.05193016305565834, 0.017336662858724594, -0.041892796754837036, 0.017240174114704132, 0.07673492282629013, -0.050357311964035034, 0.008051777258515358, 0.00613581296056509, 0.03322434797883034, -0.025531038641929626, 0.015171497128903866, -0.0010832733241841197, -0.0564674474298954, -0.00135041493922472, 0.021584853529930115, 0.06664608418941498, 0.006981421262025833, 0.02868250198662281, -0.028787175193428993, 0.02179967612028122, -0.0035489397123456, -0.035586219280958176, 0.013294152915477753, -0.009691053070127964, 2.512743152802453e-34, -0.00643165735527873, -0.023266887292265892, 0.00987930502742529, -0.07660359144210815, 0.012008316814899445, -0.020436054095625877, -0.04267577826976776, 0.021789738908410072, 0.030881596729159355, 0.03856758773326874, -0.028745094314217567], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "7402adf329554c1575ba9372d39f65fbe8ce7b8eb58e33604c279d543ec31a20", "content": "This chunk is part of Recommendation 6, which emphasizes the importance of planning, supporting, and monitoring the implementation of social and emotional learning (SEL) in schools. It highlights that effective implementation quality, including teacher preparedness and enthusiasm, significantly impacts educational outcomes, and underscores the necessity of monitoring to evaluate the effectiveness of SEL approaches.\u2022 Prioritise implementation quality: teacher preparedness and enthusiasm for SEL are associated with better outcomes.\n\u2022 Monitor implementation and evaluate the impact of your approaches. Page 34\nPlan, support, and monitor SEL implementation\n6\nCurriculum Whole-school Implementation\f10\nEducation Endowment Foundation 1\nT each SEL skills explicitly\nThis recommendation describes simple activities, routines, and strategies that teachers can use to develop particular social and emotional skills. Recent research suggests that supporting teachers to develop and use a repertoire of such strategies is likely to be an efficient way of improving SEL provision without requiring large blocks of dedicated curriculum time. 18 The strategies in this chapter have been identified from evidence-based programmes, and can be used flexibly:\n\u2022 as part of planned time dedicated to SEL;\n\u2022 integrated into everyday class teaching; and\n\u2022 to complement a more structured programme (see Recommendation 3).\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 11, "split_id": 35, "split_idx_start": 25742, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "54c1a8c6c0ce0ff6363e7e6502591b3f68ba09835f0f0d84a6399c7ef326a949", "range": [476, 594]}, {"doc_id": "aba0740e37c03f421fa81d73393a8290de3d2c6609c31747ccd32a9dea9eb81b", "range": [0, 272]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06365236639976501, -0.06974323838949203, 0.00985839031636715, 0.0034149950370192528, 0.011255879886448383, 0.05518399924039841, 0.01777443289756775, -0.07335508614778519, 0.024034569039940834, 0.013168678618967533, 0.005501209292560816, 0.01663842611014843, 0.003847012761980295, 0.007866177707910538, 0.03304975852370262, -0.10175339877605438, -0.01172176469117403, 0.05858491733670235, -0.01676328107714653, 0.036232851445674896, 0.028697362169623375, 0.0254710353910923, 0.005115062929689884, -0.04705168306827545, -0.0101