uch strategies, and they have been drawn from evidence-based approaches, they have not been evaluated as standalone strategies, so schools need to judge which approaches are suitable for them and are effective in their contexts.\nA. Strategies to enhance children\u2019s self-awareness\nWhat do we mean by self-awareness?\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 12, "split_id": 37, "split_idx_start": 27038, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "aba0740e37c03f421fa81d73393a8290de3d2c6609c31747ccd32a9dea9eb81b", "range": [580, 690]}, {"doc_id": "7154647507f4f51e1b7d8b4e8a6a630da241923b2a08f22e134861ff1d5306af", "range": [0, 83]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.049523040652275085, -0.11720836907625198, 0.0058152806013822556, 0.02046475186944008, 0.014772077091038227, 0.0495479442179203, 0.033817872405052185, -0.06438649445772171, 0.06368254125118256, -0.004315193276852369, -0.01973501406610012, 0.036025743931531906, -0.022468166425824165, -5.3051600843900815e-05, 0.042925506830215454, -0.07156728208065033, 0.033545102924108505, 0.023203322663903236, -0.009018068201839924, 0.010011792182922363, -0.01566540263593197, -0.023971019312739372, -0.003362013027071953, -0.04823237657546997, -0.03343089669942856, -0.04102437570691109, 0.006392098031938076, 0.013528618961572647, -0.004729368258267641, -0.06651323288679123, 0.019027763977646828, 0.023144006729125977, 0.022711003199219704, -0.04503889009356499, 2.2319222807709593e-06, -0.04929139092564583, -0.012563561089336872, -0.06664422154426575, 0.008473646827042103, 0.005624483805149794, 0.01090584509074688, 0.022479644045233727, 0.04069771617650986, 0.018349500373005867, 0.004061823710799217, 0.005329289007931948, 0.004735994152724743, 0.06325720250606537, 0.042565591633319855, 0.0019464462529867887, 0.00