lude getting children to generate ideas and discussing the pros and cons of different rules and why they are important. This is a good activity to do at the start of the year with a new class, but can also be re-visited during the year, particularly to address issues that arise. This activity is used in a programme called Incredible Years\u2014Teacher Classroom Management.\nBox 4: Class rules\f16\nEducation Endowment Foundation E. Strategies to enhance children\u2019s responsible decision making\nWhat do we mean by responsible decision making?\nResponsible decision making is concerned with children\u2019s ability to problem solve and make constructive choices. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 17, "split_id": 57, "split_idx_start": 40773, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "a7ea8b4c98f895eb6616b16ae6048583b4dfda80f441f03a32d2da7bd397b75a", "range": [745, 879]}, {"doc_id": "8f5b1d571dbc7c8adcc0ee9de32cd895e90d8669a94634363a7a73f9ef83ad63", "range": [0, 113]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06380382180213928, -0.08758927881717682, -0.007266462780535221, -1.2140894796175417e-05, -0.04273047298192978, 0.03809761628508568, 0.026720626279711723, -0.017676515504717827, -0.046055976301431656, 0.005376167129725218, 0.0572662316262722, -0.019489126279950142, 0.011538637802004814, -0.0339793935418129, -0.0068340301513671875, -0.06348348408937454, 0.009675749577581882, 0.004648212343454361, 0.012207466177642345, 0.020577343180775642, -0.011571928858757019, -0.0320444256067276, -0.029990926384925842, 0.003993843216449022, -0.022521251812577248, -0.012448140420019627, -0.005930675193667412, -0.004246170166879892, -0.0054374272003769875, -0.060979485511779785, 0.07855410128831863, 0.025892069563269615, 0.011686097830533981, -0.043552711606025696, 2.22