rs can facilitate brainstorming to help students generate solutions to conflicts or challenges they encounter.2. Brainstorm solutions. Help children to generate solutions to the problem situation. Young children may not be able to come up with their own solutions, but teachers can support their thinking with questions such as \u2018What could we do to make the situation better? / What kinds of things could you do that would help you and the other people involved to feel better?\u2019 With practice, children will gradually be able to come up with more of their own solutions. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 18, "split_id": 60, "split_idx_start": 42421, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "46462eda35d8cab0dc2c5158050d104942b113967b2b9da151e707105126563a", "range": [377, 380]}, {"doc_id": "eb640371d315d427d8b0be750974e21c411d87dfd4cbfd8d673c6bb80a0d232a", "range": [0, 195]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06802067905664444, -0.06598418951034546, -0.007768034469336271, -0.0017947069136425853, -0.041713789105415344, 0.03214503452181816, 0.030220074579119682, -0.033490587025880814, 0.003656339831650257, 0.01510920561850071, 0.04526287689805031, 0.03410952538251877, 0.0051151118241250515, -0.017984945327043533, -0.009621846489608288, -0.06494499742984772, -0.0026263603940606117, 0.02462615631520748, 0.01782895252108574, 0.014904357492923737, -0.01371814589947462, 0.013966779224574566, -0.010466675274074078, 0.0038391619455069304, -0.035910625010728836, -0.04246431216597557, 0.006948600057512522, 0.022749245166778564, 0.0013337493874132633, -0.04102972522377968, 0.05734270066022873, 0.015959646552801132, -0.026516247540712357, -0.08001191914081573, 2.2256044758250937e-06, -0.011028073728084564, -0.022132638841867447, -0.03964054584503174, 0.007