eness and alignment with the school's goals.\u2022 What needs do our children have?\n\u2022 What is currently working well and not well?\n\u2022 Look at the strength of evidence for potential programmes or approaches you\u2019re considering: see the EIF Guidebook, and EEF evaluations for evidence on some well-known programmes.\n\u2022 Has this approach been evaluated previously?\n\u2022 If so, how, where, on which age groups, and with what outcomes?\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 27, "split_id": 88, "split_idx_start": 62614, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "812ec284f51799b08828bdad1999799d293216c545437c37fea055893f1c0fd8", "range": [367, 402]}, {"doc_id": "742abdb6c8377ae59679f0138c5cdbee7bb4f8166e915905a3d016b8443a8bf2", "range": [0, 66]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.055854279547929764, -0.10035990178585052, 0.012364599853754044, 0.01254315860569477, -0.04413243383169174, 0.06384202837944031, 0.030042406171560287, -0.032762013375759125, -0.014869661070406437, 0.0031962695065885782, 0.033360157161951065, 0.004202492069453001, 0.038846179842948914, 0.011839762330055237, 0.014015959575772285, -0.044264066964387894, 0.009205693379044533, 0.047265585511922836, -0.005130161065608263, 0.030636265873908997, -0.01982755959033966, -0.0095117362216115, -0.025503160431981087, -0.013445684686303139, 0.012062275782227516, -0.00618036137893796, -0.05566299334168434, 0.02770044468343258, -0.009541747160255909, -0.06495262682437897, 0.02541113831102848, 0.015629837289452553, -0.02227531000971794, -0.07138879597187042, 2.1999014734319644e-06, -0.011882915161550045, -0.0224987231194973, -0.016218025237321854, 0.028496768325567245, 0.004854519851505756, 0.033030226826667786, 0.03844032064080238, 0.01940026879310608, 0.02168961800634861, 0.009370