10214615], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "742abdb6c8377ae59679f0138c5cdbee7bb4f8166e915905a3d016b8443a8bf2", "content": "This chunk is part of Recommendation 3, which emphasizes the importance of careful planning before adopting a social and emotional learning (SEL) program in schools. It highlights the need to evaluate the evidence of potential programs, ensuring their suitability and alignment with the school's specific context and needs.\u2022 If so, how, where, on which age groups, and with what outcomes?\n\u2022 How similar is that context to my own?\n\u2022 Review the programme content before adopting the approach to ensure that it matches your needs and priority areas for development.\n\u2022 Check sample activities and lesson plans (include teacher views in this assessment). \u2022 Consider piloting in one or two classes before adopting.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 27, "split_id": 89, "split_idx_start": 62924, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "a32f4b8cd1930cdd9f347576968aee1bddcc1fad899b2870e5af3d360f6d897d", "range": [310, 376]}, {"doc_id": "b0f3b0e8dbe6442f4810d09d4bf88d5d5ec4d77ca4e4f3c5e651f2bc68db2f40", "range": [0, 59]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0318436361849308, -0.05345943197607994, 0.01814974658191204, 0.004269537981599569, 0.004747109487652779, 0.052058152854442596, 0.01686372049152851, -0.061021238565444946, 0.025274809449911118, -0.0031817536801099777, 0.004327399656176567, 0.02402217499911785, -0.018606463447213173, 0.053367942571640015, 0.002105581108480692, -0.07485167682170868, -0.00801471620798111, 0.056146275252103806, -0.0009789426112547517, 0.026684099808335304, 0.018728796392679214, 0.022769268602132797, -0.0028103424701839685, -0.034699488431215286, 0.01043778657913208, 0.0059455195441842