 of Social and Emotional Learning (SEL) programmes. It provides tips for schools on selecting effective programmes and addresses key considerations regarding implementation logistics and ongoing support to ensure successful delivery.\u2022 Who will deliver the programme, and how often?\n\u2022 What additional/ongoing support is required to ensure effective delivery? Can we provide this?\nTable 2: Tips for selecting an effective programme\u2014explore and prepare\f26\nEducation Endowment Foundation 4\nS\nA\nF\nE\nUse a SAFE curriculum: Sequential, Active, Focused and Explicit\nAs Recommendation 3 makes clear, evidence to date on SEL supports the use of dedicated lessons that provide step-by-step instructions to teach social and emotional competencies. These can be effectively provided through an \u2018off the shelf\u2019 programme. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 27, "split_id": 94, "split_idx_start": 64014, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "a961bce41ce893bf61dfbda750be793e9b08159685abe7321ce54ddfa8f1b0ab", "range": [230, 279]}, {"doc_id": "9dd212cb2a133366a51e133a1994bdb5c0ae115c0f166948352e46a364e76893", "range": [0, 72]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05615115910768509, -0.09647012501955032, 0.011216509155929089, -0.009102976880967617, -0.011749551631510258, 0.06518402695655823, 0.03720484673976898, -0.04943355172872543, 0.008986344560980797, 0.0022947313264012337, 0.02724490500986576, 0.017198972404003143, 0.017475254833698273, 0.019600898027420044, 0.027574583888053894, -0.09055301547050476, 0.006572685204446316, 0.047165561467409134, -0.03170512989163399, 0.015599162317812443, 0.00206954637542367, 0.027371691539883614, -0.011269981972873211, -0.021173307672142982, -0.0012014620006084442, -0.01708429865539074, -0.04054041206836