achers receive even less training and support despite the fact that teaching assistants, lunch and hall supervisors, catering staff, sports coaches, and other non-teaching staff are with children during many of the interactions that may particularly demand effective SEL strategies and skills.95 Schools may wish to review the EEF\u2019s guidance and training on Teaching Assistants for more information.\f38\nEducation Endowment Foundation Monitor implementation and evaluate the impact of SEL\nThe call to \u2018monitor and evaluate\u2019 can feel like generic advice, and one that risks creating additional workload. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 39, "split_id": 126, "split_idx_start": 88754, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "1eaf5d32e89e1b904224b829b3756434e3391bdd74aaa969a33fea7a6deb7fc6", "range": [194, 406]}, {"doc_id": "11d1af908979faee6adace5ac46a26752ffcba8607def318b52996ec7d3d7ee2", "range": [0, 202]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.034029606729745865, -0.08905826508998871, -0.0016413163393735886, 0.01333136111497879, -0.016097677871584892, 0.06007206812500954, 0.031245337799191475, -0.042929328978061676, -0.012523633427917957, -0.00351446820423007, 0.05659005418419838, -0.009006363339722157, 0.019335070624947548, 0.0077599515207111835, 0.04502749443054199, -0.04710317775607109, -0.0073794773779809475, 0.05531618744134903, -0.028118055313825607, 0.07214847952127457, 0.00999512616544962, 0.002670461079105735, -0.004118849989026785, -0.008287262171506882, -0.029530134052038193, 0.0007859602337703109, -0.03945086896419525, -0.0025734088849276304, 0.02022092230618, -0.024154048413038254, 0.0282735638320446, 0.014510594308376312, -0.014425663277506828, -0.07852784544229507, 2.2846127194497967e-06, 0.023819345980882645, -0.0149923516