r schools and colleges and CORC\u2019s Well-being measurement framework for primary schools provide helpful related resources.\f", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 40, "split_id": 130, "split_idx_start": 91738, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ea86bd5f460abc18d3f13b099c274a6d3518c337f4237e4ec200fec6b4b512eb", "range": [789, 914]}, {"doc_id": "7a60c8e172cd8a84b552ba5a74d2a934dcbcdbc3a7ea756a9fc97d3910d486c8", "range": [0, 212]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.005481134168803692, -0.09327005594968796, -0.004664045758545399, -0.015638556331396103, -0.02936060167849064, 0.048125527799129486, 0.050554804503917694, -0.04214269295334816, 0.008915016427636147, 0.005828536115586758, 0.04576520249247551, 0.011774618178606033, 0.026714781299233437, 0.0035992220509797335, -0.004291211720556021, -0.057013895362615585, -0.009519320912659168, 0.048480115830898285, -0.027580244466662407, 0.05059712380170822, -0.009236264042556286, 0.010324005037546158, -0.0022831493988633156, -0.009006081148982048, -0.013801912777125835, 0.0080772889778018, -0.009211455471813679, 0.014074553735554218, 0.015777193009853363, -0.047706544399261475, 0.012108193710446358, 0.01231522299349308, -0.01569792442023754, -0.054828669875860214, 2.2806302695244085e-06, -0.026527361944317818, -0.04867780581116676, -0.0066189514473080635, 0.004147633910179138, 0.0012258072383701801, -0.010414195246994495, -0.010488796979188919, 0.007009298074990511, 0.02054913341999054, 0.021555041894316673, 0.0046435147523880005, 0.03608974814414978, -0.00032456236658617854, 0.020232459530234337, -0.009472185745835304, 0.01365649327635765, 0.00459802383556962, -0.05274900421500206, -0.027322901412844658, 0.06528027355670929, 0.03844939172267914, 0.0044418987818062305, -0.020283816382288933, 0.032232