s Friends\" program, which is a school-based emotional wellbeing initiative aimed at children in disadvantaged primary schools. It is cited in the context of discussing the effectiveness of various social and emotional learning programs and their implementation in educational settings.Clarke, A. M., Bunting, B. and Barry, M. M (2014) \u2018Evaluating the implementation of a school-based emotional wellbeing programme: a cluster randomised trial of Zippy\u2019s Friends for children in disadvantaged primary schools\u2019, Health Education Research, 29 (5), pp. 786\u2013798; Sloan, S. et al. (2018) \u2018Zippy\u2019s Friends: Evaluation report and executive summary\u2019, London: Education Endowment Foundation.\n27. Wigelsworth, M. et al (forthcoming) \u2018Programmes to Practices: Evidence Review on Social and Emotional Learning\u2019, London: Education Endowment Foundation.\n28. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 43, "split_id": 155, "split_idx_start": 99609, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "9e14ddcf3f82fb678aebbb614ba41afef2403bd7dacecc63ea528ef64a52d3ad", "range": [163, 426]}, {"doc_id": "6c417a24ea5746c06cf137659e26c79772ecbb6d423544ca266a8b49d891cbb8", "range": [0, 4]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03914034739136696, -0.02242959290742874, 0.007345608901232481, 0.01923665776848793, -0.0012890273937955499, 0.04475666582584381, 0.05179443582892418, -0.01616113819181919, -0.03826984763145447, 0.026816286146640778, 0.0041242968291044235, 0.019903231412172318, 0.01015362236648798, -0.00753877405077219, 0.00016188215522561222, -0.05868183448910713, -0.005874195136129856, 0.06020335480570793, -0.019204188138246536, 0.03533212095499039, -0.02618996985256672, 0.009692071937024593, -0.016508758068084717, 0.024342507123947144, 0.0243507307022