009b83521ca981b8dfc1d8fa1902235fdb2f37f49abeb2137fdd2ac22a57313", "content": "This chunk is part of the section titled \"HOW WAS THIS GUIDANCE COMPILED?\" in the guidance report by the Education Endowment Foundation. It outlines the evidence-based approach taken in developing the report on social and emotional learning in primary schools, highlighting the involvement of various researchers and the multi-stage process used to create the guidance.Wallace Foundation.\f44\nEducation Endowment Foundation HOW WAS THIS GUIDANCE COMPILED?\nThis guidance report draws on the best available evidence regarding social and emotional learning in primary schools. It is based on a review conducted by Dr Michael Wigelsworth, Lily Verity, Carla Mason, Professor Neil Humphrey, and Professor Pamela Qualter (University of Manchester).\nThe guidance report was created over four stages:\n1. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Social_and_Emotional_Learning.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ux2ZVY-H62jpu0xzPvuWIaW6mMGtPxRN", "source_id": "e8d637c88ad0e99d399f844be26e40bf15211fc84f01bf87ff947205064caf09", "page_number": 45, "split_id": 206, "split_idx_start": 114942, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "233542cc52d5a121015752272b32ffe1661dc319191728302fcdbd2443abdf9f", "range": [453, 473]}, {"doc_id": "8a8e429eb555784492e4e337a8a31347f5fef284c0a82aa79615407ad9b5f7f3", "range": [0, 53]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.048396605998277664, -0.0722578838467598, -0.004041577689349651, 0.012430224567651749, 0.0219646655023098, 0.03625806048512459, 0.00754832336679101, -0.05903279781341553, 0.034682199358940125, 0.013383778743445873, -0.002253501210361719, -0.001488923910073936, 0.03258872032165527, -0.029105383902788162, 0.025649284943938255, -0.09315858781337738, 0.012228697538375854, 0.05302082374691963, -0.020528731867671013, 0.02280072122812271, -0.0020918508525937796, 0.01715192012488842, 0.03307709842920303, -0.019286833703517914, -0.03335132449865341, -0.0