e importance of understanding individual pupil needs and incorporating inclusive teaching strategies, alongside interventions and collaboration with teaching assistants, as essential components of effective educational support for students with SEND.This means understanding the needs of individual pupils and weaving specific approaches into everyday, high-\nquality classroom teaching\u2014being inclusive by design not as an afterthought. It also means using carefully implemented interventions and working effectively with teaching assistants to offer additional support where needed.\nAs with all our guidance reports, this publication is just the start. We will now be working with the sector, including through our colleagues in the Research Schools Network , to build on the recommendations with further training, resources, and guidance. By engaging with professionals to deliver a research-led approach we can realise our mutual aim to support the attainment and life-chances of some of our most vulnerable pupils. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 4, "split_id": 6, "split_idx_start": 3792, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "8da06adf7b8fc138c366466f9c958d27209a7fc324fa7e485b21364bb4b69401", "range": [504, 690]}, {"doc_id": "5016ffe253c0dfc058b857209c21e8fe451dd05d8761f6f9e2bc44a63c310a44", "range": [0, 178]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.025250807404518127, -0.11347535997629166, -0.012515373528003693, 0.004120950121432543, 0.019477128982543945, 0.020806757733225822, 0.02178632654249668, -0.043792977929115295, 0.0072427913546562195, -0.018304402008652687, 0.06750406324863434, -0.03990441933274269, 0.00977433193475008, 0.020851539447903633, 0.023058798164129257, -0.10852765291929245, 0.029514141380786896, 0.