educational provision. In many cases, the advice here overlaps with other EEF guidance reports such as Metacognition and Self-regulated Learning. We strongly recommend that schools consider other EEF guidance reports when planning their SEND provision. This guidance is based on a focused review of the best available evidence on improving outcomes for pupils with SEND in mainstream schools. The review focused on research related to pupils aged 5\u201316. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 10, "split_idx_start": 6458, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "8b55e008f496dbaf4174adcc405abb2a0c3b6b4f2c9bddd1b080f67e4d10ae61", "range": [437, 537]}, {"doc_id": "60dd9e37c6d6aaed294a7b0df03650f11bb2080753e2a5f43896801d5aa2c2d3", "range": [0, 60]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.008634117431938648, -0.10432650148868561, -0.012050037272274494, -0.005424134898930788, 0.012714756652712822, 0.018232014030218124, 0.033949173986911774, -0.06739599257707596, 0.01633334718644619, -0.020782265812158585, 0.03549288585782051, -0.0016953859012573957, 0.010255475528538227, 0.02134477160871029, 0.03063327446579933, -0.07674288749694824, 0.028387315571308136, -0.013146739453077316, -0.05546511709690094, 0.012112087570130825, -0.020482629537582397, -0.009719004854559898, -0.016997316852211952, -0.008351857773959637, -0.015323258005082607, -0.04939970374107361, 0.019577912986278534, 0.03345158323645592, 0.01193106360733509, -0.02601628378033638, 0.01799987442791462, 0.07346703112125397, -0.01834743283689022, -0.014235864393413067, 2.555782430135878e-06, 0.04229394719004631, 0.010863257572054863, -0.04397207498550415, -0.02523176185786724, -0.024999231100082397, -0.08680012822151184, -0.029566427692770958, 0.029002970084