This highlights the importance of understanding each pupil\u2019s individual journey and the fluctuating nature of their SEN status.They undergo different patterns of development over time as they experience and interact with different environments in different ways. As pupils age, the complexity of their needs will change. Some pupils might not have SEN to begin with but will develop SEN as they mature. Other pupils who are considered to have SEN at the beginning of their lives will no longer have these needs later in life.\nEnvironment\nPupils\u2019 needs will change as they move through different environments and life experiences. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 8, "split_id": 24, "split_idx_start": 16314, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "dbb7409ce02fe0f75534978215e22aee3fcdeb066dff476294f5160cfc0329f6", "range": [332, 468]}, {"doc_id": "8d4e991de23fd091e856c5c39beb051bc19444f7095e6dc50770b21ee16b699e", "range": [0, 104]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.038185469806194305, -0.04781252518296242, -0.034974996000528336, -0.01600007712841034, -0.014746665954589844, -0.006548004224896431, 0.017602896317839622, -0.046085912734270096, -0.011133231222629547, 0.01692713238298893, 0.03609685227274895, -0.031147336587309837, 0.0432032011449337, -0.015950659289956093, -0.03229600936174393, -0.13180677592754364, 0.02459365874528885, 0.011082812212407589, -0.02229328453540802, 0.025059033185243607, -0.03436467796564102, 0.0040512122213840485, -0.05453362315893173, 0.006480751559138298, 0.021737778559327126, -0.05754411220550537, 0.015405057929456234, -0.010098258033394814, 0.05423892289400101, 0.0046922327019274235, 0.06690593808889389, 0.04289167746901512, 0.041686177253723145, -0.04008415713906288, 2.498407