t does not come by accident, it is achieved through design. Furthermore, it is imperative that leaders embed this culture proactively.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 12, "split_id": 37, "split_idx_start": 24429, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "c625c7f2fcf561f85b4d865bf913e6d60c19458e399ba104def1117ad0f5df4e", "range": [359, 439]}, {"doc_id": "cbce9ecaf9faa65c0d3f4806abdc8ac01e52fca109e03a461d487f78400d8ab4", "range": [0, 75]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.020854664966464043, -0.05075623467564583, -0.028113050386309624, 0.016894282773137093, 0.03521423041820526, 0.012611210346221924, -0.02225373312830925, -0.038801055401563644, 0.012095138430595398, 0.008582940325140953, 0.05077814683318138, 0.018935464322566986, 0.0025412910617887974, 0.011572404764592648, 0.0030363048426806927, -0.05177030339837074, 0.037164147943258286, 0.024317342787981033, -0.1019011065363884, 0.02141541615128517, -0.030769191682338715, 0.0021570881363004446, 0.02545110695064068, -0.006503060460090637, -0.011061734519898891, 0.003456042381003499, -0.012333236634731293, 0.032800815999507904, 0.010925202630460262, 0.02512454055249691, 0.04684062674641609, 0.0021060120780020952, -0.011909367516636848, -0.04693768545985222, 2.304012696185964e-06, 0.022079352289438248, -0.01286270096898079, -0.023763583973050117, -0.009442253038287163, -0.02334280125796795, -0.040622930973768234, 0.002559277229011059, 0.0015715410700067878, 0.028788316994905472, -0.00813906267285347, 0.03762875497341156, -0.041457585990428925, -0.019292348995804787, 0.017100583761930466, -0.024569153785705566, 0.012732635252177715, -0.04202906787395477, -0.03711975738406181, 0.0012351019540801644, 0.03718601539731026, 0.02533446066081524, 0.00770906824618578, -