ress is not sufficient, further measures such as a statutory assessment could be considered. Box 5 and the comic strip overleaf are two examples of the graduated approach in practice.\nWhat are the barriers to learning that the pupil is experiencing and in which subjects?\nWhat are their strengths, interests, and aspirations?\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 17, "split_id": 55, "split_idx_start": 39394, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "41c2affa68db68fbd621855f5534616b489dbeab4cb5b48b1624469238394fc1", "range": [1276, 1460]}, {"doc_id": "39e08ef4e21d315ad3c24cbe16b0f4687274e9c0b3e22771836959d523559134", "range": [0, 54]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.01766757294535637, -0.08622152358293533, -0.01618775725364685, -0.01773732341825962, -0.011281360872089863, 0.02176581509411335, 0.0400812104344368, -0.027701377868652344, -0.021075842902064323, 0.015796350315213203, 0.05899334326386452, -0.008373568765819073, 0.015727929770946503, -0.004548006225377321, -0.034963902086019516, -0.11937312036752701, 0.019183600321412086, 0.010262055322527885, -0.044760044664144516, 0.02398388274013996, -0.04407282918691635, 0.014252307824790478, -0.04246461018919945, -0.012284635566174984, 0.013687835074961185, -0.07352853566408157, 0.007915670052170753, 0.012580713257193565, 0.012638215906918049, -0.028144050389528275, 0.031181616708636284, 0.07574877142906189, -0.0037793994415551424, -0.007006523665040731, 2.2484539385914104e-06, 0.029385410249233246, 0.0023551813792437315, -0.019996125251054764, -0.03145818039774895, 0.01599298045039177, -0.04181850329041481, 0.009672795422375202, 0.031187240034341812, 0.026677872985601425, -0.014579514041543007, -0.015100792981684208, 0.010930830612778664, 0.0027014403603971004, 0.