about the type of support that could work; this decision should consider the research evidence about effective classroom teaching strategies and targeted interventions (see Recommendations 3 and 4) as well as evidence-based strategies suggested by an external professional.\nOutcomes for Sam were agreed for the first half-term:\n1. Sam will have completed a successful transfer to his secondary school\u2014including moving independently around the school, finding a safe space at break time, and building good relationships with key adults.\n2. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 18, "split_id": 58, "split_idx_start": 40929, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "caae48d5d33f9b1f8a7f3ed13161032ff3f2bb20214d6223be1394537b9929c3", "range": [522, 630]}, {"doc_id": "3c7db29c64fa7b24cca25c3a70769d815dd746767cfe6864a59f8f9b6ba3a1b0", "range": [0, 3]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06410420686006546, -0.09644682705402374, 0.01103789359331131, -0.030653921887278557, -0.010744569823145866, 0.021119242534041405, -0.002254041377454996, -0.02333064377307892, -0.02925472892820835, 0.00598770659416914, 0.07522189617156982, -0.013238017447292805, 0.039969753473997116, -0.03440746292471886, -0.03289030119776726, -0.09112421423196793, 0.02678295597434044, 0.008354338817298412, -0.06808307021856308, 0.008080299012362957, -0.0380631685256958, 0.029149333015084267, -0.0235028937458992, 0.00041475085890851915, -0.00964119378477335, -0.041542984545230865, -0.004890042822808027, 0.044048815965652466, -0.000550023396499455, -0.0398743636906147, 0.06466642022132874, 0.04708827659487724, -0.022930439561605453, -0.05415738373994827, 2.5168649244733388e-06, 0.019394701346755028, -0.013045316562056541, -0.00845309253782034, -0.007751967292