t can be difficult to involve all parents in ways that support children\u2019s learning. The EEF guidance report, Working with Parents to Support Children\u2019s Learning , has four key recommendations for schools:\n1. Critically review how you work with parents.\n2. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 20, "split_id": 69, "split_idx_start": 46375, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "a91b83d55818b5edd523a7876515121fbb9386afa7c852ab018ead0705f1d941", "range": [955, 1372]}, {"doc_id": "bf71fd4321cf5d76528478a8cb3a02542ea76f6e1e83235c23cc50f60087bbf0", "range": [0, 3]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.006065227556973696, -0.12078440934419632, -0.033155255019664764, 0.015704208984971046, -0.035211097449064255, 0.049398016184568405, 0.03607169911265373, -0.0284549742937088, -0.006169348955154419, 0.0019204887794330716, 0.026952574029564857, -0.03594019263982773, 0.06381702423095703, 0.002001948654651642, -0.024075046181678772, -0.024852097034454346, 0.013204813934862614, 0.019796233624219894, -0.02664591372013092, 0.046730320900678635, -0.02547507919371128, -0.0038275839760899544, -0.01888592541217804, -0.006297953426837921, -0.007517453283071518, -0.02553039975464344, -0.01587977632880211, 0.023458242416381836, 0.0318419449031353, -0.010485743172466755, 0.07709555327892303, 0.014605908654630184, -0.02370372973382473, -0.03057810291647911, 2.138883246516343e-06, 0.04303472861647606, -0.012240330688655376, -0.02136201038956642, 0.0007173810736276209, 0.006442312151193619, -0.023550940677523613, 0.014725174754858017, 0.008542901836335659, 0.045788757503032684, -0.0066803558729588985, 0.05687021091580391, -0.002589152893051505, -0.027901243418455124, 0.0015665633836761117, -0.006613839417695999, 0.01174151245504617