e recommendations for schools on how to engage parents and carers in supporting their children's learning, particularly for pupils with Special Educational Needs and Disabilities (SEND). It emphasizes the importance of communication and practical strategies to foster a collaborative environment between home and school.2. Provide practical strategies to support learning at home.\n3. Tailor school communications to encourage positive dialogue about learning.\n4. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 20, "split_id": 70, "split_idx_start": 47055, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "8658f1d98b3bd0411a2e7510245d4b6caef6a46c5bddb8f555bb3ae2609e0eaf", "range": [680, 683]}, {"doc_id": "a8bd1517321e2186d43c4dee017ca5b6da7717aa00e68313b1354a3c6107d1d6", "range": [0, 3]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.013547937385737896, -0.096113421022892, -0.029085030779242516, -0.01544475369155407, -0.0172414630651474, 0.01012494508177042, 0.04243995249271393, -0.038023728877305984, -0.002599854953587055, -0.0005192172829993069, 0.006609145551919937, -0.021331164985895157, 0.05107703059911728, 0.022149892523884773, -0.020321793854236603, -0.06091903895139694, -0.0020589176565408707, 0.031228961423039436, -0.03628889471292496, 0.006881514098495245, -0.008553113788366318, 0.01721007563173771, -0.013187161646783352, -0.01738467812538147, 0.01586773432791233, -0.040663111954927444, 0.01644752360880375, 0.022594153881072998, 0.04405456781387329, -0.01652357541024685, 0.0940907672047615, 0.034242790192365646, 0.005097697488963604, -0.01809975504875183, 2.2364222331816563e-06, 0.04511740431189537, 0.024032264947891235, -0.02803260087966919, -0.04586612805724144, -0.030121199786663055, -0.002456068526953459, -0.02166454680263996, 0.0370389