e legislative framework served children and young people with special educational needs and/or disabilities. The findings chimed with my own experiences. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 22, "split_id": 77, "split_idx_start": 52344, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "43a2e99b0f990b227e20e407db5d43f08c51e694a669bedf033a3d6c67b91aa3", "range": [595, 687]}, {"doc_id": "4a6b31578ccac0519bcffc78ae0a0a7610ee9b140556a3b4581f83cd2abd10f5", "range": [0, 45]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.02455608732998371, -0.07202768325805664, -0.0017680831952020526, 0.002197298454120755, 0.01715308427810669, 0.0181617122143507, -0.01741780899465084, -0.044694479554891586, 0.0007747531635686755, 0.003172303084284067, 0.04643019288778305, -0.036980438977479935, 0.009968036785721779, -0.020683759823441505, -0.0038137517403811216, -0.12146971374750137, -0.012742633931338787, 0.02236010506749153, -0.04851682484149933, 0.02952626720070839, 0.008015628904104233, 0.011754470877349377, 0.022742984816432, 0.0013196248328313231, -0.019425896927714348, -0.013735342770814896, 0.009992779232561588, 0.019759170711040497, 0.03877125680446625, -0.023290280252695084, 0.05564131215214729, 0.033337246626615524, 0.0104873301461339, -0.016871189698576927, 2.5470305899943924e-06, 0.06446392834186554, 0.028708575293421745, -0.03190269321203232, -0.017638545483350754, -0.018941450864076614, -0.06566007435321808, -0.024312688037753105, 0.008275828324258327, 0.04470028355717659, -0.002206123899668455, 0.039636194705963135, 0.015154124237596989, -0.04595126584172249, 0.035591091960668564, -0.04551664739847183, -0.000432218803325668, -0.008400359191000462, -0.0032618551049381495, -0.019468123093247414, 0.0613725520670414, -0.033572085201740265, -0.020