eflects on the ongoing challenges faced in adequately supporting these students within mainstream education and critiques the responses to their learning needs, emphasizing the importance of effective teaching strategies over arbitrary labeling and ineffective interventions.The findings chimed with my own experiences. It concluded that many pupils identified as having SEND were underachieving, but this was sometimes simply because the school\u2019s mainstream teaching provision was not good enough.\nA decade on, I really don\u2019t think that things have changed much for some children with SEND. All too often, children who are \u2018working below\u2019 national expectations are given arbitrary labels without a precise assessment. There is a risk that we respond with flimsy interventions (they provide a nice paper trail) but don\u2019t stop to consider the quality of our teaching. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 23, "split_id": 78, "split_idx_start": 52896, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "7cae75c5a0864b3967b9fc54d1efa8c5eeaa6f88083d22179163e51efab53963", "range": [552, 597]}, {"doc_id": "e96491c5730f53984dea164157002267b570b4962f12725bd92d91f29455f1a6", "range": [0, 148]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.020009895786643028, -0.09453185647726059, -0.004410272464156151, 0.007432965096086264, 0.01726163923740387, 0.0338534377515316, 0.016173677518963814, -0.05362739413976669, 0.0006467748316936195, 0.007325786165893078, 0.053558867424726486, 0.011735673062503338, 0.033094216138124466, 0.010940619744360447, 0.010520529001951218, -0.1098584458231926, 0.013927082531154156, 0.03174518048763275, -0.06206800788640976, 0.026007791981101036, -0.024641312658786774, -0.0022791349329054356, -0.007500223815441132,