 bedrock of our practice. They also form the recommendations of many a good Ed Psych report (which sometimes feels to me like closing the door after the horse has bolted!). Good teaching for children with SEND is good teaching for all.\u2019\nBox 6: A view from a SENCo\u2026 \u201c \u201c\f22\nEducation Endowment Foundation Cognitive and metacognitive strategies Cognition is the mental process involved in knowing, understanding, and learning. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 23, "split_id": 80, "split_idx_start": 53838, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "e96491c5730f53984dea164157002267b570b4962f12725bd92d91f29455f1a6", "range": [498, 586]}, {"doc_id": "db0300163b3b5f00187340b8398550b0f480661e6494b8f7d7104b6b3833506d", "range": [0, 251]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.01964103989303112, -0.07156571000814438, -0.017598172649741173, 0.01184646412730217, 0.0014426503330469131, 0.047671929001808167, 0.03537416830658913, -0.011265776120126247, -0.029394105076789856, -0.006878394167870283, 0.017090117558836937, -0.039438433945178986, 0.0392872616648674, -0.05305372178554535, 0.00555729866027832, -0.05954493582248688, 0.009374458342790604, 0.05205706134438515, -0.0391169972717762, 0.03179594501852989, -0.05016150698065758, -0.05712713301181793, -0.041994813829660416, -0.01583404280245304, 0.01788032427430153, -0.06257882714271545, 0.01632372848689556, 0.00837364699691534, -0.02004617638885975, -0.046358026564121246, 0.03442946448922157, 0.014772283844649792, 0.027390379458665848, -0.04636102169752121, 2.0170205061731394e-06, 0.011891581118106842, -0.00783038605004549, -0.0168378297239542, 0.009112512692809105, 0.008474628441035748, -0.012290610000491142, 0.03550169989466667, 0.0081323916092515, 0.0451477952