inking to help pupils develop their metacognitive and cognitive skills.\n4. Set an appropriate level of challenge to develop pupils\u2019 self-regulation and metacognition.\n5. Promote and develop metacognitive talk in the classroom.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 24, "split_id": 85, "split_idx_start": 56951, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "753ae3bd10d32caea128d704fb65906343428a9e8a0e1b8c2e2c4887694473c4", "range": [233, 322]}, {"doc_id": "e37c3463c87528fac029fa7aca83f06bf5bcce5f79c7e5bceade19ac1d53cbfc", "range": [0, 57]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04561614245176315, -0.11165358126163483, -0.02904774807393551, -0.004913225769996643, 0.0018261047080159187, 0.0006224766257219017, 0.05433664098381996, -0.08301349729299545, -0.028758162632584572, -0.00782964751124382, -0.005915498360991478, 0.03003699518740177, 0.0007392739062197506, -0.008863551542162895, 0.02422134019434452, -0.10941941291093826, 0.03262721747159958, -0.025975080206990242, -0.009799010120332241, 0.011338550597429276, -0.04528127610683441, -0.024236148223280907, -0.046748265624046326, -0.023557128384709358, 0.0007694124942645431, -0.08019480854272842, 0.050244495272636414, 0.0262900423258543, 0.013664294965565205, -0.036746930330991745, 0.039730969816446304, 0.028620077297091484, -0.029826438054442406, -0.05900298058986664, 2.1638732050632825e-06, 0.0054632737301290035, -0.022777393460273743, -0.053041115403175354, -0.03961024805903435, -0.025146786123514175, -0.03041093610227108, 0.027177372947335243, 0.013343793340027332, 0.05106799304485321, 0.0005607054918073118, 0.05769912153482437, -0.009347043000161648, 0.011726140044629574, 0.04783962666988373, -0.0251265037804842, -0.0015039356658235192, 0.03112337365746498, -0.03435