an be made between the teaching strategy used and how it is applied.37 Addressing SEND may require additional consideration of individual needs, intensity and time, and the need for flexibility:\n\u2022 Response to need: It is important that these strategies are deployed in response to individual learning needs and barriers. What is the pupil struggling with? What are you trying to teach? Many of these strategies provide the opportunity to update your knowledge of the pupil\u2019s needs as you teach. How will you adjust the strategy as you develop this fuller understanding? ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 29, "split_id": 102, "split_idx_start": 65938, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "f97f5b4ec3f906cddec64d522ae5376eb7afc44a09e7677be846044c5504fdbd", "range": [376, 958]}, {"doc_id": "ce2f87ce8c54463be2d865c00ad07bec8cbcafed3cd3d98764ef560959bb6a95", "range": [0, 75]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.02638196013867855, -0.1083257794380188, -0.027602342888712883, 0.014557944610714912, -0.02564130537211895, 0.031805094331502914, 0.05356711521744728, -0.019015055149793625, -0.09508083015680313, 0.020355671644210815, 0.050226010382175446, -0.037054967135190964, 0.061920031905174255, -0.022052299231290817, 0.007122726645320654, -0.13149651885032654, 0.01682702824473381, 0.02971075288951397, -0.026526913046836853, 0.045967407524585724, -0.029876047745347023, -0.014276345260441303, -0.05454819276928902, -0.003909270744770765, -0.014544655568897724, -0.04945152997970581, 0.020839421078562737, -3.9361220842693e-05, 0.0023213494569063187, -0.03343465179204941, 0.04429009184241295, 0.023990344256162643, 0.017984481528401375, -0.08194328844547272, 2.3041473014018266e-06, 0.012058165855705738, -0.01041289884597063