g TAs to secure the best outcomes for pupils?\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 36, "split_id": 126, "split_idx_start": 80915, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "e1834491a234ac1237a5dc372b81acd53f8edeb36eeee0490e5277fe4f10a07b", "range": [628, 732]}, {"doc_id": "3febd8a055fa5d2b970b6dc2cf2c8fd15599063b4eb185e2c07622deeb20607b", "range": [0, 90]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05457071587443352, -0.10161379724740982, -0.02367645502090454, 0.019011089578270912, 0.008722907863557339, 0.009237325750291348, 0.0497770719230175, -0.08982977271080017, -0.043065447360277176, -0.0019141251686960459, 0.05664969980716705, -0.014236663468182087, 0.04081902652978897, -0.01222902536392212, 0.03398160636425018, -0.12740595638751984, 0.002436010865494609, 0.018222160637378693, -0.049288902431726456, 0.033419519662857056, 0.007935850881040096, 0.012441015802323818, -0.021684376522898674, 0.014548019506037235, -0.0017178638372570276, -0.020568881183862686, 0.002191294217482209, 0.009107758291065693, 0.038886941969394684, 0.017659319564700127, 0.0335339680314064, -0.0012373211793601513, 0.0038773841224610806, -0.033816516399383545, 2.363020939810667e-06, 0.06057588383555412, 0.0269912276417017, -0.013776165433228016, -0.0010434568393975496, -0.01609838381409645, -0.0834076777100563, 0.019287753850221634, 0.016447309404611588, 0.05194241926074028, -0.005857790820300579, 0.041051771491765976, -0.0008247666992247105, -0.047823261469602585, 0.015823345631361008, -0.034139376133680344, 0.005148862022906542, 0.008111720904707909, -0.011311795562505722, -0.034862220287323, 0.035043440759181976, -0.05335751548409462, -0.011149068363010883, -0.08053354918956757, 0.02735840529203415, -0.002171028172597289, -0.021380960941314697, 