ageable introduction focusing on five key recommendations that should be the focus for school improvement.\nThe advisory panel included Adam Boddison, Julia Carroll, Maria Constantinou, Mairi-Ann Cullen, Geoff Lindsay, Margaret Mulholland, Christine Oliver, and Rebecca Pentney. We would like to thank them for the support, challenge, and input they provided throughout the process. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "EEF_Special_Educational_Needs_in_Mainstream_Schools_Guidance_Report.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JdqrM1riD57oBlBO2rxsYWM-BECtkBOI", "source_id": "74ab0c4b037724e2e6a15bac6c92262e5c8cee040eab7233c78628898f0a7eb6", "page_number": 43, "split_id": 169, "split_idx_start": 101935, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "506150048485ae2819a9161d45157cedbaf5c0493c5bbae55c6d67a2034f5a2d", "range": [278, 393]}, {"doc_id": "0a390468b27f62a076699de5008a58e8e4b16685d76c3a6a83f026d08a7a4b2e", "range": [0, 104]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.008875476196408272, -0.06773176044225693, -0.010357636958360672, -0.011251334100961685, 0.023159468546509743, 0.014898858964443207, 0.013621094636619091, -0.05363883078098297, 0.026933567598462105, -0.0007324378821067512, 0.04790835082530975, -0.01774900034070015, 0.02931484952569008, 0.03826616331934929, 0.017532020807266235, -0.10093298554420471, 0.013034917414188385, 0.004494412336498499, -0.06854575127363205, 0.013699987903237343, -0.0062469071708619595, 0.015219545923173428, 0.0038983027916401625, 0.0071174511685967445, -0.013804198242723942, -0.030696043744683266, 0.016091367229819298, 0.03303378075361252, 0.038522690534591675, 0.009463640861213207, 0.022223414853215218, 0.06366385519504547, -0.018403485417366028, -0.025951407849788666, 2.581627541076159e-06, 0.060553498566150665, 0.04968392848968506, -0.030770916491746902, -0.028004243969917297, -0.022292474284768105, -0.09195256233215332, -0.03759114444255829, 0.030546391382813454, 0.04293578490614891, 0.022991014644503593, 0.0172318127006