"This chunk describes the initial challenges faced by Tom, an 8-year-old autistic pupil at Watermore Primary School, during his reception year. It highlights his significant anxiety and disruptive behaviors, which posed difficulties for both staff and peers, leading to his perceived intimidating presence in the classroom.He appeared to be extremely anxious and his behaviour was challenging for staff. He hit other children, threw construction bricks at a teacher and told the headteacher to \u2018 shut up\u2019. Tom was perceived as intimidating by his peers as he was very assertive in his play. He struggled with turn-taking, sharing and being able to wait. He ran away from staff frequently when he was not able to cope with the situation. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 2, "split_id": 2, "split_idx_start": 1204, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "40ddb4d73d541a0cf298c286f4eafcf55b83d6637c516cdbe95e8407ebdf31a2", "range": [436, 517]}, {"doc_id": "54c32de5a21f974a1109df166b0e6a2d9b66ccd0f62a17f6f3fc71af8b7c7291", "range": [0, 83]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03802201896905899, -0.04103041812777519, 0.0006321508553810418, 0.012456248514354229, 0.027775000780820847, 0.03037634864449501, 0.03353561460971832, -0.06515893340110779, -0.031182002276182175, 0.004487024620175362, 0.0218481607735157, -0.055501826107501984, -0.006092690397053957, -0.029608072713017464, -0.0014506286242976785, -0.05225331708788872, 0.017736978828907013, 0.011944477446377277, -0.018001189455389977, 0.008605999872088432, 0.008074620738625526, 0.0022712263744324446, 0.0012620574561879039, 0.015117548406124115, 0.01301325298845768, -0.022392066195607185, 0.035047732293605804, 0.003257985692471266, 0.03040391393005848, -0.04220334440469742, -0.001693962374702096, 0.0206877