 and less anxious.\nThis case study illustrates a number of the strategies that were successfully implemented to support Tom and to reduce his anxiety.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 3, "split_id": 5, "split_idx_start": 2260, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "295b79bf0315813038c7621fa4a783ea0b1e07f8c4835a065cd9d833b7b27e38", "range": [431, 495]}, {"doc_id": "d68f9869f4cbdec72684f96aeb1466962a020bdddb29af2eda94b7693a473f90", "range": [0, 132]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.021922601386904716, -0.04146507754921913, -0.002223019488155842, 0.012401298619806767, 0.01310321968048811, 0.024774447083473206, 0.014115645550191402, -0.058281395584344864, -0.028248576447367668, -0.001629160949960351, 0.005639892537146807, -0.04441821947693825, 0.005560991354286671, -0.0054397257044911385, -0.01856807805597782, -0.044234562665224075, 0.018650515004992485, 0.02583562582731247, 0.0020335083827376366, 0.010952555574476719, -0.015519714914262295, 0.0094504589214921, 0.007882253266870975, -0.0050108651630580425, 0.039745770394802094, -0.02342764101922512, 0.04431040212512016, 0.013446532189846039, 0.03998861461877823, -0.044784050434827805, 0.01270967535674572, 0.017026670277118683, -0.0011203704634681344, 0.044050879776477814, 2.610431465654983e-06, 0.053136661648750305, 0.03077332116663456, -0.03608156740665436, 0.026324400678277016, -0.012906152755022049, -0.029866939410567284, 0.00635194918140769, 0.035514671355485916, 0.06254736334085464, -0.0025091555435210466, 0.007320841774344444, 0.02034791372716427, 0.03438590094447136, 0.03543708473443985, -0.024204660207033157, -0.013111423701047897, 0.005496419034898281, -0.010584035888314247, -0.021463390439748764, 0.05208347365260124, -0.04013366624712944, 0.007465595845133066, -0.07132808119058609, 0.09