egration and helped the staff devise a personalised sensory plan for Tom. The OT added her expertise by suggesting further activities.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 20, "split_idx_start": 8379, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "d5c05d2f3b26f1454f9c3f59312e80a32524b2b721f59c0976741dca29e2eb93", "range": [443, 568]}, {"doc_id": "f81b1d5e1863b9eedffee36b7869ae0691fbde57e7a3a119ab488361228541b7", "range": [0, 61]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.008903393521904945, -0.10748191177845001, -0.019814012572169304, 0.04086897522211075, 0.023626338690519333, 0.028733376413583755, 0.026060964912176132, -0.031160008162260056, 0.008927051909267902, 0.004470511805266142, 0.0025220317766070366, -0.010576372966170311, -0.036753177642822266, -0.02617369405925274, -0.010330423712730408, -0.07344084233045578, -0.00341053563170135, 0.03733029216527939, -0.04360885173082352, 0.02574874646961689, 0.005321524105966091, 0.017567329108715057, -0.007463397923856974, 0.026882080361247063, 0.024315010756254196, -0.01193189062178135, 0.010676765814423561, -0.0009745577117428184, 0.05522705987095833, -0.05635495111346245, 0.031217388808727264, -0.012449485249817371, -0.0062965452671051025, 0.024556048214435577, 2.298369736308814e-06, 0.10329487174749374, 0.0010654001962393522, -0.02606736309826374, 0.017115646973252296, -0.044409431517124176, -0.04990639537572861, -0.018006905913352966, 0.027530953288078308, 0.04621141776442528, -0.005976728163659573, 0.01560490857809782, 0.024601943790912628, 0.025451483204960823, 0.026977473869919777, -0.02555796131491661, 0.003105795942246914, 0.02062821015715599, -0.008924618363380432, 0.002690655644983053, 0.03597480431199074, -0.023687532171607018, -0.015610107220709324, -0.10151392221450806, 0.09666217118501663