n and attitude of the Senior Leadership Team and staff in addressing Tom's needs, particularly regarding transitions.The OT added her expertise by suggesting further activities.\nSupport for Tom is viewed as a whole school issue by the Senior Leadership Team. The whole staff team has a \u2018 can do\u2019 attitude. The Headteacher\u2019s philosophy is that \u201cIt needs a village to raise a child\u201d .\fGood Autism Practice Guide \u2013 Case Studies\n6 Doc ref: GAP report - case studies_I-S\nTom needed extra support for transitions. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 21, "split_idx_start": 8856, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ff03c386dc2f2772937fddc94f6c798c14d3871bce1fed7f9702c8b6575394ed", "range": [477, 538]}, {"doc_id": "f8338cf649ef4d5b078289a16a18ddbfab50b9f809cb78b1c69a78fedc88f058", "range": [0, 125]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03894462436437607, -0.0269432682543993, 0.0010843812488019466, 0.009687279351055622, -0.003954277373850346, 0.019506728276610374, 0.01077486015856266, -0.0672612264752388, -0.023507002741098404, 0.0035144409630447626, 0.043845780193805695, -0.033390630036592484, -0.005687273573130369, 0.008871974423527718, -0.027683941647410393, -0.0724862813949585, 0.002918056445196271, 0.031039724126458168, -0.024282246828079224, 0.017150241881608963, 0.0011000243248417974, 0.017368927597999573, 0.011315010488033295, 0.006841066759079695, 0.03258780762553215, -0.009527714923024178, 0.02358582802116871, 0.027201207354664803, 0.05982903391122818, -0.0419592410326004, 0.010338043794035912, 0.0048805722035467625, -0.023741982877254486, 0.019069384783506393, 2.7782903089246247e-06, 0.07252361625432968, 0.020042946562170982, -0.03168516606092453, 0.002515909494832158, -0.047497689723968506, -0.07718536257