n that aligns with his interests, enhancing his overall wellbeing and learning experience.You may like it.\u201d\nP6 \u2013 An ethos and environment that fosters social inclusion for children and young people on the autism spectrum\nTom was given a clear place to work away from other children by having a work station set up against a plain wall. A safe space or \u2018haven\u2019 was created for Tom where he could go when he needed. This was a small room near the classroom that was usually used for group activities. This room was tailored to his interests ( e.g. he had a board of Pok\u00e9mon cards on the wall). ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 6, "split_id": 25, "split_idx_start": 10132, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "32f87792f95aae41c4fe1cd670f8258c4c433cd7c409fa16db50550ecc8e3c53", "range": [259, 505]}, {"doc_id": "ee067817b6f48968f8a6a9856faa82d90f2061032ffd9d691deb997859154a9e", "range": [0, 46]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.027190685272216797, -0.047784268856048584, -0.023807566612958908, 0.012805307283997536, -0.009972574189305305, 0.008547341451048851, 0.04629291221499443, -0.05005401000380516, -0.042749013751745224, 0.005589819047600031, 0.024886304512619972, -0.01680517941713333, 0.026007208973169327, -0.004639686085283756, -0.012754010036587715, -0.05595146119594574, 0.031305454671382904, 0.029610443860292435, -0.06841570138931274, 0.022695880383253098, -0.03709034249186516, 0.009498350322246552, 0.017314527183771133, 0.030540337786078453, 0.0359673909842968, -0.014384170062839985, 0.014612104743719101, 0.016760358586907387, 0.026671621948480606, -0.008905868977308273, 0.046678315848112106, -0.008883707225322723, -0.004528015851974487, 0.032631561160087585, 2.4724286049604416e-06, 0.046962425112724304, 0.034073203802108765,