nd participate in learning activities effectively.He has a morning routine where he goes to his own safe room first. Friends can come in to say hello. Once the class is settled, Tom joins them for English. He stays in class for whole class teaching and is allowed to draw or doodle as the teacher talks, but then goes to his room to complete his work. During transition times, he goes to his room first and then moves to the next activity.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 7, "split_id": 29, "split_idx_start": 11691, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "4e0d2eecf1e8b279202a38d6eb0002623dfd8717bbe6c33241ebaf87b34a4fb5", "range": [493, 560]}, {"doc_id": "329cf85aa9cb829166d82564135df9973af79b144fc47971696c0ca34615e77e", "range": [0, 88]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.02170303463935852, -0.04212329909205437, -0.019060516729950905, 0.009667175821959972, -0.01601223833858967, 0.02325977198779583, 0.04381018504500389, -0.07901381701231003, -0.058651044964790344, 0.010669720359146595, 0.0397932231426239, -0.048079781234264374, -0.012437457218766212, -0.0033100214786827564, -0.021022435277700424, -0.06009487435221672, 0.013356451876461506, 0.018741894513368607, -0.031944338232278824, 0.03222539275884628, -0.03942393139004707, -0.006625743117183447, -0.02882242389023304, 0.01773921400308609, 0.044708479195833206, -0.02174580842256546, 0.009396634064614773, 0.0012069280492141843, 0.044493623077869415, -0.046047601848840714, 0.01185112725943327, 0.030339648947119713, 0.011829779483377934, 0.03334138169884682, 2.502077677490888e-06, 0.0318538099527359, 0.021037215366959572, -0.03124058246612549, 0.00014866131823509932, -0.045208919793367386, -0.038489531725645065, 0.00398139376193285, 0.04676118493080139, 0.03310388699173927, -0.0033743877429515123, 0.0259