od Autism Practice Guide \u2013 Case Studies\n10 Doc ref: GAP report - case studies_I-S\nUnderstanding the individual with autism\nP1 \u2013 Understanding the strengths, interests and challenges of the autistic child and young person\nThe strategies used take account of research work on understanding the brain. Staff have implemented an approach called \u2018Settling the glitter\u2019 for calming children who are dysregulated. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 9, "split_id": 37, "split_idx_start": 16950, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "a7f0ce28a80ed9bcd00fd84cff20c19c7a5fd6b8543a2bfcbc759d112b37c542", "range": [580, 688]}, {"doc_id": "f7e3c2b35470a9bd9b190b1dfb7607affe3440cb680ef57abca435e6229b94e7", "range": [0, 108]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04483877122402191, -0.05030354857444763, -0.013701905496418476, 0.0222413782030344, -0.002189772902056575, 0.01896732859313488, 0.017277918756008148, -0.042927633970975876, -0.06299486756324768, -0.0005808841669932008, 0.04380069673061371, -0.03598767891526222, 0.013985429890453815, 0.014648226089775562, -0.008193238638341427, -0.06704407930374146, -0.0013737399131059647, 0.028750339522957802, -0.04541156813502312, 0.015306138433516026, 0.00738278916105628, 0.03386964276432991, 0.012943263165652752, 0.021015888080000877, 0.029002169147133827, -0.044435709714889526, 0.011274782009422779, 0.016686439514160156, 0.04134031757712364, -0.04910421743988991, 0.03981988504528999, 0.03658713027834892, -0.02309451624751091, 0.010038767009973526, 2.5982358238252345e-06, 0.04218678921461105, 0.02821747213602066, -0.01974913850426674, -0.016075624153017998, -0.017812101170420647, -0.05533796548843384, -0.021864496171474457, 0.03248892351984978, 0.0763438269495964, -0.009159873239696026, -0.0292753744870424