70a9bd9b190b1dfb7607affe3440cb680ef57abca435e6229b94e7", "content": "This chunk is part of Case Study B: Oasis Academy Connaught, which focuses on strategies to support children with autism, particularly in developing mindfulness and emotional regulation. The implementation of the \"Settling the glitter\" approach aims to calm dysregulated children and is reflected through visuals and assembly discussions within the school environment.Staff have implemented an approach called \u2018Settling the glitter\u2019 for calming children who are dysregulated. The original idea was from Susan Kaiser Greenland in her book The Mindful Child . It was promoted as a strategy by the Momentous Institute in their blog https://momentousinstitute.\norg/blog/settle-your-glitter . This was introduced through assemblies and is evident through visuals around the school ( e.g. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 10, "split_id": 38, "split_idx_start": 17513, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "38a4f11f2147b054552d15dbd773b14d378021fffeebbcdd586c2502dac77aa6", "range": [563, 671]}, {"doc_id": "7a9dc6256c38f2da62b67b7952cc0c6ebc7d3db8465545f09e6b9a7b529ac5a2", "range": [0, 95]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05980154499411583, -0.05795463174581528, -0.02300931140780449, 0.03609068691730499, -0.0019519402412697673, -0.007297532632946968, -0.0004141779209021479, -0.006740259006619453, -0.0845327153801918, -0.0010264861630275846, 0.04878900572657585, -0.00832559447735548, 0.007338630501180887, 0.021177154034376144, -0.014292829670011997, -0.09018920361995697, -0.009839886799454689, 0.027408218011260033, -0.029570654034614563, 0.04157586768269539, 0.031201327219605446, 0.01665525883436203, 0.001310963649302721, 0.03332046791911125, 0.010872193612158298, -0.03036009706556797,