show the next steps for the pupils and ensure that all adults know the targets.\nDisplays are used to celebrate the pupils\u2019 individuality and interests. Each child has a written descriptor inside a hand print on what makes them special.\nThe interventions used with all children in the nursery are interventions that support autistic children. These include use of Social Stories (Gray, 2015), the use of visual timetables and the Five Point scale developed by Buron and Curtis (2003).\f", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 10, "split_id": 41, "split_idx_start": 18643, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "b62388eda48e63da4bd8b309a1539761fbd3959a2b765010818331bf434a8186", "range": [408, 494]}, {"doc_id": "4d538d05fc95cbc967a5ff8c1b25d74c202053e2d05bc32e059d0abf162f5d14", "range": [0, 142]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.01918640546500683, -0.08293454349040985, -0.035716090351343155, 0.03146429359912872, -0.035696178674697876, 0.029434598982334137, 0.037096425890922546, -0.07610879093408585, -0.045007750391960144, 0.016805164515972137, 0.029801873490214348, -0.07627813518047333, 0.034043844789266586, 0.0428444929420948, -0.01523552369326353, -0.07357349246740341, 0.020867623388767242, 0.01768970862030983, -0.02213822863996029, 0.02106386609375477, -0.0247824564576149, 0.03674376755952835, -0.005144505761563778, 0.024810058996081352, -0.0008799298666417599, -0.03290048614144325, 0.013204636052250862, -0.0027604345232248306, 0.04435120150446892, -0.05883168429136276, 0.0005843810504302382, 0.030610216781497, 0.015939811244606972, 0.026035616174340248, 2.4845362531777937e-06, 0.01333966851234436, 0.021685967221856117, -0.030402204021811485, -0.03783538192510605, -0.02640063501894474, -0.05071384087204933, 0.004274125210940838, 0.042383480817079544, 0.