or spaces so that every opportunity to develop communication and interaction is taken.\nLeaders operate a coaching model with staff and regularly monitor how they are working with the children. They provide very specific feedback on their interaction with the children with the aim of developing consistency.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 11, "split_id": 43, "split_idx_start": 19641, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "4d538d05fc95cbc967a5ff8c1b25d74c202053e2d05bc32e059d0abf162f5d14", "range": [650, 923]}, {"doc_id": "0433e603c87f3c6620592ad675754cc4b1abed3504f0bb86a35955c4b17e5f6b", "range": [0, 115]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.027083957567811012, -0.06458128988742828, -0.03801533207297325, 0.03462882339954376, 0.02384139783680439, 0.014772229827940464, 0.010750100947916508, -0.045810144394636154, -0.04183654114603996, 0.012057740241289139, 0.02352340891957283, -0.03460489213466644, 0.024250848218798637, 0.01860392466187477, 0.0248734001070261, -0.07686855643987656, 0.01203082874417305, 0.011478441767394543, -0.047005023807287216, 0.03673214092850685, 0.017672192305326462, 0.04041190445423126, -0.0062239645048975945, 0.027054129168391228, -0.011409778147935867, -0.035415031015872955, -0.004237995017319918, 0.011847907677292824, 0.04311896115541458, -0.014475656673312187, -0.008362527936697006, 0.003672289662063122, 0.0011961632408201694, 0.0025591428857296705, 2.496044317013002e-06, 0.05639435350894928, 0.052190110087394714, -0.034622978419065475, -0.021963810548186302, -0.06418312340974808, -0.08219847828149796, -0.005328352563083172, 0.023612285032868385, 0.05735374987125397, -0.0015984029741957784, 0.02349615842103958, -0.000779530091676861, 0.04664791747927666, 0.0375017374753952, -0.05196480080485344, -0.00034494648571126163, 0.