 use of a set of key phrases that children can use to express how they feel.\nStaff give generously of their time and might have a child staying with them as a \u2018lunch buddy\u2019 during lunchtime if the children need support.\nThere is a classroom put aside called INKIE for children with the most complex needs and this is staffed by two TAs, one of whom is Forest School trained. Children who work in the room breakfast together with the staff. The room is set up to reduce sensory stimulation with a low-lit area. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 12, "split_id": 49, "split_idx_start": 22825, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "aebc466067c645155be782716c440759775d988611aef04cdaac71b848dbf45d", "range": [312, 410]}, {"doc_id": "0a6be240d7f1f807e9da7335cfeb6ab408517e75d5e9e07afa5a17374004e6b6", "range": [0, 70]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.06466036289930344, -0.09480898827314377, -0.01683318056166172, 0.02790709398686886, 0.002423628233373165, 0.02970951423048973, 0.0013959822244942188, -0.03959731385111809, -0.03932470083236694, -0.02638085000216961, 0.039223600178956985, -0.0018552890978753567, 0.022236457094550133, -0.006472567096352577, -0.020070722326636314, -0.0972260907292366, 0.008245612494647503, 0.04130933806300163, -0.06567733734846115, 0.02721409499645233, -0.022952107712626457, 0.05642889067530632, 0.019106190651655197, 0.04809972271323204, -0.01535541657358408, -0.03526952862739563, 0.01831584796309471, 0.031590018421411514, 0.029518865048885345, -0.015330237336456776, 0.04487006366252899, 0.014511235058307648, -0.02345600537955761, -0.021900933235883713, 2.3875870738265803e-06, 0.05753090977668762, 0.01554096955806017, 5.7308341638417915e-05, -0.03838636726140976, -0.01153841894119978, -0.033411312848329544, 0.0059145963750