e space. Other children can also access this area as a quiet space at lunch time.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 13, "split_id": 52, "split_idx_start": 24088, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "f1d519655401efa33f6c0e7477d3588340c5a3f93201c2736b90fcb703a2623c", "range": [431, 508]}, {"doc_id": "1451a9b7d24308c24f21fb48d04a0cbf66f37c2e134d39c69485d07220b7dd6a", "range": [0, 73]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.02795501984655857, -0.06511381268501282, -0.029556922614574432, -0.013364897109568119, -0.025289390236139297, -0.0026115314103662968, 0.10281546413898468, -0.05467858910560608, -0.02005188725888729, 0.025861959904432297, 0.02506403625011444, -0.05438600108027458, 0.002634972333908081, -0.006365826819092035, -0.014154759235680103, -0.09125343710184097, 0.032194025814533234, 0.016025841236114502, -0.04535357654094696, 0.015280714258551598, -0.04059799760580063, 0.008968576788902283, -0.02610134892165661, 0.05501097813248634, 0.006498795002698898, -0.04973064735531807, 0.016779646277427673, -0.015648599714040756, 0.012933468446135521, -0.04753422737121582, 0.03553426265716553, 0.03914351016283035, 0.007645358331501484, 0.04043441638350487, 2.2709969016432296e-06, 0.0146551001816988, 0.03725099563598633, -0.0307457372546196, -0.02609332650899887, -0.03707040473818779, -0.04406651481986046, 0.014505020342767239, 0.016131943091750145, 0.04749919846653938, -0.019213330000638962, -0.016853494569659233, -0.0029998808167874813, 0.01737510971724987, -0.017869560047984123, -0.042156677693128586, -0.009798702783882618, 0.016894260421395302, -0.022855175659060478, -0.0355415865778923, 0.027950286865234375, -0.034448880702257156, 0.0022528404369950294, -0.03203704208135605, 0.08886945992708206, 0.016527101397514343, -0.018885483965277672, 0.0330581