nd then staff check whether this will fit with all the children\u2019s interests. One child, who had an interest in dinosaurs had the work on Funny Bones adapted. The teacher included outside activities linked to dinosaurs and fossils.\nStaff use the \u2018Tales Toolkit\u2019 ( https://talestoolkit.com ) and have found this effective in encouraging children to communicate and to tell their stories. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 14, "split_id": 55, "split_idx_start": 25808, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ea6c8605cd7243184ff45b389b79adf6c90dd7e9451a9f085a9c8c2ac92b5332", "range": [703, 749]}, {"doc_id": "fd84f58547360e73f0fc58fa95ccec0d99d6e4588850a844cac0d28fceb9786f", "range": [0, 155]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05424033850431442, -0.008749507367610931, -0.029202889651060104, 0.019068246707320213, -0.03224398195743561, 0.0507521778345108, -0.013124016113579273, -0.005867326632142067, -0.08068019151687622, -0.014976742677390575, 0.015391740016639233, 0.035684507340192795, 0.0658496841788292, 8.783017983660102e-05, -0.032736558467149734, -0.07764953374862671, 0.0008797491318546236, 0.0034269271418452263, -0.041339434683322906, 0.029201282188296318, -0.049284517765045166, 0.048505350947380066, -0.015673479065299034, 0.023893648758530617, -0.05771573260426521, -0.0705123022198677, -0.019633062183856964, 0.024870451539754868, 0.07001306116580963, 0.005062539130449295, 0.0551702156662941, -0.008758073672652245, 0.007134490180760622, -0.030184946954250336, 2.3050033632898703e-06, 0.009956692345440388, -0.024709036573767662, -0.047201577574014664, -0.041926246136426926, 0.02227473445236683, 0.006379948928952217, 0.09885267913341522, 0.007587716914713383, -0.004721144679933786, 0.005500543396919966, 0.056068941950798035, 0.0413981936872