e individual with autism\nP1 \u2013 Understanding the strengths, interests and challenges of the autistic child and young person\nThe school runs a number of interventions to support pupils on the autism spectrum.\nYoga\nSports funding is used to pay for yoga to be taught across the school. Since its introduction, staff have seen fewer incidents of distress and anxiety. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 17, "split_id": 61, "split_idx_start": 30120, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "47888e3222f37f49a20128fb1bca799dca51defecb0e276509a9d5fa9aec1f13", "range": [319, 378]}, {"doc_id": "72457144ff72d5ec04072ba353adc95d2e1487eaf36392f0fca68207cb507ba4", "range": [0, 81]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04781187325716019, -0.08333916962146759, -0.018683314323425293, 0.043060414493083954, 0.008925661444664001, 0.05324677750468254, 0.002497103763744235, 0.01580209471285343, -0.026708398014307022, -0.017011379823088646, 0.03333953395485878, -0.02708471566438675, 0.031779441982507706, -0.06741271913051605, -0.008180303499102592, -0.07975781708955765, 0.008620048873126507, 0.011095164343714714, -0.026541389524936676, 0.011745681054890156, -0.015200297348201275, 0.009186488576233387, -0.0059957667253911495, 0.038039788603782654, 0.01426535751670599, -0.07241667062044144, 0.033591657876968384, 0.019022027030587196, 0.007832716219127178, -0.04601442441344261, 0.0015323554398491979, -0.05142930522561073, -0.02413499541580677, -0.052097201347351074, 2.129706217601779e-06, 0.02973015233874321, 4.135846393182874e-05, -0.029057160019874573, -0.002137522678822279, 0.011104266159236431, -0.03497503697872162, 0.03571143373847008, 0.016751011833548546, 0.029535144567489624, -0.012070754542946815, 0.022956181317567825, 0.011924819089472294, 0.038292426615953445, 0.0