2f0fca68207cb507ba4", "content": "This chunk is part of Case Study C: Hinderton Special School, which highlights the implementation of yoga as a calming intervention for autistic students. It details how yoga has been incorporated into the school's practice to reduce distress and anxiety among pupils, emphasizing its benefits for emotional regulation and mindfulness.Since its introduction, staff have seen fewer incidents of distress and anxiety. They feel yoga is emotionally calming for the pupils. This initiative started as a trial for a term and was then continued as it had a positive effect. It is now embedded in school practice and the staff have found that yoga is good for de-escalation. The physical and mindfulness elements of yoga are\fGood Autism Practice Guide \u2013 Case Studies\n18 Doc ref: GAP report - case studies_I-S\nincorporated into the timetable. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 17, "split_id": 62, "split_idx_start": 30542, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "2b0aec2825aaff4368aed39d783bdf8e75e14df4a47806e612ee763ed99da1cd", "range": [422, 503]}, {"doc_id": "645204b59a548f8f9d8eb3ee21ce5e117b95d9bbc2247d75a078fa8f6e39523c", "range": [0, 167]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.01932736486196518, -0.07064777612686157, -0.028721995651721954, 0.007984012365341187, 0.03232169896364212, 0.014960543252527714, 0.024974998086690903, -0.008650564588606358, 0.0067264242097735405, -0.0051049478352069855, 0.008814029395580292, -0.01733151264488697, -0.0020501157268881798, -0.05421334505081177, -0.011236446909606457, -0.07551448047161102, 0.014805286191403866, 0.02410302683711052, -0.010540674440562725, 0.03490452468395233, 0.001817399519495666, 0.01870763674378395, -0.0015171171398833394, 0.03350970521569252, 0.005434962455183268, -0.0448