ildren into position. Yoga can also change a child\u2019s physical posture for the better. For example, one child always sat in the W position and he can now sit cross-legged which puts less strain on his hips. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 18, "split_id": 68, "split_idx_start": 33088, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "fc7aaa65a1f2002634812605d100d70004ff2a6aff563a0f4ec867859db0d95d", "range": [573, 663]}, {"doc_id": "858590ca48675ab5a117998840d86283ea30d2f23993f135c0322a14328d6d00", "range": [0, 120]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04204822704195976, -0.09743689745664597, -0.03687464818358421, 0.012900937348604202, -0.023676658049225807, 0.04135795310139656, 0.03322455286979675, 0.02095845714211464, -0.046940188854932785, -9.109114034799859e-05, 0.017332710325717926, -0.05156002193689346, 0.04240747541189194, -0.07761427015066147, -0.0011777401668950915, -0.08913987129926682, 0.034595243632793427, 0.02132854051887989, -0.040138307958841324, 0.01894272491335869, -0.022689059376716614, 0.00860050693154335, -0.046467140316963196, 0.03507169336080551, 0.035876043140888214, -0.058397598564624786, 0.014739727601408958, 0.025530831888318062, -0.004587733186781406, -0.044283926486968994, 0.0032103799749165773, -0.029050465673208237, 0.0031387817580252886, -0.025266384705901146, 2.054890273939236e-06, 0.01676960103213787, -0.0006238460773602128, -0.028142470866441727, 0.007083485834300518, 0.0025747797917574644, -0.020897727459669113, 0.0026237210258841515, -0.014395561069250107, 0.005624217912554741, -0.007752355188131332, 0.026590092107653618, 0.031956546008586884, 0.052482519298791885, -0.022143198177218437, 0.04629722237586975, 0.007206586189568043, 0.0061272988095879555, -0.037185341119766235, -0.0056616393849253654, 0.06758178770542145, 