f meditations to do. The yoga teacher is working on individual cards for the children with poses they can do at home. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 19, "split_id": 71, "split_idx_start": 34264, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "75ea8787e42b8dbceea330b2ff33985fe5dae9482c19b4a6d0f9bae61965be6d", "range": [477, 681]}, {"doc_id": "c1403e7ab0805fdb225469761dd594699c49e867e5eb480405accea747d7b2f6", "range": [0, 97]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05869084596633911, -0.0908956229686737, -0.03082696907222271, 0.002555115846917033, -0.015852898359298706, 0.037279754877090454, 0.06361695379018784, -0.006782727316021919, -0.010413967072963715, -0.01168416440486908, 0.03659691661596298, -0.01899665594100952, 0.027078483253717422, -0.07082732021808624, -0.008434232324361801, -0.06407041847705841, 0.01536063477396965, 0.025944063439965248, -0.04035439342260361, 0.021112428978085518, -0.04096929356455803, 0.016023509204387665, -0.02953926846385002, 0.05752326920628548, 0.015472949482500553, -0.08773387223482132, 0.03168082982301712, 0.01614263467490673, -0.015245682559907436, -0.06612005829811096, 0.012074283324182034, -0.021951571106910706, 0.0013618441298604012, -0.01487533375620842, 2.0337599835329456e-06, 0.016239309683442116, 0.002123262034729123, -0.027167346328496933, 0.029638445004820824, -0.004664153326302767, -0.03885681554675102, 0.031182095408439636, 0.008529962040483952, 0.01669268123805523, -0.03104163147509098, 0.022165244445204735, 0.014660943299531937, 0.04458814486861229, -0.011588402092456818, 0.04221537336707115, -0.0035897071938961744, 0.008570190519094467, -0.04935484007000923, -0.027426540851593018, 0.046333711594343185, 0.00712589593604207, 0.01862037181854248, -0.015372201800346375, 0.04905533045530319, -0.03743429854512215, 