tdoor \u2018hide\u2019 with the external providers. This is now used weekly.\nImpact\nThe lead teacher for this said, \u201c engagement is the most important pre-requisite for learning\u201d and, in terms of engagement, this initiative has had a real impact. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 20, "split_id": 80, "split_idx_start": 38969, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "7cf053a4034140733bd409d419cdbc50703abda4cf76909b9175a6b3714c3712", "range": [508, 605]}, {"doc_id": "2a0ed04055ad154c8c3ca0a67d632b5c0725347e6506b3ce16c3b40c987917b8", "range": [0, 170]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.00827016867697239, -0.0309042576700449, -0.010159049183130264, -0.003220660611987114, -0.0028852284885942936, -0.008602146990597248, 0.011849489994347095, -0.06400027126073837, -0.005877676419913769, 0.010037340223789215, -0.007311730645596981, 0.053238462656736374, 0.039347000420093536, 0.030469534918665886, -0.024786973372101784, -0.11069690436124802, -0.007108607329428196, -0.026746969670057297, -0.059978459030389786, 0.029595965519547462, -0.015542143024504185, 0.006829885765910149, 0.01403605006635189, -0.007633917033672333, -0.0225516427308321, -0.031718481332063675, -0.030453674495220184, 0.030650898814201355, 0.1092589795589447, -0.011236827820539474, 0.06163748726248741, -0.0011649649823084474, 0.016213787719607353, -0.023185675963759422, 2.107612772306311e-06, 0.009880735538899899, 0.0020828803535550833, -0.04454455152153969, -0.02613132819533348, -0.003153563477098942, -0.014951536431908607, 0.06747735291719437, 0.01429634727537632, -0.0013085812097415328, 0.0031841008458286524, -0.00047175944200716913, 0.019355589523911476, -0.053277984261512756, 0.0019874703139066696, -0.054737091064453125, 0.013801304623484612, -0.04740699380636215, -0.024645965