g fun and there is a free-\nflow of activities. Movement and breaks are more natural and less artificial than in the classroom. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 20, "split_id": 83, "split_idx_start": 40381, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "0fc904465f0cdcf2326c66725349544b823d2347e55ba62df38ceb781e9520c7", "range": [526, 598]}, {"doc_id": "9f0c355deaac041e7d5c77f4f3bea1011c292fa4b234f47d547b6a8ba5c5bd0e", "range": [0, 80]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0152859166264534, -0.02352827414870262, -0.010432261042296886, 0.0065137664787471294, 0.013220354914665222, 0.009355743415653706, 0.032917484641075134, -0.07597192376852036, -0.02683606930077076, -0.008893563412129879, -0.03733719885349274, 0.023854881525039673, 0.01190984807908535, -0.017434721812605858, -0.014499848708510399, -0.07722880691289902, 0.005918541457504034, -0.019466379657387733, -0.006548679433763027, 0.01445348747074604, -0.01928572915494442, 0.003592937020584941, 0.014052287675440311, 0.021022578701376915, 0.029012534767389297, -0.03884728625416756, 0.04846750944852829, -0.004446240607649088, 0.045435238629579544, -0.058069150894880295, 0.003192442236468196, 0.008164570666849613, 0.04413899779319763, -0.0108687998726964, 2.315934580110479e-06, 0.021816110238432884, 0.03510197252035141, -0.037114016711711884, -0.00635114312171936, -0.03654378280043602, -0.03892522305250168, 0.054937828332185745, 0.05935090407729149, 0.048594098538160324, -0.014478087425231934, -0.026331264525651932, -0.007020554505288601, -0.0018282154342159629, -0.02023221366107464, -0.028721511363983154, -0.007194578181952238, 0.01674904301762581, -0.03290393203496933, 0.0007814893033355474, 0.03561773523688316, 0.03684965521097183, 0.0165545716881752, -0.03740894794464111, 0.04171289503574371, 0.04744569