re covered in the outdoor lessons ( e.g. Stone Age cooking for history; throwing a ball and counting in French; art work on tints, shades and sketching).\nThe children\u2019s work on outdoor learning has been recorded using Screen Castify by Google which is a free resource.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 21, "split_id": 86, "split_idx_start": 41874, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "429e6df8876a6d46020aa202aed33ccea0ca3e8295bdc5352bbc748321ee8f08", "range": [633, 789]}, {"doc_id": "202b7505ac12fc10c6e8ee1ab80cbda5e2141abe971784f564509003d2115754", "range": [0, 115]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.017328230664134026, -0.0578555203974247, -0.04023674875497818, 0.01307769026607275, 0.004198150709271431, 0.014684480614960194, 0.023420508950948715, -0.07498518377542496, -0.018720285966992378, -0.0031475129071623087, -0.010454127565026283, 0.029760902747511864, 0.03680822625756264, -0.018316442146897316, -0.04000024124979973, -0.09677860140800476, -0.022049054503440857, -0.026885319501161575, -0.08173694461584091, 0.04052012041211128, -0.008829150348901749, 0.020615028217434883, 0.025302961468696594, 0.03478647768497467, 0.030055280774831772, -0.03129064291715622, -0.010875833220779896, 0.0032541544642299414, 0.09749971330165863, -0.029158467426896095, 0.01640436425805092, -0.004297766834497452, 0.04749612510204315, 0.015406182035803795, 2.210573029515217e-06, 0.016956601291894913, 0.012040113098919392, -0.05070285126566887, 0.018655983731150627, -0.04032447934150696, -0.044522833079099655, 0.062404703348875046, 0.03905273973941803, 0.03316250070929527, 0.005198478698730469, -0.006683934945613146, 0.02567737177014351, -0.0029594621155411005, -0.0109892338514328, -0.019688859581947327, 0.004558492451906204, -0.008942242711782455, -0.00895565