 Hinderton Special School, which focuses on various interventions to support autistic pupils. It highlights the incorporation of technology, specifically Screen Castify, to document students' outdoor learning experiences, fostering creativity, and providing opportunities for student presentations and engagement in school activities.The children\u2019s work on outdoor learning has been recorded using Screen Castify by Google which is a free resource.\nThe children can select their own photos. A film for the governors was created of activities the pupils have enjoyed. Two children have been nominated as junior safety officers and one child used Screen Castify to make a presentation to share with the school. He worked with a staff member to make a slide show and chose pictures and wrote a commentary on a whiteboard first. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 21, "split_id": 87, "split_idx_start": 42348, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "e64e70dbd7d4330cda1e8bcfb0bc16c272df688a6fd22190b4cd30095cadf749", "range": [474, 589]}, {"doc_id": "f4ff33c8722d05c313fb8f5a0a5a3af8d9dce98f0422b1c0a6601bc62448af8c", "range": [0, 116]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.013551827520132065, -0.1201760470867157, -0.023597553372383118, -0.01925034448504448, -0.0007090559229254723, 0.01402575895190239, 0.07223628461360931, -0.016058871522545815, -0.039548393338918686, -0.034102410078048706, 0.024323798716068268, -0.02735738642513752, 0.019137676805257797, 0.008709955029189587, -0.003704989794641733, -0.09175620973110199, 0.0015896748518571258, -0.00031502748606726527, -0.06551937013864517, 0.047397494316101074, -0.004962967708706856, 0.010715015232563019, -0.01981634832918644, 0.04020833224058151, 0.017940154299139977, -0.04231230542063713, 0.009898058138787746, 0.0210