 the pupils using a timer. This took place in an enclosed activity area.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 24, "split_id": 97, "split_idx_start": 47763, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "2eb94ee58d283f8753fc62610ed88a6cf99cd95d9e7a07104abcae4572fa30b1", "range": [764, 839]}, {"doc_id": "da5616ada657d0c4c8443047a2f65b6ddee4107da22a06b6f204c60b97f650ff", "range": [0, 46]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.0379972942173481, -0.0732225775718689, -0.02221107855439186, 0.001290193758904934, -0.0175844207406044, -0.0039069196209311485, 0.014990584924817085, -0.06487557291984558, -0.028804881498217583, 0.03485393524169922, -0.010568755678832531, 0.047894153743982315, 0.0520426481962204, -0.0008208963554352522, -0.060298580676317215, -0.11154301464557648, -0.02229105867445469, -0.010599251836538315, -0.07349143177270889, 0.052381474524736404, -0.014814263209700584, -0.0030016957316547632, 0.013437929563224316, -0.014427555724978447, -0.013502874411642551, -0.035465307533741, -0.011530927382409573, -0.0067067998461425304, 0.0904996246099472, -0.02893240377306938, 0.030051209032535553, 0.0009231588337570429, 0.0322493240237236, -0.013122824020683765, 2.188685357396025e-06, -0.008848664350807667, 0.015132125467061996, -0.0272816214710474, -0.025631260126829147, -0.005816438235342503, -0.010743919759988785, 0.0780971422791481, 0.039538852870464325, 0.0055534918792545795, -0.0050760903395712376, 0.06605527549982071, 0.02053382433950901, -0.03861621767282486, 0.026952827349305153, -0.028338542208075523, 0.008800783194601536, 0.009333753027021885, -0.04384983703494072, 0.02177414670586586, 0.08491617441177368, 0.029772527515888214, 0.010044225491583347, 0.026036225259304047, 0.10082023590803146, 0.018788080662488937, -0.04864518716931343, -0.01675317436456