6?\u201d but this also gave clear expectations to the children. The activities used were low cost, as well as freely available, natural resources.\nAdaptations were made for children who needed a break from the activity. Children who were dysregulated for whatever reason, were allowed to move away without comment. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 24, "split_id": 101, "split_idx_start": 49453, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "1db8b66cb495d74f6ff1ba8ede6e5ac57952f555e3060b88e3593bb288702b2b", "range": [457, 561]}, {"doc_id": "02e0f674100bf06c38e478ab73d08fbe297a3aba20fc158fd0b3a140136be104", "range": [0, 95]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04088669642806053, -0.06656676530838013, -0.0232358667999506, 0.02590855211019516, 0.0013247757451608777, 0.02262762561440468, 0.04084516689181328, -0.046726711094379425, -0.05895619839429855, -0.00012058569700457156, 0.019414883106946945, -0.04279455542564392, 0.0162151250988245, -0.029930124059319496, -0.03835175931453705, -0.11767736077308655, 0.009606961160898209, 0.018701598048210144, -0.012126858346164227, 0.01345061231404543, 0.005364467855542898, 0.014845874160528183, -0.012746528722345829, 0.03750842809677124, 0.028988102450966835, -0.028248105198144913, 0.020719004794955254, 0.008597827516496181, 0.032878439873456955, -0.03643012419342995, 0.03863868862390518, 0.015144224278628826, -0.012428722344338894, -0.01987641304731369, 2.3318752937484533e-06, 0.039085544645786285, 0.04420151934027672, -0.03731458634138107, -0.025628089904785156, -0.026857106015086174, -0.05462303012609482, -0.005398076958954334, 0.038825031369924545, 0.030814556404948235, -0.011405768804252148, -0.011243797838687897, 0.005829152185469866, 0.025678711012005806, 0.014370433986186981, -0.03862013667821884, 0.011613524518907