 approach, this teacher, \u201c realised pupils were more able than we give them credit for\u201d and that staff need to question whether they \u201c are using their time with the children to best effect?\u201d The school uses colourful semantics for story planning and other areas of curriculum. Colourful Semantic cards can be used to prompt conversations and build vocabulary. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 25, "split_id": 104, "split_idx_start": 50876, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "6638dcb1e356efc6f48804bba41214d79281b780151723f3ed26a357d3f286e2", "range": [433, 584]}, {"doc_id": "e02b93cd6742fc187826cb5cee22e18cdd61059283c7b5c36ed0b591101fad70", "range": [0, 83]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04425687715411186, -0.05677720904350281, -0.037160083651542664, 0.019809313118457794, -0.0243946835398674, -0.008621810004115105, -0.001646108110435307, -0.002487014513462782, -0.08409585058689117, -0.04549029842019081, 0.0005867779836989939, -0.01914181374013424, 0.026411956176161766, 0.02505517192184925, -0.015250390395522118, -0.09883706271648407, 0.03223360702395439, 0.00530653353780508, -0.031903550028800964, 0.009248880669474602, 0.00640328461304307, 0.0473434180021286, -0.012809840962290764, 0.0673782080411911, -0.020818348973989487, -0.026651656255126, 0.008788068778812885, -0.00698183523491025, -0.012267397716641426, -0.021661551669239998, -0.0033196592703461647, 0.0315522737801075, -0.024527519941329956, -0.010489236563444138, 2.1735768314101733e-06, -0.02535034902393818, 0.009905215352773666, -0.0651945248246193, 0.012570605613291264, -0.01805390790104866, 0.02164549194276333, 0.04098087549209595, 0.024102967232465744, 0.03049963153898716, -0.027438784018158913, 0.0047640991397202015, 0.034730464220047, 0.05507412925362587, 0.0084