um, professional development, shared ethos\nPrinciples illustrated\n1. Understanding the strengths, interests and challenges of the autistic child and young person\n2. Enabling the voice of the autistic child and young person to contribute to and influence decisions\n3. Collaboration with parents and carers of autistic children and young people\n4. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 26, "split_id": 107, "split_idx_start": 53968, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "c5d0b7f086130156b2c0ea56b85a28addc7274139e123f6a25a5ceb5cabd41b2", "range": [1507, 1678]}, {"doc_id": "c529b5cf5409a00e27930ea2cc4f3378761c44cc97ae752092aaadc184c1a714", "range": [0, 79]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.024298369884490967, -0.09006646275520325, -0.019018620252609253, 0.02064031921327114, 1.5861181736909202e-06, 0.023044172674417496, 0.01537596806883812, -0.06274212896823883, -0.055935345590114594, 0.009905843064188957, 0.002154585439711809, -0.01623200997710228, 0.014761339873075485, 0.005152583122253418, -0.024633293971419334, -0.05692269280552864, 0.018070582300424576, 0.02232244238257408, -0.045805923640728, 0.02583852782845497, 0.035820625722408295, 0.01547175645828247, -0.0038148886524140835, 0.03173093497753143, -0.013297133147716522, -0.021313341334462166, -0.012322412803769112, 0.01016561035066843, 0.059064168483018875, -0.03254430368542671, 0.006189924199134111, -6.19886486674659e-05, 0.003629787592217326, 0.023722119629383087, 2.434265525153023e-06, 0.0412195585668087, -0.011362415738403797, -0.04007333144545555, -0.01528965961188078, -0.01080290973186493, -0.07256025820970535, 0.05113749951124191, 0.02758319489657879, 0.05248349905014038, -0.001686684088781476, -0.025406043976545334, 0.032298680394887924, 0.03405136987566948, 0.02917376719415188, -0.035089