 several case studies focused on effective practices for supporting autistic children and young people in educational settings. It highlights the importance of collaboration with families, workforce training, strong leadership, inclusive environments, and targeted support for measuring student progress, essential for fostering successful educational experiences.Collaboration with parents and carers of autistic children and young people\n4. Workforce development to support autistic children and young people\n5. Leadership and management that promotes and embeds good autism practice\n6. An ethos and environment that fosters social inclusion for children and young people on the autism spectrum\n7. Targeted support and measuring progress of children and young people on the autism spectrum\n8. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 27, "split_id": 108, "split_idx_start": 54959, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "292aa50b0826724d7b3cc6524854c5b9389906dd937fd7b49a14bd5dd649bf9f", "range": [991, 1070]}, {"doc_id": "806ed6098ea50a09f2a6d41f98e60733f0202b2625730c45f345a5dd8b020fe9", "range": [0, 95]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03734565153717995, -0.032365091145038605, -0.03791436925530434, -0.0023719097953289747, 0.016584401950240135, 0.038293398916721344, 0.010898750275373459, -0.06353909522294998, -0.06204599887132645, 0.012853418476879597, 0.02370295114815235, -0.02627565898001194, 0.014436437748372555, -0.011540964245796204, -0.003111960832029581, -0.02034039795398712, 0.013805092312395573, 0.038185399025678635, -0.029302231967449188, 0.02794123813509941, 0.006027517840266228, 0.041445717215538025, -0.017229896038770676, 0.03492294251918793, 0.013318004086613655, -0.01666957698762417, 0.03546652942895889, -0.008655750192701817, 0.03105608373880386