 have key fobs that open secure doors so that they can deliver the register to the office. Some students prepare and deliver snacks for other classes and take resources to classrooms.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 30, "split_id": 120, "split_idx_start": 60681, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "0caaffb6b233ca05ab6e8f0973a8e5fad3cb2b9b9afc05bdad2bddb71ec3e72b", "range": [515, 619]}, {"doc_id": "20b1a1a3249f493eef54b283dfbc603ddb74a1c2755bb7103f5a892ea14e7b1b", "range": [0, 93]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04070308431982994, -0.037451889365911484, -0.022052688524127007, 0.016789725050330162, -0.01840103417634964, 0.009916188195347786, 0.03361903876066208, -0.07687773555517197, -0.01595017872750759, 0.016534291207790375, 0.06887190043926239, 0.002786471974104643, -0.021564092487096786, -0.010765655897557735, -0.03644184395670891, -0.0393587090075016, -0.010250725783407688, 0.02597956173121929, -0.05106278136372566, 0.0004685045569203794, -0.04344911873340607, 0.029538599774241447, 0.0029546264559030533, 0.02843884937465191, -0.011518166400492191, -0.04238244891166687, 0.014115283265709877, 0.021235501393675804, 0.04350501671433449, 0.014644474722445011, 0.0647069439291954, 0.021723860874772072, -0.019681748002767563, 0.011918622069060802, 2.289437134095351e-06, 0.03435671329498291, 0.02196006290614605, -0.02328503504395485, -0.04386961832642555, -0.024262547492980957, -0.051773443818092346, 0.02611391991376877, -0.008664893917739391, 0.016324549913406372, -0.042829349637031555, 0.0039610774256289005, 0.008971447125077248, 0.04670623317360878, -0.018533119931817055, -0.05419554188847542, -0.012796906754374504, -0.041159842163324356, -0.028396662324666977, -0.0037784911692142487, 0.01892450638115406, 0.03302739933133125, -0.0096419807523