lored support for individual needs.This ensures a shared language, shared aims and consistent strategies. This collegiate approach provides additional professional development and gives a coherent approach. An example of a shared strategy relates to a student who is tactile defensive (touch resistant). Staff agreed a scripted response to what they would say when they were going to touch the student. In another example, with a student who was very resistant to change, the team agreed to use the same language and the same pausing. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 30, "split_id": 124, "split_idx_start": 62386, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "f76adbbc48dd8bfd93d0bedaed6f470d9ac99f9de82e51e976dbc8f8de5ff5ad", "range": [390, 461]}, {"doc_id": "54fef421288f4327786453700e4a7334fca256b5d19d29fb88840cc1a522d38e", "range": [0, 132]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.049783509224653244, -0.08763118833303452, -0.02361168898642063, 0.02063877508044243, 0.0013353159883990884, 0.029845919460058212, 0.025065481662750244, -0.044872868806123734, -0.04736728593707085, 0.004385188687592745, 0.035524871200323105, -0.06504812091588974, -0.022080067545175552, -0.0032005326356738806, -0.010941077955067158, -0.028025884181261063, 0.006062237545847893, 0.023632362484931946, -0.01738435961306095, -0.014047166332602501, 0.029288800433278084, 0.012914182618260384, -0.027929041534662247, 0.01583115942776203, 0.05801362544298172, -0.04254656285047531, 0.030795380473136902, -0.0211988165974617, 0.021436668932437897, -0.03556240350008011, 0.03070145659148693, 0.03320794180035591, -0.02434215135872364, 0.01937165856361389, 2.295574404342915e-06, 0.046663086861371994, 0.04221305623650551, -0.04211878031492233, 0.024702362716197968, -0.045358799397945404, -0.04934514686465263