ew at their eye level.\nEach room has an enclosed playpod area outside as shown in the photo. This is a fenced area with a gate leading to the playground which can be kept open or locked and provides a secure, outside area. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 31, "split_id": 130, "split_idx_start": 65070, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ea474032d0d16f0b38141616c41f18ef79fa5a5a5f4d93bba05b07ef85e9784d", "range": [465, 508]}, {"doc_id": "fef4271085cd978d24a8e80f2805d53146a0a8ca069fe47b93e5277b6781ca18", "range": [0, 130]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04177802428603172, -0.0815260261297226, -0.03951136767864227, 0.028799986466765404, -0.03547653183341026, -0.008712740615010262, 0.10773806273937225, -0.034738291054964066, -0.03466768190264702, 0.00447573559358716, -0.001984663074836135, -0.013160690665245056, 0.03218657523393631, -0.01643810048699379, 0.005156324245035648, -0.08062930405139923, 0.022392638027668, 0.0038605753798037767, -0.06904466450214386, 0.03895222768187523, -0.07507569342851639, 0.013009167276322842, -0.04119271785020828, 0.02965756505727768, 0.0550081692636013, -0.045581281185150146, 0.01484663411974907, 0.012539153918623924, 0.011524450033903122, -0.03293314576148987, 0.051272206008434296, -0.011691042222082615, -0.03507251292467117, -0.009774125181138515, 2.0141837921983097e-06, 0.015928927809000015, 0.038819365203380585, -0.012029979377985, 0.018986310809850693, 0.0017111951019614935, -0.022195711731910706, -0.004055957775563002, 0.03506713733077049, 0.04547674208879471, -0.01652151346206665, -0.028309084475040436, 0.010671820491552353, 0.016212396323680878, -0.01611139439046383, -0.03621524199843407, -0.012104655615985394, -0.009584201499819756, -0.05497148260474205, 0.0016221993137151003, 0.060011126101017, -0.0133