s mini steps towards EHCP targets and these targets are linked to SCERTS.\nAn independence scale is also used from 1, which indicates that a student is not able to do something on their own and requires a full prompt, to 5 where a student requires no support or prompt.\nThe staff are trialling the Evidence for Learning app ( www.evidenceforlearning.net ). ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 33, "split_id": 137, "split_idx_start": 68156, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "6142649e8f78d6d4ae3c88a59f91817ee02803bdc9f84051f8b2bc8ea3810579", "range": [846, 964]}, {"doc_id": "2302ba987d216c8aad91aa5db507e6672750523a255c790080156fc4a491fb93", "range": [0, 87]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.0017260140739381313, -0.08105271309614182, -0.025637993589043617, -0.04145645722746849, -0.04106941446661949, 0.03512486815452576, 0.028231918811798096, -0.06848643720149994, -0.01347760297358036, 0.006564893294125795, 0.04783373698592186, -0.030017053708434105, -0.007137725595384836, 0.02981395088136196, -0.042510610073804855, -0.028420157730579376, 0.003372209146618843, 0.0028116817120462656, 0.0007019041222520173, 0.0030565522611141205, 0.006020236760377884, 0.018505491316318512, -0.06311190873384476, 0.016893893480300903, -0.002237002830952406, -0.0415973998606205, 0.04309689998626709, -0.019534209743142128, 0.013355711475014687, -0.05067157745361328, 0.022845936939120293, 0.05274783447384834, -0.031108269467949867, 0.0263783298432827, 2.385277866778779e-06, 0.004106104839593172, -0.00775383785367012, -0.03323370963335037, -0.019939396530389786, -0.015439877286553383, -0.048395756632089615, 0.03840479627251625, 0.0249127559363842, 0.05258302763104439, -0.03600301966071129, 0.020386027172207832, 0.006313401740044355, 0.02489107847213745, -0.007113188970834017