ba987d216c8aad91aa5db507e6672750523a255c790080156fc4a491fb93", "content": "This chunk is situated in Case Study C: Hinderton Special School, which focuses on utilizing the Evidence for Learning app to enhance monitoring and assessment of student progress. It highlights the app's functionalities in capturing multimedia evidence and linking it to educational frameworks like SCERTS for effective evaluation and reporting.The staff are trialling the Evidence for Learning app ( www.evidenceforlearning.net ). Photos and videos can be captured and tagged and linked to frameworks including SCERTS. Staff can also upload their own frameworks to link things to and can set tags for monitoring purposes such as the pupil premium. This will provide centralised monitoring as well as a portfolio of progression and success as managers can access what teachers are doing. The targets need to be approved by managers.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 33, "split_id": 138, "split_idx_start": 68652, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "65759db32b92b0247d9bad4a9279bb6a89b67436d605a644ec9b23a1f6fc1604", "range": [496, 583]}, {"doc_id": "7a13f0746c35be7c420d5db946112056edb52f8e802b45117ed4b7a3eead8741", "range": [0, 45]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.019566798582673073, -0.04139555245637894, -0.0348316989839077, -0.0334121473133564, -0.05671091750264168, 0.010043053887784481, 0.019674494862556458, -0.03221578896045685, -0.016505040228366852, -0.013330561108887196, 0.07243945449590683, 0.04755154624581337, 0.03692322596907616, 0.052508644759655, 0.0024613989517092705, -0.05897463485598564, -0.015157045796513557, 0.001217814045958221, -0.012629175558686256, 0.04535503685474396, 0.03353497385978699, 0.03064422309398651, -0.02791786938905716, 0.008483325131237507, -0.0727