pes of learner which they characterised as leaves, trunks and roots. This also fits with the SCERTS model. The curriculum was therefore modified into these three strands.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 34, "split_id": 140, "split_idx_start": 69437, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "7a13f0746c35be7c420d5db946112056edb52f8e802b45117ed4b7a3eead8741", "range": [342, 608]}, {"doc_id": "905adba68f20ca67b0c787a56e2267b6b30bbefd1b6ceaa36cfeff82336e12d1", "range": [0, 64]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.02054760977625847, -0.15516021847724915, -0.013161667622625828, 0.01570151373744011, -0.02742353081703186, 0.01648593321442604, 0.008448163978755474, -0.04841640964150429, -0.10535454005002975, 0.0029310311656445265, 0.04477585852146149, 0.007571319118142128, 0.022442974150180817, -0.004932642914354801, -0.013896061107516289, -0.06269723176956177, 0.0562637634575367, 0.02443297766149044, -0.060738079249858856, -0.002950612921267748, 0.0033051036298274994, 0.03711223974823952, -0.0074488879181444645, 0.020517878234386444, -0.01792692020535469, -0.046973079442977905, -0.004162721801549196, 0.026010237634181976, 0.0030462329741567373, 0.004523715004324913, 0.04720144346356392, 0.008827815763652325, 0.028988033533096313, -0.005607023369520903, 2.242674327135319e-06, 0.007558905985206366, -0.0367925763130188, -0.03212742507457733, -0.02958063594996929, 0.028510678559541702, -0.0346374586224556, 0.11697903275489807, 0.044754866510629654, 0.02876000665128231, -0.01779228262603283, 0.05553050339221954, 0.01307819876819849, 0.02881857566535473, 0.00743110803887248, -0.01759943924844265, 0.013568234629929066, -0.025213388726115227, 0.0009573149145580828, -0.030568163841962814, 0.014446042478084564, 0.0020498777739703655, 0.0304473377764225, -0.02362665720