he \"roots curriculum\" focusing on sensory exploration for foundational skills, and the \"trunk curriculum\" for developing communication and functional skills through semi-formal learning experiences.The curriculum was therefore modified into these three strands.\nThe roots curriculum is a sensory and exploratory curriculum (P3-4) covering the essential key skills and knowledge that their students need to learn. Engagement in learning is through play and sensory exploration and provides students with opportunities to develop skills within meaningful contexts.\nThe trunk curriculum is a semi-formal curriculum for students at P5-7. As well as learning through exploration and play, this provides the opportunity for communication, student voice and the development of functional skills.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 34, "split_id": 141, "split_idx_start": 69940, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "d5291727ceca73a1ad02c342f407f41b32bae59ed5134ac6164e1eeead17a7a3", "range": [503, 567]}, {"doc_id": "b7799b938a868178e5e16fef89cd592738dacb6ebce2b06e5766ad042e049e92", "range": [0, 155]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.023145152255892754, -0.1612604409456253, -0.010989446192979813, 0.024947986006736755, -0.0335521399974823, 0.04286078363656998, 0.00013387783837970346, -0.038170114159584045, -0.08782371133565903, 0.015141822397708893, 0.0013936619507148862, -0.0166703499853611, 0.036576054990291595, 0.0009764005080796778, -0.01835966855287552, -0.05850423872470856, 0.02039605937898159, 0.01960153505206108, -0.031143585219979286, 0.008715320378541946, -0.027489470317959785, 0.03412254899740219, -0.03313594311475754, 0.02879383973777294, -0.01725047081708908, -0.02892208844423294, 0.022538337856531143, 0.02427624724805355, -0.015008533373475075, -0.0