bition of students\u2019 work at the local library and the students provided snacks and drinks and served these to the people viewing their work.\nThe school garden is used to grow produce ( e.g. herbs are grown and used to make soup to sell in the school caf\u00e9 and lavender is used to make lavender bags). ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 34, "split_id": 144, "split_idx_start": 71226, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "0a961f54d44936c0ceba50102ea214f3dd704b650e4fb30c74e772f90197cb00", "range": [258, 341]}, {"doc_id": "8eb8b6c59db7a5c2116b178bbf85070659ffbe04bda3c0c204ddda27f3e052db", "range": [0, 110]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.014577727764844894, 0.014748108573257923, -0.004193788394331932, 0.03502342477440834, -0.020195594057440758, 0.006214293651282787, 0.023309478536248207, 0.004222683142870665, -0.0018989339005202055, -0.009770550765097141, 0.05565478652715683, 0.07220986485481262, 0.016547121107578278, 0.04472556710243225, -0.027318522334098816, 0.0021312132012099028, -0.009472674690186977, 0.03869065269827843, -0.09875674545764923, 0.0030918424017727375, -0.03722159564495087, 0.024562634527683258, 0.026954445987939835, 0.02396351285278797, -0.05345635488629341, -0.019371554255485535, 0.026310300454497337, 0.05907408148050308, 0.030199725180864334, 0.016851771622896194, 0.05180653557181358, 0.002287135226652026, -0.02972184307873249, -0.041281066834926605, 2.0504676285781898e-06, 0.018447572365403175, -0.025863012298941612, -0.022179709747433662, -0.06659948825836182, 0.027862222865223885, 0.04834688454866409, 0.07052067667245865, -0.04739430546760559, 0.008825523778796196, -0.026722844690084457, -0.00013251134078018367, 0.010538764297962189, 0.025539755821228027, -0.024987392127513885, -0.029939457774162292, 0.00551280798390