 75% of the time and with a further five students. She would like to train as a Speech and Language Therapist and has been skilled up by Ellen, the school\u2019s SALT, to run social groups on her own. The TAs really like the Board system described above, as it enables staff to know exactly where the TAs are.\nSheridan works with a Year 7 autistic student most of the time. He has found transition from the primary school hard and the student currently leaves school after Period 3 as a short-term measure as part of an agreed flexi-schooling package. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 41, "split_id": 179, "split_idx_start": 90651, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ccd159b52b8109d0e0b38428678b1fdecd143bdfadd891d05667f777a112054d", "range": [322, 403]}, {"doc_id": "8a441884d14a05b086e270611a1d9d99c2829a9ab86961d0b343a5c4d1234c9c", "range": [0, 178]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.026985442265868187, -0.07074226438999176, -0.025314707309007645, 0.01640109159052372, 0.022671453654766083, 0.014804335311055183, 0.03123515658080578, -0.07058341801166534, -0.051984116435050964, 0.0015787878073751926, 0.04531175270676613, -0.03429761528968811, 0.011959671974182129, -0.014008567668497562, -0.005848895758390427, -0.07733506709337234, 0.003773709526285529, 0.015291483141481876, -0.037862956523895264, 0.006357420701533556, -0.009086541831493378, 0.02692367695271969, -0.00047799761523492634, 0.03440525382757187, 0.02703936956822872, -0.009033198468387127, 0.021937016397714615, 0.009074865840375423, 0.0563054196536541, 0.027250943705439568, 0.03955920785665512, 0.007360133342444897, -0.03609579801559448, 0.003343852935358882, 2.4692778879398247e-06, 0.06032181903719902, 0.02925640158355236, -0.03359910845756531, -0.025117505341768265, -0.007739283610135317, -