13 Case Studies\n42 Doc ref: GAP report - case studies_I-S\nInscape House school funds the TAs for the three students at Priestnall and those students are met at the door and stay with the TA until they leave or are picked up by their parents. These students are on roll at both schools as part of a Partnership Arrangement funded by the Local Authority. The students can move seamlessly between Inscape House school and Priestnall school. One student who missed a lot of education at primary school and was home schooled for a time, started at Inscape House in Year 6 and then transitioned to Priestnall gradually and by Year 8 was full time at Priestnall. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 41, "split_id": 182, "split_idx_start": 92027, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "64accac5b49ef166a1b19ed389e07cb73a7689eea99caf5be080bc682c37bf88", "range": [540, 603]}, {"doc_id": "f76337fc4cf981370a4f409f1f3d99f4a46a38fc1e1a5ba2bc3bc7c641b90a11", "range": [0, 218]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.016960980370640755, -0.06348659098148346, -0.0015833004144951701, 0.011407757177948952, 0.005044401623308659, 0.01015658862888813, 0.02323959767818451, -0.06738833338022232, -0.06566958874464035, -0.0013074988964945078, 0.03251887112855911, -0.025097297504544258, 0.03305497393012047, -0.019960246980190277, -0.021158916875720024, -0.04914369061589241, -0.01512918435037136, 0.003338474314659834, -0.11088047921657562, -0.005302668083459139, 0.01636441797018051, 0.017867226153612137, -0.010511327534914017, 0.036977216601371765, 0.017230112105607986, -0.028779560700058937, -0.0071563273668289185, 0.048776350915431976, 0.09175378829240799, 0.0011828005081042647, 0.05114411935210228, -0.012293064035475254, -0.041030313819646835, -0.004900672473013401, 2.5173196718242252e-06,