to Education, Health, and Care (EHC) plans.Discussion with Dr Rachael King: the School\u2019s Educational Psychologist\nRachael is employed part-time by Priestnall School on a term-time only basis. She works in six feeder primary schools (6 hours a month in each) and a nursery. She has set up a nurture group with TAs in the nursery. Rachael had experience of Priestnall as a Trainee Educational Psychologist and so the Priestnall staff already knew her well.\nRachael spent a lot of time carrying out needs assessments to inform the process of transferring Statements to EHC plans. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 42, "split_id": 185, "split_idx_start": 93532, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "0eea7ace171849b2e1e5d4e228e82addd464171a9708fc3581d6c113747436e7", "range": [402, 551]}, {"doc_id": "62848dd2d88e46f3ae572a00a70739ee77a1864414fe87fd214c9a594ef13b98", "range": [0, 122]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.040857043117284775, -0.05080116540193558, -0.015097727999091148, 0.01206460501998663, -0.047787174582481384, 0.05228191986680031, 0.02992398664355278, -0.04908085986971855, -0.05143816024065018, 0.025668727234005928, 0.05994339659810066, -0.04407484456896782, 0.025243224576115608, -0.020673802122473717, -0.01308598555624485, -0.02013590559363365, -0.026412105187773705, 0.06101151555776596, -0.05269861966371536, 0.029447607696056366, -0.0136614004150033, 0.02748694084584713, -0.015907371416687965, 0.03942133113741875, -0.014798733405768871, -0.032343681901693344, -0.040145501494407654, 0.0665430948138237, 0.03162948042154312, 0.008913234807550907, 0.049030691385269165, 0.013296231627464294, -0.051671650260686874, -0.05714668706059456, 2.075457587125129e-06, 0.04078736528754234, -0.03200600668787956, -0.02050011046230793, -0.02259734086692333