6a4327a10e22ec102c20b14f4d319e195931efc5f5c3aeaa16a586fe", "content": "This chunk outlines key principles that guide effective autism practice in educational settings. It emphasizes the importance of giving autistic children a voice in decision-making, collaborating with their families, providing staff training, fostering an inclusive environment, and ensuring strong leadership to support these initiatives.Enabling the voice of the autistic child and young person to contribute to and influence decisions\n3. Collaboration with parents and carers of autistic children and young people\n4. Workforce development to support autistic children and young people\n5. Leadership and management that promotes and embeds good autism practice\n6. An ethos and environment that fosters social inclusion for children and young people on the autism spectrum\n7. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 46, "split_id": 195, "split_idx_start": 101119, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "7e775ad195b9be33bc75c1c3cd37380a53a0c18b9b86d2beef387afc72438711", "range": [1030, 1132]}, {"doc_id": "e1e63b1357a157600f05322adc5544dd86365ca55ab8beec795f6214612b73be", "range": [0, 111]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05274611711502075, -0.0486186146736145, -0.03462342917919159, 0.00968096125870943, 0.027394911274313927, 0.037846650928258896, 0.002927925204858184, -0.06516273319721222, -0.04645921662449837, 0.016233475878834724, 0.010545599274337292, -0.02337530069053173, -0.0027926370967179537, 0.0071988399140536785, 0.0031112651340663433, -0.03525576367974281, 0.015255622565746307, 0.027204599231481552, -0.01970830000936985, 0.018131563439965248, 0.018434269353747368, 0.028249120339751244, -0.0022465039510279894, 0.030864380300045013, 0.020366612821817398, -0.007315433584153652, 0.0140