here are 50\u201360 pupils on their waiting list. The school population represents several different cultures and ethnicities, with the majority of pupils being Bengali (70%) or Somali (20%).\nThe school has satellite classes in two mainstream primary and secondary schools with 46 pupils (16 primary and 30 secondary-aged) and this has been a very successful initiative which began five years ago. The two schools are close and accessible. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 47, "split_id": 198, "split_idx_start": 102384, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "c9e40a7fb02b24473f751a94178732cf80b264fa0523436656fef0a4feb1db32", "range": [452, 517]}, {"doc_id": "17cc65a74a8c9b5244f8d3334fcdf109cc146c89fbba0b347baad4b99e7a65a6", "range": [0, 42]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.025470858439803123, -0.04081335291266441, -0.034607626497745514, -0.0026834269519895315, -0.016063177958130836, 0.02807042934000492, -0.0008734693401493132, -0.034333523362874985, -0.0156849417835474, -0.004926369991153479, 0.03546075150370598, 0.014586114324629307, 0.03054840676486492, 0.024731723591685295, -0.03769081085920334, -0.06429467350244522, -0.02142271213233471, 0.016649797558784485, -0.07731923460960388, 0.006794135086238384, -0.024301011115312576, 0.019943689927458763, 0.006621801760047674, 0.032561108469963074, 0.034038376063108444, -0.05606524273753166, 0.014128070324659348, 0.027921076864004135, 0.04240381345152855, 0.014249179512262344, 0.03363090008497238, 0.03607286512851715, -0.06400548666715622, -0.0008765289676375687, 2.6364077712059952e-06, 0.03732823580503464, 0.01294685062021017, 0.00782997440546751, -0.04376465082168579, -0.014002201147377491, -0.06276930868625641, -0.013778735883533955, -0.03161880001425743, 0.02728026732802391, -0.016033831983804703, -