is flexible, and reflects the nature and extent of a pupil\u2019s needs at the school. During the first and last half term of the school year, every school will be offered a minimum of one visit from their outreach teacher to support the transition of pupils.\nThroughout the year, each school will receive a block of visits. Each outreach teacher is available to advise and support mainstream staff via phone or email and each outreach teacher timetables one emergency visit each week which is available should a crisis arise. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 47, "split_id": 201, "split_idx_start": 103794, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "18fe5886de3bdfc8e195f77fafbf8c812d1257457257139b7aa174ac1362f80a", "range": [487, 666]}, {"doc_id": "dffe1d4197677eed92165f00b5e40e6d7c8f672dd8272244f5cc315aecc33ecf", "range": [0, 202]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03160448372364044, -0.13592851161956787, -0.01694558560848236, 0.004561916459351778, -0.030651606619358063, 0.0343472920358181, 0.00025447693769820035, -0.052661530673503876, -0.0599200539290905, -0.014152229763567448, 0.0413222461938858, -0.045963190495967865, 0.03433721512556076, 0.018484320491552353, -0.017961986362934113, -0.10830128937959671, -0.011570095084607601, 0.004342525731772184, -0.08419880270957947, 0.013652597554028034, 0.004928719252347946, 0.03405723348259926, -0.013595042750239372, 0.03556836396455765, 0.007507476955652237, -0.033185672014951706, -0.010566332377493382, 0.034089911729097366, 0.05432499572634697, -0.009360270574688911, 0.015882983803749084, -0.004217245616018772, -0.01427034568041563, -0.018515005707740784, 2.439020363453892e-06, 0.03329785168170929, 0.008117358200252056, 0.0016828993102535605, -0.0007283499580807984, 0.00284934532828629, -0.049851953983306885, 