 by Barnados ( www.barnardos.org.uk/ cygnet.htm ). In addition, there are three stand-alone workshops run each term by the Outreach team based around the curriculum ( e.g. on revision skills, supporting siblings, puberty, intensive interaction). Most of these workshops take place during the day but once a term an evening session is provided for parents who work. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 50, "split_id": 214, "split_idx_start": 110037, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "93235cbfe073982ccae902d56cd97ebd3b7e153ffc675cbac5215e9c8cfa4eae", "range": [373, 403]}, {"doc_id": "4f7d632c5926b23ca7e32f7810c88733fa2cd3a8d35eba39ce5caab4a7d849fc", "range": [0, 119]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.011522249318659306, -0.10758566856384277, -0.025789447128772736, 0.006410782225430012, -0.04310915991663933, 0.048328038305044174, 0.04617127776145935, -0.028102876618504524, -0.04834415018558502, -0.007148674223572016, 0.014354366809129715, -0.0667816698551178, 0.03599273040890694, -0.035505685955286026, -0.058455027639865875, -0.05673935264348984, -0.015788087621331215, 0.0194849893450737, -0.10464885085821152, 0.016106892377138138, -0.008269889280200005, 0.025051027536392212, -0.031605400145053864, 0.03236692026257515, 0.01524093747138977, -0.048907045274972916, -0.008307644166052341, 0.023527391254901886, 0.04170350357890129, 0.013181271962821484, 0.04670443758368492, 0.011555732227861881, -0.02367057278752327, 0.012048403732478619, 2.352966248508892e-06, 0.03368964046239853, -0.00035826105158776045, -0.014741839841008186, -0.0075749242678284645, 0.022920925170183182, -0.011891397647559643, 0.021022967994213104, 0.03235098347067833, 0.062013063579797745, 0.021582569926977158, 0.013148500584065914, 0.029418474063277245, 0.051233697682619095, 0.0084775