and a good communication flow is enabled.\nThe school is involved in an Earwig pilot ( http://earwigacademic.com/) with Early Years. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 50, "split_id": 217, "split_idx_start": 111277, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "239be6c25d307aa9c2061d06350886873ce771dfe87660f385e296f0d65d6d17", "range": [431, 580]}, {"doc_id": "ccbee0df28c190095a1e78c593bed781a649f38b4575633098753f02a005b7d9", "range": [0, 90]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.02326289378106594, -0.06508615612983704, -0.024751558899879456, 0.014933577738702297, 0.012578995898365974, 0.021078011021018028, 0.03204866498708725, -0.03689882904291153, -0.05727791041135788, -0.007939954288303852, -0.026554333046078682, -0.008126916363835335, 0.039380863308906555, 0.019327698275446892, -0.02049645408987999, -0.04449053853750229, -0.01332740020006895, 0.005144145339727402, -0.04321838915348053, 0.05032265931367874, 0.007893071509897709, 0.033381253480911255, -0.0049055819399654865, 0.03567937761545181, -0.006090936250984669, -0.026669751852750778, 0.009512526914477348, 0.022963503375649452, 0.040666334331035614, -0.05141154304146767, 0.060617972165346146, 0.02662951871752739, -0.0006207243422977626, 0.04829714447259903, 2.4691635189810768e-06, 0.0396142415702343, 0.043838031589984894, -0.03289290890097618, -0.03161462023854256, -0.024679990485310555, -0.01998864859342575, 0.01121306512504816, 0.00860175583511591, 0.04585215449333191, -0.038323964923620224, -7.227851892821491e-05, 0.012098361738026142, 0.07059920579195023, 0.015395634807646275, -0.007264756131917238, -0.008361510001122952, -0.017602303996682167, 0.04144616797566414, -0.02293066680431366, 0.03743889555335045, 0.006016794126480818, -0.007195698097348213, -0.0017945559229701757, 0.0749591588973999, 0