 Plans. There is a SCERTS working group consisting of the Deputy Head, the SALT, an Outreach Team member, a number of teachers and three parents. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 51, "split_id": 220, "split_idx_start": 112764, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "97156b40ab68470719bcc0bad0973175961d793e4672e1b930f841423b7aab48", "range": [603, 651]}, {"doc_id": "6634ae07abda658d62fdaaea79b0250c02a79a1392be26ad787854506603b3de", "range": [0, 138]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03825967386364937, -0.08402330428361893, -0.029602115973830223, -0.00021965923951938748, 0.016436463221907616, 0.020401842892169952, 0.010108049027621746, -0.06389366090297699, -0.04074946790933609, 0.024230126291513443, 0.02945539355278015, -0.03528209775686264, -0.00955434050410986, 0.006918175611644983, 0.004496601410210133, -0.062381625175476074, 0.03529984876513481, 0.003072295105084777, -0.06012856215238571, 0.0056059397757053375, 0.026061363518238068, 0.03418652340769768, -0.004673618823289871, 0.02669724076986313, 0.02056770958006382, -0.047376785427331924, 0.003623806871473789, 0.004712766036391258, 0.048076413571834564, -0.03373076394200325, 0.03529604896903038, -0.0069379983469843864, 0.01651724800467491, 0.005851371679455042, 2.6965478809870547e-06, 0.040548767894506454, 0.0019938726909458637, -0.029243549332022667, -0.010635004378855228, -0.03771001100540161, -0.09251615405082703, 0.007791312411427498, 0.021736295893788338, 0.07018903642892838, 0.0004485319659579545, 0.016563065350055695, 0.024542540311813354, 0.05648338422179222, 0.02790452539920807, -0.030457057058811188, -0.008403239771723747, 0.028131041675806046, 0.011100254021584988, -0.03766656666994095, -0.03671251982450485, -0.023609112948179245, -0.011615113355219364, -0.06359738111495972, 0.0376