earning themes like space and the jungle.They use a checklist of strategies to support this:\nThe school has a member of staff who works with teachers to plan sensory environments to link to the curriculum. He runs the school sensory room; each class has a session in the room every week. The room was used by one teacher for a topic on space. The children were given space costumes to wear. Another topic covered was the jungle. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 52, "split_id": 227, "split_idx_start": 116051, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ddf2b5d88a218cd3182041836f97bdb68dbfa8c233b3de39a0ed7cec17b6c6a1", "range": [541, 706]}, {"doc_id": "c46c14832501eb72270ee667d9e33b5c5ca04071558658bdfeffb6dd426f168d", "range": [0, 38]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.05649701878428459, -0.10735752433538437, -0.036097098141908646, 0.014684596098959446, -0.01394854485988617, 0.03886685520410538, 0.017417622730135918, -0.025454219430685043, 0.002342293271794915, -0.012524386867880821, 0.006174544338136911, -0.015452631749212742, -0.0003582824720069766, 0.00690503790974617, -0.004233129788190126, -0.07091666758060455, 0.0009110421524383128, 0.02570660039782524, -0.07327718287706375, 0.017351344227790833, -0.05879287049174309, 0.007559529971331358, -0.011745555326342583, 0.03689140826463699, 0.06325377523899078, -0.0515715628862381, 0.021617863327264786, 0.01676647923886776, 0.007175728213042021, -0.072173111140728, 0.05255537107586861, -0.038602810353040695, 0.012817430309951305, -0.0329517163336277, 2.083296976707061e-06, 0.041549887508153915, 0.029188944026827812, -0.026454631239175797, 0.03002304956316948, -0.016964932903647423, 0.007641976699233055, 0.023474235087633133, 0.027684351429343224, 0.05041010305285454, -0.030877508223056793, -0.036168217658996