is part of the case study on Phoenix School, which focuses on their initiatives to support autistic girls. The school recognizes the unique needs of autistic females and has planned programs and events, including a conference and tailored workshops, to enhance social understanding among these students.The school has invited some autistic women to talk and they plan to have a professionals\u2019 conference on this topic in the future. They are also planning to have a working party for girls with representatives from different services. The SALT has organised an\n8-week programme for autistic girls. The programme is tailored to the group needs and their ages. There is a focus on social understanding. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 53, "split_id": 232, "split_idx_start": 117717, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "3432c5791cde37aeb6d1d7e99ce98edb51f5512b878208762b85f7020883d10d", "range": [409, 539]}, {"doc_id": "e80dae41d43ece462dd5c02231b2ea0792226630bfb81cc7e56781d8de3510e7", "range": [0, 42]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.021774178370833397, -0.05907749384641647, -0.01519593596458435, 0.025065384805202484, 0.023108340799808502, 0.034013986587524414, 0.025048960000276566, -0.05507231876254082, -0.03830637410283089, -0.006342418026179075, -0.002865669783204794, -0.04929077997803688, 0.004791365470737219, 0.007051094435155392, -0.02283204346895218, -0.04884903132915497, 0.020909739658236504, 0.01822013407945633, -0.0015754462219774723, 0.007585821207612753, 0.005403537768870592, 0.019401973113417625, -0.020004913210868835, 0.03625185042619705, 0.09097312390804291, -0.06664567440748215, 0.017769476398825645, -0.00016900536138564348, 0.027202079072594643, -0.025141723453998566, 0.03228587284684181, 0.008272352628409863, 0.014934725128114223,