rsonalized learning objectives.The SALT also works in the classroom, 34 classes in all.\nAll children at the school have an EHC plan. A few plans have specific speech and language elements built in. The SALT works in class with the pupils so that work can be followed through with the staff.\fGood Autism Practice Guide \u2013 Case Studies\n54 Doc ref: GAP report - case studies_I-S\nLearning and development\nP7 \u2013 Targeted support and measuring progress of children and young people on the autism spectrum\nLearning objectives are printed on students\u2019 work using symbols and words.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 53, "split_id": 236, "split_idx_start": 119031, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "55fec7f063a888917ee07dbe145ddbda7f8a77ca059ef15bf35a263c248902db", "range": [280, 337]}, {"doc_id": "e81c431660ddd1c3d2b7987ec10ceed39449da6394b8178290d3fb7df4f6879c", "range": [0, 281]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04090762510895729, -0.039158325642347336, -0.02341822348535061, -0.003247477812692523, -0.021563276648521423, 0.01465502381324768, 0.00563634792342782, -0.06013283133506775, -0.049501337110996246, 0.002288549905642867, 0.05365636199712753, -0.035776909440755844, 0.030888669192790985, -0.0010879483306780457, -0.029952842742204666, -0.08597971498966217, -0.015079091303050518, 0.01665223017334938, -0.03464863449335098, 0.016559338197112083, 0.0017059161327779293, 0.057999495416879654, -0.03554818779230118, 0.06005407124757767, 0.024478470906615257, -0.02511265128850937, 0.00420378427952528, 0.005821562837809324, 0.008967449888586998, -0.05211407691240311, 0.048878591507673264, 0.0324646458029747, -0.018277030438184738, -0.010140884667634964, 2.5138208457065048e-06, -0.0003738728992175311, 0.02228131890296936, -0.02117924951016903, -