ey need five minutes or whether they need time outside the room. Other scales allow students to identify whether they are working independently or need help. Children also have their own visual timetable. For some students this might just have now and next and for others, it might cover the whole day.\nThere are also learning support resources on desks including a checklist to develop independence and personal schedules also include who is supporting a child as well as a task list so that items can be moved from left to right when completed.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 60, "split_id": 259, "split_idx_start": 132546, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "5f42d0e6189a5230e2563723eeb530750a3057f7651cd986a03d1b9651927ed6", "range": [640, 794]}, {"doc_id": "01446fee851b929bedc429c8b26c71652e44e99ff61a79a1967129d5cfa9953c", "range": [0, 244]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.04194645956158638, -0.1296384036540985, -0.04603026807308197, -0.011516353115439415, -0.05434917286038399, 0.03290766105055809, 0.09109244495630264, -0.043680593371391296, -0.036593206226825714, 0.0228569358587265, 0.06315328180789948, -0.03353935480117798, -0.014142818748950958, 0.014560910873115063, -0.036707840859889984, -0.10463602095842361, -0.002200215356424451, 0.010432390496134758, -0.05747400224208832, 0.02187555655837059, -0.04345588758587837, 0.009079992771148682, -0.03131174296140671, 0.04325610771775246, 0.007258419878780842, -0.0626196339726448, 0.028903720900416374, 0.008877929300069809, 0.022829566150903702, -0.07627817243337631, 0.03977220505475998, 0.013176611624658108, -0.009092717431485653, 0.006494809873402119, 2.0332249732746277e-06, 0.0038918056525290012, 0.01724623702466488, -0.013179842382669449, -0.03368072211742401, -0.009672040119767189, -0.00326