in the box anonymously. This method does not require interaction.\nThe school is also developing a KS4-specific system of capturing accurate pupil voice that has a positive effect on individual outcomes. Pupils meet weekly with a trusted member of\fGood Autism Practice Guide \u2013 Case Studies\n61 Doc ref: GAP report - case studies_I-S\nstaff to be mentored and to have an opportunity to share their views and opinions. Staff feel that the impact of this is that the students feel listened to, they feel proud of their school and develop a sense of belonging. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 60, "split_id": 262, "split_idx_start": 133938, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "2133dbbf9c458509ab59efeab2bb4f0c0f62406a85f04b838dfbc3b7ab1a1138", "range": [372, 500]}, {"doc_id": "b83ae430dcff5c99d8b4dde881e32d79eddf6e25991de6a7ddb27cea21bd3d07", "range": [0, 140]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03732796758413315, -0.05472976714372635, -0.020628929138183594, 0.009633139707148075, -0.03091978281736374, 0.013709526509046555, 0.04136860743165016, -0.06472917646169662, -0.015209289267659187, 0.015531445853412151, 0.01772141456604004, -0.03092889115214348, 0.004493930842727423, 0.03581826761364937, 0.005806603003293276, -0.05498909577727318, -0.015717769041657448, 0.0034452322870492935, -0.06159437075257301, 0.03408462926745415, -0.010605602525174618, 0.032532621175050735, -0.032158657908439636, 0.03446127474308014, 0.002291209762915969, -0.03917995095252991, -0.007525070570409298, 0.0068135447800159454, 0.04559885337948799, -0.010762711986899376, 0.02365146391093731, 0.004663100466132164, -0.03330392390489578, 0.043740395456552505, 2.5095660021179356e-06, 0.05194539576768875, 0.020678644999861717, -0.004054500255733728, -0.059373289346694946, -0.007982226