practical, career-oriented projects, specifically highlighting the Engineering and Transport pathway and the Outdoor Learning pathway, aimed at enhancing their employability and life skills.Parents of those involved were provided with information about the project and confirmed their willingness for their son or daughter to take part.\nOn the Engineering and Transport pathway, a pupil would gain an IMI (Institute of Motor Industry) Level 1 qualification. The school has a fully functioning garage that the students work in with staff. Depending on their cognitive ability, they might then follow this pathway through to study at a Post-16 provision, for example at the local college.\nThe Outdoor Learning pathway sits alongside their core subjects of English, Maths and Science. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 62, "split_id": 267, "split_idx_start": 137062, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "f4f68d8df4379d677aadb6895f99634b1be59ec0785c97cb3cca7882ad691131", "range": [854, 1001]}, {"doc_id": "87a77ebcef8130a93a342e933dc77e42259cf780b0e6bd420054fa6337846832", "range": [0, 95]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.01379189919680357, -0.034838106483221054, -0.022201336920261383, -0.01243450678884983, 0.021451622247695923, 0.0240195170044899, 0.054878223687410355, -0.03596343845129013, -0.03622802719473839, 0.01043394673615694, 0.057508695870637894, 0.015330900438129902, 0.006092747673392296, -0.017579643055796623, -0.023118531331419945, -0.022419605404138565, -0.008915710262954235, -0.0250246562063694, -0.09278564900159836, 0.012754620052874088, -0.03400685265660286, 0.015382910147309303, -0.019417380914092064, 0.04901285842061043, -0.002661976730450988, -0.039167869836091995, 0.045996759086847305, 0.010596822015941143, 0.053234510123729706, -0.01132910