th their interests, emphasizing the expertise of staff supporting these pathways.If the student is studying for GCSEs, they still have the opportunity to follow some of the vocational pathway activities tailored to their interests.\nThe pathways are staffed mainly by teachers already working at the school. In the Outdoor Learning pathway, a qualified PE teacher works with the students. One teacher used to be a head chef in the RAF and she now teaches on the Catering pathway. Some teachers come into school to fill in the gaps in skills. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 62, "split_id": 270, "split_idx_start": 138545, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "128aa7517a1749249978abd946ee2ef74d481be897a40f8028fee3e6e260cce5", "range": [446, 597]}, {"doc_id": "4c00ce3144c79ac74a6ac321e9fee2b358e82b3c18bff973ce27768f3a6f08c0", "range": [0, 62]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0031870026141405106, -0.03800012543797493, 0.007475261576473713, -0.01886853016912937, -0.008318744599819183, 0.019905604422092438, -0.004171318374574184, -0.0166569035500288, -0.006207693833857775, 0.005584459751844406, 0.06027635559439659, 0.06649243831634521, -0.005679605063050985, -0.027922259643673897, -0.009145557880401611, -0.035243839025497437, -0.009161417372524738, -0.020196471363306046, -0.12384212762117386, 0.029566915705800056, -0.031606126576662064, 0.022308053448796272, -0.003663900773972273, 0.04669283702969551, -0.052427634596824646, -0.03902340307831764, 0.03995795547962189, 0.015708962455391884, 0.0597362294793129, 0.03283536061644554, 0.04499615728855133, -0.015534310601651669, -0.02040345035493374, -0.022982271388173103, 2.173656639570254e-06, 0.0690932348370552, -0.006510917097330093, -0.02072577364742756, -0.06668981164693832, -0.039906736463308334, -0.041034