so hoping to introduce a Childcare pathway next year.\nEighty-eight per cent of the pupils are on track to meet their targets on the pathway they have chosen. The impact will be measured over time as this has only been in place over this academic year.\nParents are very pleased with the pathways approach as they are keen for their child to be engaged in learning and then to go on to meaningful employment.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 63, "split_id": 273, "split_idx_start": 139874, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "c62a724ee0ebcbdf66a9514fc3a46b67c6629fd8e91238638e0ba87ce3e1db0f", "range": [476, 613]}, {"doc_id": "dc8a8369a3ea55a62016f76765ca362f0d65836cfc5b8c25c72e2cc54d58ee64", "range": [0, 155]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.016347333788871765, -0.05384254455566406, -0.028823288157582283, -0.016440605744719505, -0.024590743705630302, 0.03772934898734093, -0.011160790920257568, -0.016731366515159607, -0.024069197475910187, 0.004913749173283577, 0.059788599610328674, 0.06336493045091629, 0.0359078012406826, 0.0011273398995399475, -0.02572139911353588, -0.0074473959393799305, 0.004355903249233961, 0.005015282891690731, -0.11734074354171753, 0.04055319353938103, -0.05315559729933739, 0.0289873369038105, -0.013837815262377262, 0.03919845074415207, -0.05468904227018356, -0.037438154220581055, 0.022053513675928116, 0.03719058632850647, 0.05176885798573494, 0.002638090867549181, 0.06661176681518555, -0.006657221354544163, -0.010311613790690899, -0.01957879029214382, 2.334447344765067e-06, 0.04583892971277237, -0.03318990394473076, -0.009416008368134499, -0.059593528509140015, 0.017327168956398964, -0.0019069267436861992, 0.07090906798839569, -0.017242636531591415, 0.04564119130373001, 0.0212055966258049, 0.013024767860770226, 0.010621617