hn\u2019s family over many years and wanted to prepare John for attending the nursery. His parents were keen for John to attend mainstream school and were open to any suggestions and advice.\nThe nursery teacher attended the AET training on autism to prepare for working with John. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 66, "split_id": 281, "split_idx_start": 146369, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "959ee95f1b9f109b005de179e9d18a78a1266dfd0a83d54b903723b02a08ea42", "range": [495, 558]}, {"doc_id": "1a9419bc92af12096195eadda4e41619de49f748cb75c4c1b6e4790c19c92535", "range": [0, 90]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.013032414950430393, -0.07098516821861267, -0.030185429379343987, 0.02289908565580845, -0.011791878379881382, 0.04088296368718147, -0.0046374802477657795, -0.06179600581526756, -0.06203979253768921, -0.0013424045173451304, 0.057041727006435394, -0.05464586988091469, 0.030786752700805664, -0.003750427393242717, -0.022900355979800224, -0.0483553409576416, 0.009409812279045582, 0.040700413286685944, -0.036788225173950195, 0.02152811735868454, 0.0030223738867789507, 0.050347700715065, 0.006546498276293278, 0.01875309646129608, 0.01931190676987171, -0.011028834618628025, -0.01487928070127964, 0.009378080256283283, 0.04164211452007294, -0.02682148665189743, 0.039132289588451385, 0.01050408836454153, 0.018527144566178322, 0.013316947966814041, 2.662607130332617e-06, 0.04695739224553108, -0.013446959666907787, -0.025417044758796692, -0.02256457880139351, -0.030245283618569374, -0.07524962723255157, 0.013137725181877613, 0.02335217222571373, 0.05545715615153313, 0.0035518065560609102, -0.030924547463655472, 0.015623952262103558, 0.05121837556362152, 0.02375234104692936, -0.005082647781819105, 0.011065739206969738, 0.001635656924918294, 0.02678573