 practice.She feels that the materials were really clear and that having real case studies made it more accessible. She found the videos on the AET training really useful and these informed what she did in her own classroom. She also found the discussion and sharing ideas really useful and has benefitted from regular discussions with AET staff \u2018 who are so knowledgeable\u2019. The teacher commented that staff \u2018 often go on courses that mean nothing and she went on this and it was a light bulb moment\u2019. She said it inspired her to find out that small changes she could make straight away could make a big difference to a child.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "gap-report-case-studies_i-s.pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xo_7Q7LxUFHSLjQLhEE8MuxPnqGFEGEo", "source_id": "8bfe7c3cc9a918e195ac64f0cc2adc98cd589bcc8b9655b9f78b69ba9bfddeb0", "page_number": 68, "split_id": 291, "split_idx_start": 151032, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "045f89091914bdf0ad06f47309ae4ab07095bbae803844691eebb2db57f893b0", "range": [418, 524]}, {"doc_id": "b1e69bfa45074274c64d14c31ed32c63a0dc9d638a876bd559d1421a3a91d37a", "range": [0, 125]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0012289899168536067, -0.09548748284578323, -0.03678044676780701, 0.049003131687641144, 0.001303503173403442, 0.04456186667084694, -0.043247513473033905, -0.06764061748981476, -0.07354707270860672, 0.006184402387589216, 0.05302850157022476, -0.016295816749334335, 0.03304154798388481, -0.011899578385055065, 0.009529835544526577, -0.06553269922733307, -0.0037595019675791264, 0.05563133582472801, -0.06824370473623276, 0.050860244780778885, 0.022670794278383255, 0.03165481239557266, 0.0053795576095581055, 0.02118709310889244, 0.013907129876315594, 0.026922063902020454, -0.052675969898700714, 0.004818762186914682, 0.06691006571054459, -0.01280281413346529, 0.01412440650165081, 0.008640795946121216, 0.02662663720548153, 0.022159390151500702, 2.6520865503698587e-06, 0.0550533458590507