aimed at improving outcomes for autistic students.Principle Eight: Adapting the curriculum, teaching, and learning to promote wellbeing and success for autistic learners.\nPrinciple Two: Empowering autistic learners to be at the centre of decision-making about their education and to make informed decisions about their future.\nPrinciple Seven: Targeted support and measuring the progress of autistic learners.\nPrinciple Three: Ongoing and positive collaboration between the autistic learner, staff, a range of services, and parents/carers.\nPrinciple Six: An ethos and environment that fosters social inclusion for autistic learners.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 4, "split_id": 6, "split_idx_start": 4549, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "62f0420769e6ee4a893485cfdde47a35d79489065a2feb06dc2c6a56bc07b240", "range": [574, 695]}, {"doc_id": "bda900d4f050b0081a4a09989153d0fd382f6010b9999e62f8bda806fe019e19", "range": [0, 93]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.016206933185458183, -0.08916737884283066, -0.026569433510303497, 0.005055853631347418, 0.01470339484512806, 0.019311653450131416, 0.012227657251060009, -0.030722394585609436, -0.05891362950205803, -5.297706229612231e-05, 0.02876907028257847, -0.06886252015829086, 0.015692194923758507, -0.0021709459833800793, 0.0019068692345172167, -0.061063252389431, 0.02897515520453453, 0.027982108294963837, -0.011773897334933281, 0.006737112533301115, 0.011320081539452076, 0.023981820791959763, -0.04529211297631264, 0.029824791476130486, 0.039635203778743744, 0.000514787738211453, 0.01080386620014906, 0.014615905471146107, 0.025507891550660133, -0.03456397354602814, 0.027363646775484085, -0.0027171666733920574, 0.0005544768064282835, 0.006018035113811493, 2.2397850898414617e-06, 0.0162956863