lways progressing towards your goals and aspirations.\nMake sure staff know how to best support you.1 5\n2 6\n3 7\n4 8\fPost-16 Standards Framework\n5 Elective Topic based modules Making Sense of Autism Good Autism Practice Anxiety module\nExclusions module\nProgression framework\nModules\nStandards framework\nCompetency framework\nProgression framework\nE ditable framework documents\nSuite of resources for leaders Post-16\nThe AET Post-16 Standards are part of the AET Post-\n16 Professional Development Programme. This Programme contains a set of modules and materials for staff working with autistic learners in Post-16 provisions. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 5, "split_id": 9, "split_idx_start": 5937, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "2c500d169420be9845593aed2cefe06b8090716150e09abf33cb8f4b1290aa66", "range": [336, 408]}, {"doc_id": "9e59b27af54c44282f27514d4adedb989fb121bde91b7921aac00fe0a570960c", "range": [0, 119]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.02085382118821144, -0.0846337080001831, -0.020371103659272194, 0.005525277461856604, 0.02184510976076126, 0.0196305513381958, 0.0062608132138848305, -0.040911249816417694, -0.01714000105857849, 0.021776927635073662, 0.029324602335691452, -0.06858135014772415, -0.006804728880524635, 0.01562964916229248, -0.014757033437490463, -0.06019748002290726, 0.043275751173496246, 0.020859841257333755, -0.03580762445926666, 0.008786218240857124, 0.027198225259780884, 0.02451849728822708, -0.027004357427358627, 0.040386442095041275, 0.026735298335552216, -0.021753566339612007, 0.01637239009141922, 0.0027716541662812233, 0.057598236948251724, -0.033032096922397614, 0.026899605989456177, -0.010713736526668072, 0.011503350920975208, 0.026655079796910286, 2.5438316697545815e-06, 0.02468015626