fic standards, and creating actionable plans to enhance practices regarding autistic learners.We do this really well: This standard is well developed. 2. Use this information to decide which standards are most important to focus on in your provision. 3. Create a Next Steps Action Plan for the standards you are focusing on by documenting your actions for the standards that need improvement. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 7, "split_id": 14, "split_idx_start": 9344, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "0ddb312f2e491067b21c3edda6df29cc7fdce7e14187ff578d65e10fb269e2eb", "range": [568, 625]}, {"doc_id": "cfb2d31a7d50aed47308a44066fe682b50630ec09a339a711f64516fe72ffea5", "range": [0, 139]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.004518441390246153, -0.11066386103630066, -0.008510833606123924, 0.00580234918743372, -0.009054269641637802, 0.0350479781627655, 0.002620318438857794, -0.011423603631556034, -0.05707458779215813, -0.017119061201810837, 0.04198954999446869, -0.07118812948465347, 0.02773401327431202, 0.03215193375945091, -0.00986994244158268, -0.046863798052072525, 0.03705940768122673, 0.029510917142033577, -0.013060876168310642, 0.018883969634771347, 0.007219620980322361, 0.007425641641020775, -0.0430813767015934, 0.04174845293164253, 0.04432709887623787, 0.007817973382771015, 0.027584800496697426, 0.006165335886180401, 0.013971471227705479, -0.062479231506586075, 0.03895881026983261, 0.005458029452711344, -0.006227463483810425, -0.039742667227983475, 2.2008607629686594e-06, -0.007830774411559105, -0.011222830042243004, -0.013863557018339634, 0.021876851096749306, 0.005553876049816608, -0.06591279804706573, 0.027446068823337555, 0.01836257614195347, 0.06783334165811539, -0.020007766783237457, -0.041481632739305496, -0.00668196380138