dentify the right tools to do so. S3. The person-centred approaches we use are co-created with the autistic learner and enable the autistic learner to self-advocate and communicate their future aspirations in terms of community, housing, work, and relationships.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 9, "split_id": 17, "split_idx_start": 10356, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "4ce83be3d72fd770a3610e1f76bcfeddfa08d9c2417a4078de2b01d4d30d28f6", "range": [622, 779]}, {"doc_id": "48c16cb0c9ed1b5fd7d5cabe84423bdab6b99b0d5a9989f842422f150fcda293", "range": [0, 225]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0338759571313858, -0.08244112879037857, -0.01869373396039009, -0.018106596544384956, 0.00921562872827053, 0.019534269347786903, 0.029542777687311172, -0.050628483295440674, -0.04821505770087242, 0.012945163063704967, 0.042355652898550034, -0.06335057318210602, -0.016596773639321327, -0.033414326608181, 0.013110347092151642, -0.052219707518815994, 0.034000325947999954, 0.02708401530981064, 0.0069694845005869865, 0.0029269594233483076, 0.009868873283267021, 0.02740200236439705, -0.026308568194508553, 0.05035729706287384, 0.018503893166780472, -0.024985987693071365, 0.026128700003027916, -0.0002485167933627963, 0.024630598723888397, -0.04574848338961601, 0.042070187628269196, 0.009569482877850533, 0.015352086164057255, -0.002670161658897996, 2.2327815258904593e-06, 0.012755495496094227, 0.019016411155462265, -0.02390642836689949, -0.025789473205804825, -0.030781924724578857, -0.03942478820681572, 0.027550581842660904, 0.03700718283653259, 0.05594203621149063, -0.028632752597332, -0.014782557263970375, 0.017071006819605827, 0.06779030710458755, -0.0003054726112168282, 0.011357264593243599, -0.010114766657352448, 0.021645275875926018, 0.03085995