ng differences. They can experience high levels of anxiety and stress, and these can create barriers to learning. I know that autistic learners may display behaviour based on a combination of factors and I work hard to understand the causes and functions of the behaviour. C4. I see the autistic learner as a partner in their learning and actively involve them as part of the \u2018Assess, Plan, Do, Review\u2019 cycle so that the autistic learner is at the centre of educational planning.\f", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 9, "split_id": 21, "split_idx_start": 11897, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "b6ff4448959eee3547ef52f25e64bf1b663be4b51018d0b195910a8aba360895", "range": [268, 339]}, {"doc_id": "77fc65d5bdf92e35ca8cc608c5a903afd32df8d6f33622d08cf7504c3ec2d9c1", "range": [0, 203]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [-0.006988076958805323, -0.09686384350061417, -0.031212955713272095, -0.0005823426181450486, 0.013829769566655159, 0.041777633130550385, 0.02378225140273571, -0.034342873841524124, -0.019875720143318176, 0.01871279999613762, 0.01136207114905119, -0.0665557011961937, -0.008084886707365513, -0.0030937972478568554, -0.010601350106298923, -0.05388348922133446, 0.02473447285592556, 0.0010845472570508718, 0.02728414349257946, 0.009564447216689587, -0.002981402212753892, 0.030689995735883713, -0.039304137229919434, 0.03071160428225994, 0.01696617901325226, -0.04336797073483467, 0.006566541735082865, 0.020314306020736694, 0.029307371005415916, -0.061333052814006805, 0.012893675826489925, 0.018415315076708794, 0.008971045725047588, 0.03761031851172447, 2.507819999664207e-06, 0.011264462023973465, -0.003093285718932748, -0.03008214943110943, -0.02286352962255478, -0.02510916255414486, -0.05019097030162811, 0.026630358770489693, 0.