c learner(s) I work with.\fPost-16 Standards Framework\n10 Enabling environments\nSTANDARDS COMPETENCIES\nSTANDARDS COMPETENCIES\nPrinciple Five: Leadership and management that promotes and embeds Good Autism Practice.\nPrinciple Six: An ethos and environment that fosters social inclusion for autistic learners.\nS9. We promote a supportive, enabling environment in which all staff are knowledgeable about autism and we empower staff to approach senior staff when their input is required.\n", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 10, "split_id": 27, "split_idx_start": 14390, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "61bafaf7e5f03eb9257e5a6f95d2352b11b4cfd77a5eeec7851d225aea6266d3", "range": [402, 626]}, {"doc_id": "edf6774d0584e053aebfeed333ccd7d3b2cf4dd4de0858d3c23d136e3173cd37", "range": [0, 172]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03514756262302399, -0.1051296666264534, -0.030393213033676147, -0.0003205030516255647, 0.018577631562948227, 0.03874249756336212, 0.022212672978639603, -0.020773619413375854, -0.0277420487254858, 0.04396035894751549, 0.03208735212683678, -0.04005929455161095, 0.00814731139689684, 0.0077881477773189545, 0.01513760443776846, -0.05656519532203674, 0.036040935665369034, 0.0401647686958313, -0.039287351071834564, 0.024556921795010567, 0.010693982243537903, 0.022923137992620468, -0.01970141939818859, 0.037023358047008514, 0.03481735289096832, -0.024686172604560852, 0.034467991441488266, 0.003328300779685378, 0.02253580652177334, -0.026406846940517426, 0.0365014411509037, -0.027878940105438232, 0.008699540980160236, -0.026889091357588768, 2.117748408636544e-06, 0.028292549774050713, 0.0038397156167775393, -0.022056063637137413, 0.003714382415637374, -0.05073994770646095, -0.06040776148438454, 0.0336177721619606, 0.020507486