educational settings tailored to the unique needs of autistic learners, facilitating their engagement in activities that promote independence and future employment pathways.We are constantly mindful of adapting to the needs of individual autistic learners.\nC10. I support the autistic learner to engage in opportunities to participate in college and community activities, and I enable autistic learners to develop skills to support independence and pathways to employment.\nC12. I create structured, predictable, and calm environments. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 11, "split_id": 31, "split_idx_start": 15932, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "f1fcf3cce46cf3c029306c7e7b4026219eef92f7de6e5daca704e3ef83818b1f", "range": [354, 438]}, {"doc_id": "707c4e50deb8fe9813273a3d875d0f15740a0ef7be13bfa350458cf6d534a4f0", "range": [0, 57]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.01008648332208395, -0.11219281703233719, -0.0300845168530941, -0.007884589955210686, 0.009645247831940651, 0.03596741333603859, 0.05660349130630493, -0.029955271631479263, -0.027986565604805946, 0.005196227692067623, 0.031340427696704865, -0.043582793325185776, 0.0038627362810075283, -0.00618679728358984, 0.0008009080193005502, -0.03348695859313011, 0.04578696936368942, 0.041268981993198395, -0.06344777345657349, 0.01940537989139557, -0.02263648249208927, 0.01987726055085659, -0.04704676941037178, 0.036562830209732056, 0.04797973856329918, -0.031185783445835114, 0.046989556401968, -0.0012337850639596581, -0.020307863131165504, -0.028106948360800743, 0.05443881079554558, -0.015011241659522057, 0.020293865352869034, -0.04815477505326271, 2.1709756765631028e-06, 0.011866522952914238, 0.001604957738891244, -0.01930164359509945, -0.013588834553956985, -0.03307588770985603, -0.0