nce and track progress in their educational journey.S14. We work with autistic learners to complete a person-\ncentred learner profile and specialist learner support plan in partnership with key staff members, and we ensure that these are regularly reviewed to monitor progress. S16. We use assistive technology to enable autistic learners to take control of their learning journey and to gain independence.\nC14. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 12, "split_id": 35, "split_idx_start": 17471, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "7dc557e3ade5eab48736a0cc986dd89159f959eab6ba4c97b6547e101091bd46", "range": [310, 315]}, {"doc_id": "1544b30d2fb34b7c148e34b92e2bf90e85fd549166491b474d661e673e86efb3", "range": [0, 5]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03162917494773865, -0.1069638654589653, -0.03375382348895073, -0.0177686158567667, -0.020862897858023643, 0.02351193130016327, 0.06160543113946915, -0.047134075313806534, -0.03136443719267845, 0.0005463890265673399, 0.04857068508863449, -0.0663338229060173, 0.017019303515553474, 0.013471209444105625, 0.023392438888549805, -0.0716855600476265, 0.041720740497112274, 0.022089045494794846, -0.023997977375984192, 0.026017965748906136, -0.0010328931966796517, 0.02505251206457615, -0.053593795746564865, 0.04510641470551491, 0.023335542529821396, -0.021571874618530273, 0.024704277515411377, -0.006384911481291056, 0.003739077365025878, -0.054675955325365067, 0.042723964899778366, -0.010249628685414791, 0.01638180762529373, 0.018675170838832855, 2.1418288724817103e-06, -0.007972394116222858, 0.016415709629654884, -0.027598485350608826, -0.027697661891579628, -0.020811306312680244, -0.05412237346172333, 0.03465815261006355, 0.054483793675899506, 0.05672852694988251, -0.016198541969060898, -0.0087212659418