onal provision, the college must use its best endeavours to put appropriate support in place. Young people should be supported to participate in discussions about their aspirations, their needs, and the support that they think will help them best (SEND Code of Practice, 2015:114). As young people develop [...] they should be involved more and more closely in decisions about their own future (SEND Code of Practice, 2015:126).\nWe support young people to develop and use effective communication systems that reflect their level of understanding, and we use a range of tools to capture their voice (e.g.", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 18, "split_id": 44, "split_idx_start": 23196, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "ad11c841feb72a821769e4e572f6457c1ed6171d7adb1247ebe6617d71d80367", "range": [845, 916]}, {"doc_id": "e92ef90c8fe5555c12f13885f1aef5d403f769a42cc6a32feb0f3723f941a3ad", "range": [0, 174]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.016932709142565727, -0.1013832688331604, -0.021444518119096756, 0.0195799320936203, 0.00011317492317175493, 0.05038825422525406, 0.03953661024570465, -0.03641233593225479, -0.01932458020746708, 0.0020189001224935055, 0.0610031895339489, -0.08846969902515411, -0.004207727033644915, 0.032283756881952286, -0.007475108839571476, -0.019379545003175735, 0.014854724518954754, 0.014053590595722198, -0.013712606392800808, 0.014292133040726185, -0.002777476329356432, 0.02711533010005951, -0.032902661710977554, 0.045224111527204514, 0.03162747621536255, -0.033368222415447235, 0.0047784107737243176, 0.013746390119194984, 0.01994957961142063, -0.01980086788535118, 0.029492447152733803, -0.0039010068867355585, 0.015229728072881699, -0.01676042005419731, 2.178265958718839e-06, 0.016011158004403114, -0.0009578503668308258