42473, -0.009353568777441978, 0.031239919364452362, 0.022045457735657692, -0.05019688233733177, -0.004729096777737141, 0.02462460659444332, 0.0191089678555727, 0.03202269971370697, -0.02876126952469349, -0.005296715069562197, -0.04248615354299545, 0.017246687784790993, -0.05219350382685661, 0.07282424718141556, 0.0043669636361300945, -0.012014115229249, -0.006996225565671921, 0.016101311892271042, -0.004936367738991976, -0.03346144035458565, -0.06752590090036392, 0.009324226528406143, 2.059917244515524e-34, -0.01593637838959694, 0.003938465844839811, 0.03887059912085533, -0.05566097050905228, 0.012083158828318119, -0.001632892177440226, 0.02538246661424637, 0.016960743814706802, -0.009423421695828438, -0.0308908149600029, -0.022601228207349777], "sparse_embedding": null}, {"id": "1af4daa5b39f28a5770adbbd89d25e4345091dac24a1571b6761e30d4282e81a", "content": "This chunk is part of the \"Understanding the learner\" section in the Post-16 Standards Framework, focusing on the importance of following the tiered approach in the SEND Code of Practice. It emphasizes the need for evidence-based support tailored to individual learners with Special Educational Needs (SEN) or disabilities, highlighting the cyclical process of assessing, planning, and evaluating support.Evidence to show how we meet this standard:\fPost-16 Standards Framework\n19 Understanding the learner\nWe follow the tiered approach in the SEND Code of Practice and are confident in collecting \u2018Assess, Plan, Do, Review\u2019 evidence for our own records and submitting to external professionals.\nSupport should be evidence based. This means that colleges should be aware of effective practice in the sector and elsewhere and personalise it for the individual. They should keep the needs of learners with SEN or disabilities under regular review. Colleges should take a cyclical approach to assessing need, planning and providing support, and reviewing and evaluating that support so that it can be adjusted where necessary. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 19, "split_id": 47, "split_idx_start": 25497, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "737f6012218354d9e8b6da7031f1423fd3449ba3dd924696f6b9b110f31fda91", "range": [939, 1229]}, {"doc_id": "d9d306941ca60cac3bccb7d045e712cc4e47f9b0a07fa84b999e6afb57417c23", "range": [0, 178]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.010722692124545574, -0.10735661536455154, -0.01665119268000126, 0.013108531944453716, -0.02297171577811241, 0.05653258040547371, 0.03442980721592903, -0.03325049206614494, 0.012942168861627579, -0.00962501298636198, 0.1048601046204567, -0.03525742515921593, 0.033559516072273254, 0.01981482468545437, 0.012657134793698788, -0.063335120677948, 0.01598137989640236, 0.03949617221951485, -0.01636071689426899, 0.013107321225106716, -0.007937154732644558, -0.003078586421906948, -0.06145816668868065, -0.002230531070381403, 0.029269682243466377, -0.061213843524456024, 0.01275007613003254, 0.01225457713007927, 0.012063722126185894, -0.04197541996836662, 0.02596680447459221, 0.026773754507303238, 0.007493002340197563, -0.04634177312254906, 2.0993554699089145e-06, 0.016718968749046326, 0.01891499012708664, 0.00757245160639286, -0.034522876143455505, -0.03699689358472824, -0.04968538507819176, 0.021856633946299553, 0.008213518187403679, 0.04305725917220116, -0.003294822294265032, 0.042149581015110016, 0.017038395628333092, -0.02763391099870205, -0.013445266522467136, -0.0021675596944987774, -0.00633261539041996, -0.00535628292709589, -0.004536328837275505, -0.012544688768684864, 0.005049704108387232, 0.023173736408352852, 0.0010834711138159037, -0.06537861377000809, 0.007661374751478434, 0.05320674553513527, -0.0036138861905783415, 0.04041336849331856, 0.01455907616764307, -0.0334833562374115, -0.01762