ence of working on this standard? We document evidence of working on this standard through assessment results, the production of resources, case studies, learner profiles, and the goals we co-\ncreate with autistic learners and parents/carers (where appropriate/possible), and by documenting our reasonable adjustments and the impact of those.\nEvidence to show how we meet this standard:\fPost-16 Standards Framework\n30 Theme three: Enabling environments\fPost-16 Standards Framework\n31 Enabling environments\nWe encourage reflective management of staff and resources. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 29, "split_id": 63, "split_idx_start": 38147, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "5e6ade2d4ded87159210ba0251445c78b76d45340ca9dc360f0485e95066ebaf", "range": [778, 1095]}, {"doc_id": "f9039e066ca84fcb6194bcb5e29bad08fe5b79ed65fa3026937895a792be67a8", "range": [0, 222]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.0365288071334362, -0.11433254182338715, -0.013374494388699532, -0.0018313558539375663, -0.015243535861372948, 0.04058986157178879, 0.024744534865021706, -0.010198723524808884, -0.06900200247764587, 0.01248993631452322, 0.045369163155555725, -0.02720261551439762, 0.02897925302386284, -0.005394916515797377, 0.031557802110910416, -0.07080266624689102, 0.02947145886719227, 0.04951675981283188, -0.03632436320185661, 0.028485508635640144, 0.008902205154299736, 0.02074331045150757, -0.020116863772273064, 0.045457858592271805, 0.004514920525252819, -0.020637089386582375, 0.021801378577947617, 0.016935361549258232, 0.026250068098306656, -0.028706593438982964, 0.02408272959291935, -0.011076165363192558, -0.011634184047579765, -0.0489540658891201, 2.08209348784294e-06, 0.024510230869054794, 0.002366348635405302, -0.010428647510707378, -0.002528357