ecording autistic learners\u2019 progress and achievement, including employability skills, to support them towards their future goals.\nROOM FOR IMPROVEMENT\nDEVELOPING WE DO THIS REALLY WELL\nExamples of how we do this: Link to statutory framework\nOur curriculum makes use of work-based learning, such as work experience placements and apprenticeships, to prepare autistic learners for employment. The use and choice of accreditation supports progression. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 41, "split_id": 80, "split_idx_start": 50003, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "8a8e8932d935ea417b3677e2fc5d4b0abc640360eedaf931c051fa8d4b71b545", "range": [706, 867]}, {"doc_id": "c38c1ed972bd748edfa17b56dc7c601332f09a37f0a93e4ab9772d8a7aec5f44", "range": [0, 58]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.022716093808412552, -0.0811828151345253, -0.018360057845711708, -0.01889655739068985, 0.008749585598707199, 0.0373130738735199, 0.05039440467953682, -0.03688056394457817, -0.05903908610343933, 0.01441361103206873, 0.03615015000104904, -0.04539762809872627, 0.020852871239185333, -0.01123393140733242, 0.0136482585221529, -0.05093327537178993, 0.0377921536564827, 0.02948007546365261, -0.041616201400756836, 0.017221689224243164, -0.01428000908344984, 0.009293469600379467, -0.04574150964617729, 0.04621616005897522, 0.03105572611093521, -0.030758559703826904, 0.04585980623960495, -0.00966370478272438, 0.012269615195691586, -0.032429419457912445, 0.02942015789449215, -0.004359578713774681, 0.008666527457535267, 0.004611390642821789, 2.12731106330466e-06, 0.0018841174896806479, 0.023811059072613716, -0.014796333387494087, -0.00992349162697792, -0.0029182503931224346, -0.06808996200561523, 0.011760719120502472, 0.024637557566165924, 0.08037974685430527, -0.01