ard:\fPost-16 Standards Framework\n48 Additional resources Please click here to access: \u2022 AET resources and templates\n\u2022 External resources\n\u2022 Useful websites\n\u2022 Legislation and guidance\n\u2022 Videos\fPost-16 Standards Framework\n49 Author and acknowledgements\nA note on authorship: The AET standards have been co-created with a number of people. Professor Karen Guldberg was lead author, but the standards are the result of input from many people representing a range of perspectives. We are grateful to all those who have been involved in creating and co-authoring these frameworks. Co-creators have included the AET\u2019s Autistic Young Experts panel who have provided input on key concepts, ideas and terminology. Staff from Weston College have provided invaluable input into the development of content, advice on drafts and have shared templates and resources with us. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 48, "split_id": 92, "split_idx_start": 59125, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "d4aea764e1a234d89b50ad962571a7b2914fc7d3748e45b19b0058732c517cce", "range": [838, 1213]}, {"doc_id": "96e41281082115bc6e92621572314bdd1d17def3d22da166b54beaba1c6bf141", "range": [0, 156]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.03845300152897835, -0.09751589596271515, -0.0024522505700588226, 0.0050843157805502415, -0.009557371959090233, 0.04466703161597252, 0.05032404884696007, -0.0045153554528951645, -0.02687821164727211, 0.004428568296134472, 0.059494033455848694, -0.03289467468857765, 0.018789567053318024, -0.03976651281118393, 0.022204212844371796, -0.023038603365421295, 0.013051044195890427, 0.06303110718727112, -0.009553858079016209, 0.01088038831949234, 0.00602188054472208, 0.041798826307058334, -0.015829093754291534, 0.0332450941205