, training, and consultancy.Michelle Collard is Training & Consultancy Manager at Ambitious about Autism. She has over 12 years of experience working as a senior leader, researcher, and trainer in education and residential settings specialising in supporting autistic children, young people and adults.\nCatherine Leggett , Training Consultant at Ambitious about Autism is an experienced autism and employment consultant and trainer who has worked with employers and employees nationwide as a specialist optimising autistic people\u2019s strengths at work since 2014. Cath was diagnosed autistic in 2015 and has an adult autistic child.\nLeila Morne is an Advanced Autism Practitioner and a Lecturer in Autism Practice at Weston College, University Centre Weston. ", "dataframe": null, "blob": null, "meta": {"file_path": "Post-16-Standards-Framework_T-HUB-Sc-Mt (1).pdf", "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J2sZ87itIDhKcF_wmZN2TcBeZRLjlMJP", "source_id": "8c4c774884107306cf77966fe0ff24690d0139f6223da0babe2c1bcd4b2a95b5", "page_number": 50, "split_id": 95, "split_idx_start": 60774, "_split_overlap": [{"doc_id": "04899aba48ec841b7b78ac41253f86e88ae80c5411ef2cd7a3809b1353e64d69", "range": [310, 388]}, {"doc_id": "059ae58404448a33f3c8efbc871630fb0c3d07074ee5aa29b5629d279962b9c8", "range": [0, 126]}]}, "score": null, "embedding": [0.021670900285243988, -0.06700407713651657, -0.03399939835071564, 0.003624242963269353, 0.03598184883594513, 0.008792493492364883, 0.018145620822906494, -0.02677103877067566, -0.020590951666235924, 0.013525825925171375, 0.0258380975574255, -0.05343049764633179, -0.001825499115511775, 0.0033441144041717052, 0.003419692860916257, -0.06109161674976349, 0.028737805783748627, 0.02899344265460968, -0.02756798453629017, 0.007997454144060612, 0.023026378825306892, 0.04613106697797775, -0.03367585688829422, 0.03954525664448738, 0.010630990378558636, -0.013723578304052353, 0.02307531051337719, 0.006851487327367067, 0.0425461120903492, -0.04126250743865967, 0.04